 developing genetically modified crops on the island of Kauai.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mayor of Kauai County, Hawaii, has vetoed a hotly contested bill that would have restricted the use of pesticides by companies developing genetically modified crops on the island. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Limiting Pesticide Use on Hawaii Island Is Vetoed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bill Limiting Pesticide Use On Hawaii Island Is Vetoed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kauai (Hawaii)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pesticides', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetic Engineering', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-01T01:37:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c3e9467-91a1-59c2-8914-107611b0e10e', 'word_count': 330, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c3e9467-91a1-59c2-8914-107611b0e10e'}, {'abstract': 'The Palestinian negotiators on Thursday offered to resign in protest over the continuing construction of Israeli settlements, but the Palestinian president, Mahmoud Abbas, was not likely to accept them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/01/world/middleeast/palestinians-in-peace-talks-with-israel-offer-resignations.html', 'snippet': 'The Palestinian negotiators on Thursday offered to resign in protest over the continuing construction of Israeli settlements, but the Palestinian president, Mahmoud Abbas, was not likely to accept them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — The Palestinian negotiators engaged in peace talks with Israel offered their resignations on Thursday in protest over the continuing construction of Israeli settlements and what Palestinians say is a lack of strong American action on this issue, according to an official involved in the process.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Palestinians in Peace Talks With Israel Offer Resignations', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Palestinians In Peace Talks With Israel Are Resigning', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABBAS, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Israeli Settlements', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Jerusalem', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-01T01:37:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/304c573b-6ebc-52f8-9981-26f442c487cb', 'word_count': 498, 'uri': 'nyt://article/304c573b-6ebc-52f8-9981-26f442c487cb'}, {'abstract': 'Justin Fornal, a.k.a. Baron Ambrosia, roves the Bronx’s ethnic enclaves in search of homegrown restaurants, and he has cast some of his favorites in a new movie.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/01/nyregion/a-colorful-food-lovers-feast-for-the-eyes-starring-flavors-of-the-bronx.html', 'snippet': 'Justin Fornal, a.k.a. Baron Ambrosia, roves the Bronx’s ethnic enclaves in search of homegrown restaurants, and he has cast some of his favorites in a new movie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The man in the purple suit knocked insistently until the metal door finally swung open on a recent afternoon. He bounded down the steps to a basement pool hall in the Bronx, where a worn lunch counter served some of the tastiest pork-and-okra stews and braised goat outside of the Dominican Republic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/01/nyregion/01ambrosia-01/01ambrosia-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/01/nyregion/01ambrosia-01/01ambrosia-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/01/nyregion/01ambrosia-01/01ambrosia-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/01/nyregion/01ambrosia-01/01ambrosia-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/01/nyregion/01ambrosia-01/01ambrosia-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/01/nyregion/01ambrosia-01/01ambrosia-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thu