rt of a United States-led effort.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/02/world/asia/indonesia-summons-australian-envoy-on-spying-reports.html', 'snippet': 'A furor is growing over reports that Australian Embassies carried out intelligence-gathering missions in several Asian nations as part of a United States-led effort.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JAKARTA, Indonesia — Indonesia’s Ministry of Foreign Affairs summoned Australia’s ambassador on Friday to respond to news media reports that Australia’s embassy in Jakarta was used as part of a United States-led spying effort, saying such actions were “not acceptable” and had harmed its diplomatic relations with both countries.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Indonesia Confronts Australian Ambassador on Reports of Spying', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Indonesia Confronts Australian Ambassador on Reports of Spying', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cochrane, Joe', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-01T09:55:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Cochrane', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cochra