lms confront the primal concern of staying alive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/movies/gravity-all-is-lost-and-other-films-face-death.html', 'snippet': 'After summer’s postapocalyptic cinema, four new films confront the primal concern of staying alive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not always, but every now and then, the movies tell us what’s on our minds almost before we know ourselves. After a summer of postapocalyptic films in which the earth became a labor camp or else was overrun by zombies, we now have, just in time for the holiday season, four exceptionally good movies that are concerned just with surviving. They’re not about victory but about merely enduring, getting through some bad days and then some even worse ones, with a little help at the very end, perhaps, but mostly on your own.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03MCGRATH4/03MCGRATH4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 303, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03MCGRATH4/03MCGRATH4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 303}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03MCGRATH4/03MCGRATH4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 517, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03MCGRATH4/03MCGRATH4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1034, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03MCGRATH4/03MCGRATH4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 