None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c64dff3-2842-5469-aa2a-88d6a587bf7f', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c64dff3-2842-5469-aa2a-88d6a587bf7f'}, {'abstract': 'Spike Jonze discusses the evolution of “Her,” the first feature that he has written and directed by himself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/movies/spike-jonze-discusses-evolution-of-her.html', 'snippet': 'Spike Jonze discusses the evolution of “Her,” the first feature that he has written and directed by himself.', 'lead_paragraph': '“When I was 20 years old, I had no plans to ever be a filmmaker,” said the director Spike Jonze, cozy in a cotton button-down oxford shirt and a crew-neck sweatshirt, even on a stiff couch in a bland, beige Hell’s Kitchen video-editing suite. “Me and my friends had BMX magazines and skate magazines, and I was a photographer who made skate videos. There was just no way that would have ever even crossed my mind.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03HILLS1_SPAN/03HILLS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03HILLS1_SPAN/03HILLS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03HILLS1_SPAN/03HILLS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/arts/03HILLS1_SPAN/03HILLS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2025, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 