ration officer was killed, at least one terminal was evacuated, flights were grounded, and several other people were sent to the hospital with injuries after a shooting at Los Angeles International Airport on Friday, the authorities said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Descriptions of Chaos and Fear at Los Angeles Airport Shooting', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shooting (Sport)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles International Airport', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Police Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transportation Security Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-01T18:54:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f782372-453e-5efc-8abf-d2da802b189b', 'word_count': 449, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f782372-453e-5efc-8abf-d2da802b189b'}, {'abstract': 'Nationally recognized poets will gather in South Huntington, where a literary giant was born in 1819.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/nyregion/in-whitmans-backyard-a-salute-to-poetry.html', 'snippet': 'Nationally recognized poets will gather in South Huntington, where a literary giant was born in 1819.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Faith Lieberman is a poet and former teacher, among other things, who in the late 1990s discovered that she also had a talent for organization. Starting in 1997, she put together three poetry festivals in Huntington, the last of which was shortly after the attacks of Sept. 11, 2001, and resonated with the trauma of that event, she said. “I felt I needed a rest,” said Ms. Lieberman, who lives in Lloyd Harbor.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 877, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 877}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 701, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/nyregion/03ARTSLI1_SPAN/03ARTSLI1_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarg