und” last week in the Missed Connections section of newyork.craigslist.org.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Children relish Halloween for the candy, but as patrons of a Ricky’s store know, adults prefer a salacious Sailor Moon costume to a Mars bar. These poems about the holiday’s erotic underpinnings were “found” last week in the Missed Connections section of newyork.craigslist.org. They are printed verbatim, with only line and stanza breaks added; their titles are the subject headings.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Attraction Unmasked', 'kicker': 'Poetic Connections | Halloween', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Attraction Unmasked', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feuer, Alan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Halloween', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Craigslist', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-01T19:34:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Feuer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feuer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85893f25-b656-5d8a-a4d7-b91e604a2921', 'word_count': 278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85893f25-b656-5d8a-a4d7-b91e604a2921'}, {'abstract': 'The actor Ben Schnetzer talks about his first big role, in “The Book Thief,” which opens on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/movies/ben-schnetzer-on-the-book-thief.html', 'snippet': 'The actor Ben Schnetzer talks about his first big role, in “The Book Thief,” which opens on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 