 lumberjack plaids and checks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A tiptop autumn week of color in New York, what with the foliage, Halloween and the art of carving pumpkins, the arrival of marathon runners and the abundance of lumberjack plaids and checks. In Paris, the rage is patchwork jeans from Junya Watanabe, but people could just as well make their own patchwork. In Central Park, a headless horseman rides again.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Costumery', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Costumery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-01T20:37:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/88370a8a-6513-5716-a192-a75ebf4bbefc', 'word_count': 61, 'uri': 'nyt://article/88370a8a-6513-5716-a192-a75ebf4bbefc'}, {'abstract': 'A four-bedroom condominium with a corner living room commands 40 feet of park frontage.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/01/big-ticket-treetop-park-views-for-16-million/', 'snippet': 'A four-bedroom condominium with a corner living room commands 40 feet of park frontage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Another of the floor-through luxury residences at 18 Gramercy Park with direct treetop views, along with dibs on a special key permitting access to that private and historic park, sold for $16 million and was the most expensive sale of the week, according to city records. The 4,207-square-foot 