1/now-online-ts-luxury-issue/', 'snippet': 'In our latest issue, we explore the many definitions of luxury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In our latest issue, we explore the many definitions of luxury. Our cover story features Saoirse Ronan, the Irish actress on the brink of adulthood who has upcoming films with Wes Anderson and Ryan Gosling and an Oscar nomination already under her belt. Countess Marina Cicogna — the 79-year-old Italian who is also an award-winning movie producer, photographer of the jet set and hostess of truly legendary parties — shows us that glamour has no age limit. We head to Tbilisi, Georgia, where a shiny new skyline is rising from centuries of architectural history. In China we meet Melvin Chua, the man who is connecting the world’s luxury brands with the world’s fastest-growing consumer market. In Milan, we visit one of the last truly Old World interiors firms, Studio Peregalli, and in Belgium designer Michael Verheyden shares the objects he creates, which are imbued with remarkable beauty and spiritual power. Finally, we check in with one of the greatest icons of luxury, Giorgio Armani, cataloging the reach of his multibillion-dollar empire and the pleasures of his sweet, sweet life.See all stories from the issue >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'T’s Luxury Issue', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-02T00:14:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d548de04-a50d-5766-9993-a157ed89f08e', 'word_count': 185, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d548de04-a50d-5766-9993-a157ed89f08e'}, {'abstract': 'Afte