of his contract, will be interested in staying in Miami.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/02/sports/basketball/a-decision-may-rest-on-wades-knees.html', 'snippet': 'If Dwyane Wade is unable to return to his dominant ways, there is a question of whether LeBron James, who can opt out of his contract, will be interested in staying in Miami.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the biggest questions posed when LeBron James signed with the Miami Heat was whether he was giving up his alpha dog status to win an N.B.A. title. At the time, it was unthinkable that the larger-than-life James could supplant Dwyane Wade as the face of the franchise.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/02/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/02/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/02/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/02/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1770, 'width': 1274, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/02/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/02/sports/Y-SCORE/Y-SCORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'c