ld result in unexpected braking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/automobiles/344000-minivans-recalled-by-honda-for-brake-problem.html', 'snippet': 'The recall, like an earlier one in March, is to fix a problem in the vehicle’s computer that could result in unexpected braking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Honda is recalling 344,000 of its 2007-8 Odyssey minivans because a malfunctioning computer could cause “heavy and unexpected braking without the driver pressing on the brake pedal and without illumination of the brake lamps,” the automaker informed the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '344,000 Minivans Recalled by Honda for Brake Problem', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '344,000 Minivans Recalled By Honda for Brake Problem', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recalls and Bans of Products', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jensen, Christopher', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Honda Motor Co Ltd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brakes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-02T15:16:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61184d2b-a44f-5910-8e89-4ec3be8e21d4', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61184d2b-a44f-5910-8e89-4ec3be8e21d4'}, {'abstract': 'That the Red Sox have won three times as many championships as the Yankees over a decade seems implausible, unless one examines history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/sports/baseball/in-baseballs-time-machine-21st-century-belongs-to-the-red-sox.html', 'snippet': 'That the Red Sox have won three times as many championships as the Yankees over a decade seems implausible, unless one examines history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If it were not bad enough that the Yankees missed the playoffs for only the second time since 1993, and if there were not enough agony with all the injuries and the losses and the Alex Rodriguez story leaving a sour taste for everyone, surely the final indignity came the night before Halloween when their archrivals became champions — again.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-yankees1/DOG-yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-yankees1/DOG-yankees1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-yankees1/DOG-yankees1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-yankees1/DOG-yankees1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1473, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-yankees1/DOG-yankees1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbn