nkable prospect — retirement — after a violent robbery and a crippling back injury.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/sports/tennis/how-anna-chakvetadze-rising-star-at-20-became-a-retiree-at-26.html', 'snippet': 'At age 26, a rising Russian tennis star was forced to deal with an unthinkable prospect — retirement — after a violent robbery and a crippling back injury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Russia faces Italy in the Fed Cup final without its top 11 players, Anna Chakvetadze will be watching and reminiscing. She represented her country eight times at the Fed Cup and helped Russia defeat Italy in the final six years ago. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-anna/DOG-anna-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-anna/DOG-anna-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-anna/DOG-anna-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 539, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-anna/DOG-anna-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1078, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-anna/DOG-anna-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/03/sports/DOG-anna/DOG-anna-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': No