 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/b212fd21-820a-5adc-ae80-4ebcb352189f'}, {'abstract': 'The technology giant, known for playing its cards close to the vest, is holding only its second meeting of management with analysts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/business/international/samsung-prepares-to-slowly-lift-a-curtain-to-investors.html', 'snippet': 'The technology giant, known for playing its cards close to the vest, is holding only its second meeting of management with analysts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Secrecy has served Samsung Electronics well. Keeping its rivals guessing has helped Samsung, the South Korean technology giant, build a formidable lead in the smartphone industry, where it now sells more than one in three handsets worldwide.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/samsung1/samsung1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 928, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/04/business/samsung1/samsung1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 928}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/samsung1/samsung1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 663, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/samsung1/samsung1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1325, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/samsung1/samsung1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11