abstract': 'Four climate scientists press environmental organizations to embrace efforts to develop and deploy a new generation of nuclear power plants.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/03/to-those-influencing-environmental-policy-but-opposed-to-nuclear-power/', 'snippet': 'Four climate scientists press environmental organizations to embrace efforts to develop and deploy a new generation of nuclear power plants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four climate scientists, three of whom have published in peer-reviewed literature on energy issues (a sampler from\xa0Wigley, Hansen\xa0and\xa0Caldeira), are pressing the case for environmental groups to embrace the need for a new generation of nuclear power plants in a letter they distributed overnight to a variety of organizations and journalists.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘To Those Influencing Environmental Policy But Opposed to Nuclear Power’', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Energy and Power', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Wastes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Solar Energy', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caldeira, Ken', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emanuel, Kerry', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hansen, James E', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jacobson, Mark', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lovins, Amory B', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'