 the organization.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/business/media/Brands-Align-With-the-Mustachioed-Month-of-Movember-.html', 'snippet': 'The Movember charity, a mash-up of mustache and November, raises money for men’s health issues. Brands like Just for Men are eagerly teaming with the organization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN November 2011, executives at Just for Men, the hair color brand, noticed an inexplicable surge in Canada for sales of its facial-hair line, Mustache & Beard. The brand had done no special advertising or promotion, and yet Canadian sales were up 30 percent over the month before, and up slightly in the United States as well.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/adco/adco-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/04/business/adco/adco-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 808}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/adco/adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 761, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/adco/adco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1522, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/business/adco/adco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/04/business/adco/adco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit