akistan’s political leaders have reacted with unusual vehemence since missiles fired by American drones killed the leader of the Pakistani Taliban, Hakimullah Mehsud, on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/world/asia/in-pakistan-death-by-drone-turns-a-villain-into-a-martyr.html', 'snippet': 'Pakistan’s political leaders have reacted with unusual vehemence since missiles fired by American drones killed the leader of the Pakistani Taliban, Hakimullah Mehsud, on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In life, Hakimullah Mehsud, the leader of the Pakistani Taliban, was Public Enemy No. 1: a ruthless figure who devoted his career to bloodshed and mayhem, whom Pakistani pundits occasionally accused of being a pawn of Indian, or even American, intelligence.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Pakistan, Drone Strike Turns a Villain Into a Victim', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Death by Drone Turns a Villain Into a Martyr', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mehsud, Hakimullah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-04T01:56:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Declan Walsh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Declan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Walsh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/255cdcc5-35aa-537e-a73c-635fe91b421a', 'word_count': 893, 'uri': 'nyt://article/255cdcc5-35aa-537e-a73c-635fe91b421a'}, {'abstract': 'Mucho Macho Man won the Breeders’ Cup World Championships title by a nose, but the day was also marked by a filly who broke her leg and was euthanized.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/sports/touching-moments-send-shivers-both-good-and-bad.html', 'snippet': 'Mucho Macho Man won the Breeders’ Cup World Championships title by a nose, but the day was also marked by a filly who broke her leg and was euthanized.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ARCADIA, Calif. — There were awe-inspiring moments aplenty, like Magician moving like a John Deere tractor as he mowed down rivals in the lane of the Breeders’ Cup Turf to give European horses their fifth victory of these world championships. Or Wise Dan, the reigning horse of the year, showing why he should retain that title with a last-to-first rush in the Turf Mile that was as breathtaking as it was powerful.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/BREEDERS/BREEDERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/BREEDERS/BREEDERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/BREEDERS/BREEDERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/BREEDERS/BREEDERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1472, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20