//www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/business/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-nov-4.html', 'snippet': 'The government will release its economic growth and jobs reports this week, and beginning Thursday, investors can buy a piece of the microblogging network, Twitter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BLACKBERRY Shareholders of BlackBerry will learn on Monday if Fairfax Financial Holdings, which owns about 10 percent of the beleaguered smartphone maker, will transform a tentative offer for the company into a formal bid. Fairfax is conditionally offering $9 a share, valuing BlackBerry at about $4.7 billion, but it is unclear if it has raised enough money to make a firm offer. A group made up of BlackBerry’s co-founders, Mike Lazaridis and Doug Fregin, as well as Qualcomm, which makes the chips inside BlackBerry phones, and the private equity firm Cerberus Capital Management may also make a bid as soon as Monday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week of Nov. 4', 'kicker': 'Looking Ahead', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Economic Reports for the Week of Nov. 4', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'BlackBerry (Handheld Device)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commerce Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-04T03:14:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/55a73055-48b2-5153-8ec2-a9ae6d345390', 'word_count': 350, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55a73055-48b2-5153-8ec2-a9ae6d345390'}, {'abstract': 'The Rose Classic, a Brooklyn tournament founded eight years ago, has provided a stage for elite players 19 and under.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/sports/basketball/a-few-paces-from-the-race-a-starting-line-for-girls-in-basketball-at-rose-classic.html', 'snippet': 'The Rose Classic, a Brooklyn tournament founded eight years ago, has provided a stage for elite players 19 and under.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On marathon Sunday, crowds lining Lafayette Avenue in Brooklyn cheered enthusiastically as wave after wave of runners passed by.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/SUB-rhoden1/SUB-rhoden1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/SUB-rhoden1/SUB-rhoden1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 782}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/SUB-rhoden1/SUB-rhoden1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 786, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/SUB-rhoden1/SUB-rhoden1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1571, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/SUB-rhoden1/SUB-rhoden1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/04/sports/SUB-rhoden1/SUB-rhoden1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum