ance to expand to a full casino if Proposal 1 is approved by voters Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/04/nyregion/referendum-on-casinos-stirs-hopes-in-tiny-town.html', 'snippet': 'Nichols, N.Y., which has a small racing track and slot machine parlor nearby, hopes the site will get a chance to expand to a full casino if Proposal 1 is approved by voters Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NICHOLS, N.Y. — Sitting on a temperamental bend of the Susquehanna River, this upstate New York town is not exactly Las Vegas, with little to offer visitors other than some baseball diamonds, a couple of bars and a Main Street that dead-ends at an excavation company.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/nyregion/04nichols-01/04nichols-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/04/nyregion/04nichols-01/04nichols-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/nyregion/04nichols-01/04nichols-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/nyregion/04nichols-01/04nichols-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/04/nyregion/04nichols-01/04nichols-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/04/nyregion/04nichols-01/04nichols-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumb