er Vongtau, 19, said he could not recall a situation quite like it in his 33-year career.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/nyregion/for-36-hours-nyu-student-was-trapped-between-2-buildings.html', 'snippet': 'The Fire Department official who on Sunday oversaw the rescue of Asher Vongtau, 19, said he could not recall a situation quite like it in his 33-year career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a crowded city, Asher Vongtau was completely alone, trapped in a space barely wider than a shoe box after plummeting perhaps 100 feet into the tiny crevice between two buildings in TriBeCa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/nyregion/NYUFALL2/NYUFALL2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 195, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/nyregion/NYUFALL2/NYUFALL2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 195, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/nyregion/NYUFALL2/NYUFALL2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/05/nyregion/NYUFALL2/NYUFALL2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/nyregion/NYUFALL2/NYUFALL2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For 36 Hours, N.Y.U. Student Was Trapped Between 2 Buildings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Caught Between Two Buildings For 36 Hours, And Survi