nd the teams he has his eye on this season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/sports/hockey/q-and-a-with-ron-duguay.html', 'snippet': 'A former Ranger and now a hockey analyst for the MSG Network, Duguay provided his take on the evolution of the sport and the teams he has his eye on this season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ron Duguay was selected 13th in the 1977 N.H.L. amateur draft by the Rangers. He became a fan favorite, not just for his hockey skills but for his cascading brown hair, active night life and commercial appearances.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 686}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1791, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/duguay/duguay-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop