al': 'By Zach Schonbrun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schonbrun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52d3b463-737c-53c7-ab31-5673d8887c97', 'word_count': 699, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52d3b463-737c-53c7-ab31-5673d8887c97'}, {'abstract': 'On the eve of Election Day, polls suggested that Mayor Mike McGinn was in trouble, even though the economy is doing pretty well and job numbers are growing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/us/seattles-mayor-faces-challenge-despite-signs-of-success.html', 'snippet': 'On the eve of Election Day, polls suggested that Mayor Mike McGinn was in trouble, even though the economy is doing pretty well and job numbers are growing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — Mayor Mike McGinn seems like the kind of candidate this city would love. A former Sierra Club chapter leader and an avid cyclist, he bikes to work from his home in north Seattle. He has focused his campaign for a second term on issues voters care about here: climate change, transportation and reducing police brutality. And the economy is doing pretty well, with construction cranes whirring on the horizon and job numbers growing. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/us/SEATTLE-3/SEATTLE-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/05/us/SEATTLE-3/SEATTLE-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/us/SEATTLE-3/SEATTLE-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype