naheim Ducks defeated the Rangers with the help of rookie goaltender Frederik Andersen and two first-period goals from Corey Perry and Kyle Palmieri.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/sports/hockey/ducks-defeat-rangers-behind-a-rookies-32-saves.html', 'snippet': 'The larger, speedier Anaheim Ducks defeated the Rangers with the help of rookie goaltender Frederik Andersen and two first-period goals from Corey Perry and Kyle Palmieri.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Anaheim Ducks were concluding an eight-game trip, but the Rangers were the more lethargic squad Monday night at Madison Square Garden.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/CITY-RANGERS/CITY-RANGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 460, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/CITY-RANGERS/CITY-RANGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 460}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/CITY-RANGERS/CITY-RANGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/CITY-RANGERS/CITY-RANGERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1572, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/CITY-RANGERS/CITY-RANGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/05/sports/CITY-RANGERS/CITY-RANGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg