line editor for The National Review posted live tweets from inside the Garden State. Christine Hauser contributed reporting.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Updated 9:05 a.m.Hundreds of police officers descended on the sprawling Garden State Plaza Mall in Paramus, N.J., Monday night after multiple shoppers reported a gunman with a long rifle fired shots inside the mall around 9:15 p.m. No one was reported injured, officials said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tweets From Inside N.J. Mall During Gunfire', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T07:05:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2bdfa88-911a-56ef-b7fb-292e9b6956ef', 'word_count': 811, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2bdfa88-911a-56ef-b7fb-292e9b6956ef'}, {'abstract': 'India’s top builders fail to deliver apartments for home buyers years past delivery date.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/home-buyers-feel-let-down-by-indias-top-builders/', 'snippet': 'India’s top builders fail to deliver apartments for home buyers years past delivery date.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nitin Grover, a 33-year-old lawyer, has been dreaming of moving from his rented home to an apartment of his own. In 2008, Mr. Grover and his wife, who were paying monthly rent of 30,000 rupees, or nearly $500 at the current exchange rate, surveyed the real estate landscape around New Delhi, India’s capital. They decided to buy a place in Gurgaon, on the outskirts of the city.', 'source': 'The New York Time