'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T13:44:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6321479b-9483-58e4-9f88-5f4c90e06da3', 'word_count': 689, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6321479b-9483-58e4-9f88-5f4c90e06da3'}, {'abstract': 'Besides striking an alluring pose for the primary campaign image, the Ukrainian actress had to become a character in a short story that is running online.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/the-making-of-waldorf-astorias-eccentric-new-ad-campaign-starring-olga-kurylenko/', 'snippet': 'Besides striking an alluring pose for the primary campaign image, the Ukrainian actress had to become a character in a short story that is running online.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Don’t laugh at her!” The French photographer Bruno Dayan was shushing two young crew members who were snickering while his subject, the actress Olga Kurylenko, flapped her arms in an effort to stay upright. It wasn’t her maroon stilettos that were giving her trouble, it was her pose. For the main image in a new campaign for Waldorf Astoria Hotels & Resorts, Dayan had positioned Kurylenko, a Ukrainian-born beauty, in midstride in the lobby of the luxury hotel chain’s Chicago location. A bellhop, who had been yanked into the shot by Dayan from the curb outside, stood 20 feet behind her holding a luggage cart. To Kurylenko’s left stood a male model in a velvet dinner jacket whom she was supposed to “notice” as she breezed by. Kurylenko took two deep breaths and made eye contact with the model as Dayan’s flash started again. “Beautiful,” he barked. “No, no, no, relax your mouth. Not too sultry.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Making Of | Waldorf Astoria’s Eccentric New Ad Campaign, Starring Olga Kurylenko', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T14:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kristen Dold', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kristen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/852755a1-1903-5a8a-a73d-1f237561129a', 'word_count': 541, 'uri': 'nyt://article/852755a1-1903-5a8a-a73d-1f237561129a'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: On the Upper West Side, a little girl explains why Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg is leaving office.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/a-childs-take-on-the-mayoral-election/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: On the Upper West Side, a little girl explains why Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg is leaving office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Child’s Take on the Mayoral Election', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper West Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T14:07:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Messina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Messina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56c38608-e43a-5545-9fcf-d4632b6d9e84', 'word_count': 96, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56c38608-e43a-5545-9fcf-d4632b6d9e84'}, {'abstract': 'The contest has been largely overshadowed by the protracted legal battle (and pending public anxiety) over how Detroit will be restructured in federal Chapter 9 proceedings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/news/election-2013/2013/11/05/detroit-a-race-overshadowed-by-bankruptcy/', 'snippet': 'The contest has been largely overshadowed by the protracted legal battle (and pending public anxiety) over how Detroit will be restructured in federal Chapter 9 proceedings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a trial scrutinizing America’s largest municipal bankruptcy enters its seventh day here, the fight over Detroit’s top elected office will be decided Tuesday when voters select the next mayor of this battered city in desperate need of a comeback. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Detroit: A Race Overshadowed by Bankruptcy', 'kicker': 'Election Day Coverage and Results', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Detroit (Mich)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T14:11:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Yaccino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yaccino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e4fcfb8-a638-5736-a261-581559091bdb', 'word_count': 426, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e4fcfb8-a638-5736-a261-581559091bdb'}, {'abstract': 'Thomas James Brennan, a Marine, describes the difficulties he encountered when he sought help after trying to commit suicide.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/reflections-on-my-suicide-attempt-and-the-struggles-to-get-help/', 'snippet': 'Thomas James Brennan, a Marine, describes the difficulties he encountered when he sought help after trying to commit suicide.', 'lead_paragraph': '“To the woman I love with my whole heart and soul: You are finally free of the terror I have caused in your life,” I wrote. “I am sorry for everything I have done to you. I deserve every bit of sorrow I feel.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'My Suicide Attempt and My Struggles to Get Help', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suicides and Suicide Attempts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traumatic Brain Injury', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T14:15:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas James Brennan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': 'James', 'lastname': 'Brennan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b62d49f8-5317-5469-bd3f-c215d9b9e41d', 'word_count': 1510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b62d49f8-5317-5469-bd3f-c215d9b9e41d'}, {'abstract': 'A loving partnership can make fertility treatments far easier to bear — but we have to protect our partnerships from the toll that in vitro fertilization can take.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/during-i-v-f-keeping-a-marriage-strong/', 'snippet': 'A loving partnership can make fertility treatments far easier to bear — but we have to protect our partnerships from the toll that in vitro fertilization can take.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My friend Rachel is undergoing treatment at the same in vitro fertilization clinic, so I often check in with her: to commiserate, compare notes, even meet up – either at our clinic uptown or downtown at the acupuncturist, where we both got pricked a few times a week to “warm our wombs.” And yet for all our similarities in treatment, there’s one difference between us: she’s single.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'During I.V.F., Keeping a Marriage Strong', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emotions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'In Vitro Fertilization', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T14:25:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e326acdc-f0d3-5dd4-9705-9f12c7aab0a7', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e326acdc-f0d3-5dd4-9705-9f12c7aab0a7'}, {'abstract': 'A few thousand people in west Delhi live under constant threat of losing their homes to gover