T18:27:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Abrams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abrams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fc73dd1-debc-53cb-bc4b-d770387028f5', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fc73dd1-debc-53cb-bc4b-d770387028f5'}, {'abstract': 'More than 100 pages of “war room notes” released by congressional investigators on Tuesday show how the White House reacted as it realized the extent of the problems with the health care website.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/us/politics/senator-cites-crisis-of-confidence-on-health-care-site.html', 'snippet': 'More than 100 pages of “war room notes” released by congressional investigators on Tuesday show how the White House reacted as it realized the extent of the problems with the health care website.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — More than 100 pages of “war room notes” released by congressional investigators on Tuesday offer a window into the chaos that overwhelmed the Obama administration as the federal health insurance marketplace started up last month and officials realized that its problems could not be fixed quickly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/us/HEALTH/HEALTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/06/us/HEALTH/HEALTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/us/HEALTH/HEALTH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name':