io Saracino, gifts from Italy to the United States, will be installed next to Bryant Park.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/05/new-italian-sculptures-will-have-a-park-view/', 'snippet': 'Two works by the architect and designer Antonio Pio Saracino, gifts from Italy to the United States, will be installed next to Bryant Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A pair of 13-foot-high statues — one in marble and the other in polished stainless steel — by the architect and designer Antonio Pio Saracino are coming to a public plaza in Manhattan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Italian Sculptures Will Have a Park View', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bryant Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T19:14:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Pogrebin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a421097c-306f-5ae2-b0eb-8dd4228f5d94', 'word_count': 161, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a421097c-306f-5ae2-b0eb-8dd4228f5d94'}, {'abstract': 'Besides deciding the city’s next mayor, voters are also deciding whether to approve a casino for one Boston neighborhood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/news/election-2013/2013/11/05/boston-deciding-on-a-new-mayor-and-a-casino/', 'snippet': 'Besides deciding the city’s next mayor, voters are also deciding whether to approve a casino for one Boston neighborhood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At lunch time on Election Day, there were more volunteers than voters clustered at a high school in East Boston, where voters had gone to pick the city’s first new mayor in 20 years and to decide whether to approve a referendum that could reshape this faded neighborhood by allowing a new casino there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Boston: Deciding on a New Mayor and a Casino', 'kicker': 'Election Day Coverage and Results', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T19:15:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e73b6e50-dcb2-5709-af3a-bb27c91ba2e8', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e73b6e50-dcb2-5709-af3a-bb27c91ba2e8'}, {'abstract': 'A visual guide to making almond birthday cake with sherry-lemon buttercream.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/dining/a-party-is-icing-on-the-cake.html', 'snippet': 'A visual guide to making almond birthday cake with sherry-lemon buttercream.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s a peek behind the scenes: we shot this video on my actual birthday. And this is the cake I have been making over the last several years to celebrate. It’s a rich almond birthday cake frosted with buttercream.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Party Is Icing on the Cake', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cakes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va