e': 'Furchgott, Roy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audiovox Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-05T19:39:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roy Furchgott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Furchgott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bc0ffa5-5d2d-59bf-9c61-74595f11b5ae', 'word_count': 201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bc0ffa5-5d2d-59bf-9c61-74595f11b5ae'}, {'abstract': 'One of our major reporting efforts in covering the race for mayor was the long-form, biographical series called “In the Running,” which examined the lives and careers of the leading candidates for mayor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/news/election-2013/2013/11/05/new-york-in-the-running/', 'snippet': 'One of our major reporting efforts in covering the race for mayor was the long-form, biographical series called “In the Running,” which examined the lives and careers of the leading candidates for mayor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A major element of The Times’s reporting on the mayoral race was the long-form, biographical series called “In the Running,” which examined the lives and careers of the leading candidates, with detail and perspective. The series was intended to offer a picture of the candidates behind the scenes, how they thought and how they acted in high-pressure situations. Here is a catalog of these articles. Check them out — they offer a unique look back at the campaign and some insight into the next administration. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York: In the Running