 Succeeding him will be Moray Callum, who has been responsible for the design of Ford’s cars in the Americas since 2006.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/automobiles/j-mays-noted-ford-designer-to-retire.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Mays has directed the automaker’s designs for 16 years.  Succeeding him will be Moray Callum, who has been responsible for the design of Ford’s cars in the Americas since 2006.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ford Motor announced Tuesday that J Mays, who has directed the automaker’s designs for 16 years and is group vice president and chief creative officer, would retire in January. Succeeding Mr. Mays, 59, will be Moray Callum, 54, who has been responsible for the design of Ford’s cars in the Americas since 2006 and will assume the title of vice president of design.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06mays-interceptor/06mays-interceptor-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06mays-interceptor/06mays-interceptor-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06mays-interceptor/06mays-interceptor-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06mays-interceptor/06mays-interceptor-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1352, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06mays-interceptor/06mays-intercepto