rt-among-key-groups/', 'snippet': 'Gov. Chris Christie is heading toward a re-election victory that could fall just short of landslide proportions (usually defined as over 60 percent of the vote).', 'lead_paragraph': 'Early results suggested that Gov. Chris Christie was heading toward a re-election victory that could fall just short of landslide proportions (usually defined as over 60 percent of the vote). News organizations declared him the winner shortly after the polls closed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.J. Exit Poll: Christie Gained Among Key Groups', 'kicker': 'Election Day Coverage and Results', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-06T01:09:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael R. Kagay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Kagay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e7aafb9c-e24f-5aba-8132-1c4a79ad5cdf', 'word_count': 469, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e7aafb9c-e24f-5aba-8132-1c4a79ad5cdf'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Stern is the founder and principal of Stern Projects, a boutique construction management company focused largely on high-end residential projects in Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/realestate/commercial/nicholas-s-g-stern.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Stern is the founder and principal of Stern Projects, a boutique construction management company focused largely on high-end residential projects in Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Stern, 45, is the founder and principal of Stern Projects, a boutique construction management company focused largely on high-end residential projects in Manhattan. Before starting the company in 2010, he served as an executive vice president of Ta