//article/f1ba3470-28b4-5fcf-a913-72656dbb7a8e', 'word_count': 50, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1ba3470-28b4-5fcf-a913-72656dbb7a8e'}, {'abstract': 'After a shaky start, the Nets got back on track by dismantling the Jazz at Barclays Center with six Nets players finishing with double figures in points, led by Brook Lopez’s 27 points.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/sports/basketball/future-looks-bright-for-brooklyn-basketball-as-nets-rout-jazz.html', 'snippet': 'After a shaky start, the Nets got back on track by dismantling the Jazz at Barclays Center with six Nets players finishing with double figures in points, led by Brook Lopez’s 27 points.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Nets last weekend had an emotional whiplash that stung their pride. They were puffing their chests late Friday night, celebrating a scintillating victory over the defending champion Miami Heat. Forty-eight hours later, they slunk onto their team plane after a blowout loss to the Orlando Magic, an untried team. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/06/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/sports/CITY-NETS/CITY-NETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cr