/b2ec6d95-9148-5705-9214-2f66130164bc', 'word_count': 1146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2ec6d95-9148-5705-9214-2f66130164bc'}, {'abstract': 'With the introduction of its $9,946 Vespa 946, Piaggio has moved its famous scooters further than ever from their proletarian roots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/automobiles/the-vespa-946-a-scooter-for-the-wealthy.html', 'snippet': 'With the introduction of its $9,946 Vespa 946, Piaggio has moved its famous scooters further than ever from their proletarian roots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Have you ever come across a $10,000 scooter? Well, meet the 946, Vespa’s newest and most expensive model. With swooping lines and a big red leather-textured seat, it neatly epitomizes the Italian brand’s gradual transformation from maker of inexpensive transportation for the masses to purveyor of two-wheeled fashion accessories.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06VESPA-image-1/06VESPA-image-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 361, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06VESPA-image-1/06VESPA-image-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 361}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06VESPA-image-1/06VESPA-image-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 616, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06VESPA-image-1/06VESPA-image-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1233, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/06/automobiles/06VESPA-image-1/06VESPA-image-1-t