n Mass.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/arts/music/cleveland-orchestra-brings-messiaen-to-white-light-festival.html', 'snippet': 'As part of the Lincoln Center White Light Festival, the Cleveland Orchestra played “liturgies” by Messiaen and a Beethoven Mass.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since white light results not from an absence of color but from the presence of all colors, it is altogether appropriate that Lincoln Center’s White Light Festival should find a place for that supreme musical colorist Olivier Messiaen. And on Monday evening at Avery Fisher Hall, the Cleveland Orchestra, led by its music director, Franz Welser-Möst, performed Messiaen’s “Trois Petites Liturgies de la Présence Divine” of 1944, a piece for a chorus of sopranos, piano and an orchestra fitted out with exotic instruments, alongside works by Beethoven.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/festival/festival-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/festival/festival-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/festival/festival-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/festival/festival-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1320, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/festival/festival-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumb