 the fall season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/arts/dance/american-ballet-theater-performs-clear-and-theme-and-variations.html', 'snippet': 'American Ballet Theater presented mixed bills on Saturday at the David H. Koch Theater, and one stood out as the least distinguished offering of the fall season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Along with new casts, the mixed bills by American Ballet Theater at the David H. Koch Theater on Saturday introduced the least distinguished offering of the company’s fall season. Made by Stanton Welch in 2001, it is a showpiece for seven men without shirts. The lead dancer slaps his chest, not like Tarzan but like a man applying a defibrillator to himself, an action that seems to call for a shouting of the work’s title: “Clear.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/BALLET/BALLET-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 273, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/BALLET/BALLET-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 273}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/BALLET/BALLET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/BALLET/BALLET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 931, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/BALLET/BALLET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/07/arts/BALLET/BALLET-thumbStandard.jpg',