ss that is so hopelessly antiquated?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/opinion/why-i-lost-it-on-election-night.html', 'snippet': 'How can we have an electoral process that is so hopelessly antiquated?', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE New York City mayoral election was hardly a nail-biter. But Bill de Blasio’s landslide win might have been nominally less historic had I not torn up my ballot and flung it at a bewildered election volunteer near my home on the Upper West Side. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Why I Lost It on Election Night', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Why I Lost It on Election Night', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-06T21:57:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Ripp', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ripp', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/f843a700-8aee-5bdf-b0c1-5eba59f34678', 'word_count': 1097, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f843a700-8aee-5bdf-b0c1-5eba59f34678'}, {'abstract': 'Tom Hiddleston, who plays Loki in “Thor: The Dark World,” has a Jim Jarmusch film and a Shakespeare play in London on his horizon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/movies/tom-hiddleston-gets-mythic-for-thor-the-dark-world.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Hiddleston, who plays Loki in “Thor: The Dark World,” has a Jim Jarmusch film and a Shakespeare play in London on his horizon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In a scene close to the end of the 2011 superhero film “Thor,” the two central characters confront each other. They are brothers, although Loki, played by the British actor Tom Hiddleston, has just denied this. “Loki, this is madness,” says Thor (Chris Hemsworth). “Is it madness?” Mr. Hiddleston responds, his face quivering with intensity, his breath ragged, his eyes filming with tears. “Is it? Is it?”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 248, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 248}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 845, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/10LOKI1_SPAN/10LOKI1_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Thor’s Nemesis Makes 