/article/8303bace-eea0-56ef-b4db-a9afacf17500'}, {'abstract': 'Sam Buffa, the entrepreneur behind the Fellow Barber shops and several Brooklyn restaurants, shares pictures from his trip to the Italian island to compete in the International Six Days of Enduro.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/06/travel-diary-an-epic-century-old-motorcycle-race-comes-to-sardinia/', 'snippet': 'Sam Buffa, the entrepreneur behind the Fellow Barber shops and several Brooklyn restaurants, shares pictures from his trip to the Italian island to compete in the International Six Days of Enduro.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the co-owner of the Brooklyn restaurants Vinegar Hill House and Hillside and the impresario behind the Fellow Barber mini-empire of elegant, old-timey men’s grooming salons, Sam Buffa is already the subject of major male lifestyle envy. The 35-year-old seems even more the embodiment of a certain type of guy’s fantasy life when you learn that he also races motorcycles, something he started doing with his dad as a kid growing up in Half Moon Bay, Calif.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Epic, Century-Old Motorcycle Race Comes to Sardinia', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Motorcycles, Motor Bikes and Motorscooters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sardinia (Italy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-06T22:30:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/490e6f30-d890-5e04-99f1-19a51bdda3a0', 'word_count': 179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/490e6f30-d890-5e04-99f1-19a51bdda3a0'}, {'abstract': 'Many from the CFDA competition have landed high-profile positions or new backers. But has it all been a bed of roses?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/fashion/the-cfda-vogue-fashion-fund-where-no-designer-is-left-behind.html', 'snippet': 'Many from the CFDA competition have landed high-profile positions or new backers. But has it all been a bed of roses?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whoever said, “If you want to try a risky career, open a restaurant,” surely never considered becoming a clothing designer. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vogue Fashion Fund: Where No Designer Is Left Behind', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Where No Designer Is Left Behind', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Council of Fashion Designers of America', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Proenza Schouler', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCollough, Jack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hernandez, Lazaro', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wintour, Anna', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lam, Derek', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chung, Doo-Ri', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borgo, Eddie', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-06T22:36:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Wilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wilson', 'qualifier': None, 'titl