 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea00f594-e1d7-5774-bedc-6d9fec59336e'}, {'abstract': 'One class shy of her bachelor’s degree, Manpriya Samra suddenly had thousands of dollars in medical bills after an emergency appendectomy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/nyregion/close-to-college-degree-then-medical-bills-came.html', 'snippet': 'One class shy of her bachelor’s degree, Manpriya Samra suddenly had thousands of dollars in medical bills after an emergency appendectomy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The worst stomach ache of Manpriya Samra’s life sent her to Maimonides Medical Center in Brooklyn in March 2012, when doctors told her that her appendix was about to burst. An emergency surgery successfully removed the inflamed organ, but Ms. Samra soon learned that her ordeal was only just beginning.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/nyregion/neediest/neediest-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/07/nyregion/neediest/neediest-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/nyregion/neediest/neediest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/nyregion/neediest/neediest-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/nyregion/neediest/neediest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'t