tters-i-p-o/', 'snippet': 'Twitter closed at $44.90 a share, 73 percent above its initial public offering price. DealBook followed the first day of trading as it unfolded.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Updated, 4:22 p.m. | Twitter began life as a public company on Thursday, and DealBook followed the first day of trading as it happened. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opening With a Pop, Key Moments From Twitter’s First Day of Trading', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-07T13:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71f3bf81-61ee-5ed0-9b6e-d54c9fa9131a', 'word_count': 4101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71f3bf81-61ee-5ed0-9b6e-d54c9fa9131a'}, {'abstract': 'Can you solve the mystery of a 47-year-old woman with repeated bouts of severe nausea and vomiting and abdominal pain?', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/think-like-a-doctor-gut-feeling/', 'snippet': 'Can you solve the mystery of a 47-year-old woman with repeated bouts of severe nausea and vomiting and abdominal pain?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Challenge: Can you solve a medical mystery involving a previously healthy 47-year-old woman who for the past two years has had episodes of abdominal pain, nausea and vomiting so severe she has needed to be hospitalized?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/health/07well_tlad/07well_tlad-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 278, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'ran