9dd7-3ec9631a48d0'}, {'abstract': 'The story behind the monumental “Medical and Surgical History of the War of Rebellion.”', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/counting-the-costs-of-the-civil-war/', 'snippet': 'The story behind the monumental “Medical and Surgical History of the War of Rebellion.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'While the desire to document military exploits and wars is as old as writing itself, the recording of military medical data is a relatively modern phenomenon. Although some initial attempts to chronicle the health of troops occurred in the first half of the 19th century, the first large-scale, wartime medical and behavioral health surveillance effort was conducted during the American Civil War. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Counting the Costs of the Civil War', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surgery and Surgeons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-07T16:57:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Allen Smith and B. Christopher Frueh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': 'Allen', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e08bdbdb-292e-51a7-a18f-d115b68596a4', 'word_count': 1232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e08bdbdb-292e-51a7-a18f-d115b68596a4'}, {'abstract': 'A fireball that lit up the sky over Southern California on Wednesday night is believed to be a meteor.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/possible-meteor-over-california-has-social-media-abuzz/', 'snippet': 'A fireball that lit up the sky over Southern California on Wednesday night is believed to be a meteor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A fireball lit up the sky over Southern California around 8 p.m. Wednesday, and scientists are saying that it may have been part of a South Taurid meteor shower. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Possible Meteor Over California Has Social Media Abuzz', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meteors and Meteorites', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-07T16:58:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/704feeb1-0967-5953-9e7e-c268935ef377', 'word_count': 417, 'uri': 'nyt://article/704feeb1-0967-5953-9e7e-c268935ef377'}, {'abstract': 'The International Krishi Mela, or farmers’ festival commenced in Bangalore, Karnataka, on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/07/image-of-the-day-november-7/', 'snippet': 'The International Krishi Mela, or farmers’ festival commenced in Bangalore, Karnataka, on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption'