}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd1f04be-c188-53fd-b642-a430ffba6bde', 'word_count': 1456, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd1f04be-c188-53fd-b642-a430ffba6bde'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Newell’s new version of “Great Expectations” features supporting work by Ralph Fiennes and Helena Bonham Carter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/movies/great-expectations-directed-by-mike-newell.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Newell’s new version of “Great Expectations” features supporting work by Ralph Fiennes and Helena Bonham Carter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mike Newell’s screen adaptation of Charles Dickens’s “Great Expectations” is never more alive than when it pauses from its breakneck storytelling to gawk at the chaos of 19th-century London. There is Pip, a former blacksmith’s assistant, now outfitted as a gentleman, being shoved this way and that while stumbling through the mud and the carnage of a London meat market. The bacchanals of the Finches of the Grove, the rich boys’ club he joins, are deafening animal-house melees of flying furniture and dishes. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08GREAT3_SPAN/GREAT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 386, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08GREAT3_SPAN/GREAT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 386}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08GREAT3_SPAN/GREAT3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08GREAT3_SPAN/GREAT3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1317, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'c