ederal safety officials missed warning signs before four crashes involving trucks or tour buses that left 25 people dead in the last year, the National Transportation Safety Board said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/us/inspectors-accused-of-missing-warnings-before-bus-crashes.html', 'snippet': 'Federal safety officials missed warning signs before four crashes involving trucks or tour buses that left 25 people dead in the last year, the National Transportation Safety Board said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Federal safety officials missed or ignored warning signs before four deadly crashes involving heavy trucks or intercity buses in the last year, the National Transportation Safety Board said on Thursday. The government shut down some of the companies, but only after a total of 25 people were killed and 83 injured in the four accidents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/us/BUS/BUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 836, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/08/us/BUS/BUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 836}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/us/BUS/BUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 735, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/us/BUS/BUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1870, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/us/BUS/BUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 