lip Galanes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Philip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Galanes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b044458-f28d-5dbd-a5b2-3e8ac521e188', 'word_count': 862, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b044458-f28d-5dbd-a5b2-3e8ac521e188'}, {'abstract': 'Justin Timberlake, with signature songs and moves, kicked off his solo tour at Barclays Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/arts/music/justin-timberlake-begins-his-solo-tour-in-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'Justin Timberlake, with signature songs and moves, kicked off his solo tour at Barclays Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What a trouper Justin Timberlake is. He started his solo tour — after sharing a summer tour with Jay Z — at Barclays Center on Wednesday night with a lavish marathon of a concert: two full-length sets separated by an intermission and ending just after midnight. He mustered large forces: dancers, a big band with horns, extensive videos and lasers, and an overhead catwalk-like stage that traversed the whole arena. (He brings his show to the Izod Center in East Rutherford, N.J., on Saturday.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08TIMBER_SPAN/08TIMBER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08TIMBER_SPAN/08TIMBER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08TIMBER_SPAN/08TIMBER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',