Paris Countdown,” a freed psychopath goes after the two associates who testified against him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Edgar Marie’s “Paris Countdown” is a buddy movie with a downbeat heart. Its two not quite heroes, Milan (Olivier Marchal) and Victor (Jacques Gamblin), have bad history with each other and worse history with the Terminator-like villain Serki (Carlo Brandt), whom they betrayed in an ochre-tinted Mexico. Six years later, Serki is out of jail and wants revenge in a purple-tinted nighttime Paris.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/08/arts/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN/08RDP_COUNTDOWN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': No