s been fending off criticism for using the writings of others, unattributed, in his own speeches, in an opinion article and in one of his books.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rand Paul May Have Had His Own Writings Plagiarized', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Plagiarism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Rand', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T01:57:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Rutenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rutenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b2f586d-0cf8-515d-be00-15768ce53fe1', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b2f586d-0cf8-515d-be00-15768ce53fe1'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Lederman, 13, is the first United States-born player invited to train at La Masia, the famed youth soccer academy run by the global soccer juggernaut Barcelona.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/sports/soccer/at-barcelonas-la-masia-a-rare-us-child-soccer-star.html', 'snippet': 'Ben Lederman, 13, is the first United States-born player invited to train at La Masia, the famed youth soccer academy run by the global soccer juggernaut Barcelona.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BARCELONA, Spain — More than six million Americans live abroad, according to recent estimates, so it was not altogether unusual when the Ledermans, a family of four from California, moved here in 2011. After all, one of them got a dream job.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/08/sports/BARCELONAsilo/BARCELONAsilo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An American Boy Wonder in Barcelona ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An American Boy Wonder in Barcelona', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Masia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barcelona (Soccer