/article/a126c97b-4e42-553a-a795-02cb9fbb613c'}, {'abstract': 'Nearly a third of European Jews have considered emigration because of safety fears, according to a new survey, which suggests that prejudices are spreading to new segments of society.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/09/world/europe/jews-in-europe-report-a-surge-in-anti-semitism.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly a third of European Jews have considered emigration because of safety fears, according to a new survey, which suggests that prejudices are spreading to new segments of society.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — Fear of rising anti-Semitism in Europe has prompted nearly a third of European Jews to consider emigration because they do not feel safe in their home country, according to a detailed survey of Jewish perceptions released Friday by a European Union agency that monitors discrimination and other violations of basic rights.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jews in Europe Report a Surge in Anti-Semitism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTI-SEMITISM', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T09:32:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Higgins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Higgins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5348ae0e-33c5-5665-bf3b-5df665e90c01', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5348ae0e-33c5-5665-bf3b-5df665e90c01'}, {'abstract': 'Among the most contentious issues during the talks in Geneva have been the fate of a reactor in Iran, the country’s stockpile of uranium and how much relief to give it from punishing sanctions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/09/world/middleeast/iran-nuclear-talks.html', 'snippet': 'Among the most contentious issues during the talks in Geneva have been the fate of a reactor in Iran, the country’s stockpile of uranium and how much relief to give it from punishing sanctions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — With Secretary of State John Kerry and other ranking Western officials converging here on Friday, negotiators wrestled with the final hurdles to a landmark nuclear agreement with Iran that would temporarily freeze its nuclear program.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/09/world/middleeast/nuclear/nuclear-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/09/world/middleeast/nuclear/nuclear-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/09/world/middleeast/nuclear/nuclear-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/09/world/middleeast/nuclear/nuclear-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/09/world/middleeast/nuclear/nuclear-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail