emaining equity value of a portfolio of trouble assets set up five years ago to rescue UBS.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/ubs-pays-3-76-billion-to-swiss-central-bank-in-buy-back-of-toxic-assets/', 'snippet': 'The payment represents the Swiss National Bank’s share of the remaining equity value of a portfolio of trouble assets set up five years ago to rescue UBS.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In the latest sign of a strengthening environment for European banks, the Swiss bank UBS said Friday that it paid $3.76 billion to Switzerland’s central bank to repurchase the remaining value of a portfolio of troubled assets taken off its books during the financial crisis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'UBS Pays $3.76 Billion to Swiss Central Bank in Buyback of Toxic Assets', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Swiss National Bank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UBS AG', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T10:37:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fdc085de-8257-5fd8-8225-cfaeaeb840c7', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fdc085de-8257-5fd8-8225-cfaeaeb840c7'}, {'abstract': 'What you need to know for Friday and the weekend: mixed-race children in the city, brisk weather and a look back at the Great Blackout of November 1965.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/new-york-today-de-blasio-family-factor/', 'snip