stors are helping to finance a planned $1 billion investment in BlackBerry. | A plumber in London is seeking to fix the European banking sector.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/morning-agenda-a-smooth-start-for-twitter/', 'snippet': 'Twitter on its first day of trading managed to avoid the missteps that marred Facebook’s debut. | UBS said it repurchased the remaining value of a portfolio of troubled assets from Switzerland’s central bank. | Canadian, American and Qatari invest...', 'lead_paragraph': 'TWITTER’S SMOOTH DEBUT \xa0|\xa0 Twitter on its first day of trading managed to avoid the missteps that marred Facebook’s debut last year, though the lofty market valuation it achieved adds pressure on the company to turn a profit soon, DealBook’s David Gelles reports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Smooth Start for Twitter', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T12:46:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bf52960-3944-50c6-85df-d30e01698765', 'word_count': 1569, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bf52960-3944-50c6-85df-d30e01698765'}, {'abstract': 'When do you use a dash? What is an em-dash? What about an en-dash? Is a dash the same as a hyphen? A well-placed dash can add voice and vitality to your writing.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/skills-practice-using-dashes-effectively/', 'snippet': 'When do you use a dash? What is an em-dash? What about an en-dash? Is a dash the same as a hyphen? A well-placed dash can add voice and vitality to your writing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When do you use a dash? What is an em-dash? What about an en-dash? Is a dash the same as a hyphen? This versatile piece of punctuation is often misused by writers young and old, but when you learn how to use it wisely, a well-placed dash can add voice and vitality to your writing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-LN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-LN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 597}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 769, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1537, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-LN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-LN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/10/22/opinion/draft-dash-LN/draft-dash-LN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Skills Practice | Using Dashes Effectively', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'co