ol and three years after Scott Turow (at No. 10 with “Identical”) finished Harvard Law. “Something must have been in the water,” Scottoline joked when I asked how all three came to embrace fiction. In fact, Scottoline started writing later than Grisham or Turow, and was goaded in part by their work. “I liked it,” she said, “but I thought to myself, ‘There’s a lot of books about male lawyers. Where are all the female lawyers?’ So I wrote some.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/books/review/17list-img/17list-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 453, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/books/review/17list-img/17list-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 453, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/books/review/17list-img/17list-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/books/review/17list-img/17list-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/books/review/17list-img/17list-img-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside the List', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inside the List', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T15:54:22+0000', 'document_ty