a, India and Thailand.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/08/pictures-of-the-day-louisiana-and-elsewhere-2/', 'snippet': 'Photos from Louisiana, Syria, India and Thailand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photos from Louisiana, Syria, India and Thailand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pictures of the Day: Louisiana and Elsewhere', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T21:25:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/901a8e52-8569-5d60-acd5-b11e8b2449e0', 'word_count': 12, 'uri': 'nyt://article/901a8e52-8569-5d60-acd5-b11e8b2449e0'}, {'abstract': 'Teton Gravity Research will produce a series of skiing and snowboarding web videos that will be shown at nytimes.com/sports starting Nov. 13.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/09/sports/coming-new-snowboarding-and-skiing-video-series.html', 'snippet': 'Teton Gravity Research will produce a series of skiing and snowboarding web videos that will be shown at nytimes.com/sports starting Nov. 13.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeremy Jones has long flirted with danger in executing daring feats atop his snowboard in far-flung locations. Teton Gravity Research has documented Jones’s efforts through a trilogy of films, “Deeper,” “Further” and, now, “Higher,” the trailer for which can be viewed here. This trailer sets the tone for TGR’s new web series, “Higher Unplugged,” which The Times will feature, starting on Nov. 20. Another series from TGR, “Behind the Line,” can be viewed at nytimes.com/sports, starting on Nov. 13.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Coming: New Snowboarding and Skiing Video Series', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snowboarding', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Web-Original Programming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Teton Gravity Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Jeremy (1975- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T21:25:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4584efe5-107a-583b-9b39-f11c9a0b02cb', 'word_count': 126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4584efe5-107a-583b-9b39-f11c9a0b02cb'}, {'abstract': 'Companies interview applicants, then arrange small-group dates for a low fee.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/fashion/Group-dating-Getting-to-Know-You-and-You-and-You-.html', 'snippet': 'Companies interview applicants, then arrange small-group dates for a low fee.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a balmy Tuesday evening, half a dozen young people gathered for drinks, as young people will, at the HiFi Bar in the East Village. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10GROUPDATING_SPAN/10GROUPDATING_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Through Group Dating, Getting to Know You (and You and You)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Getting to Know You (and You and You)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Single Persons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Dating', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T21:30:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marisa Meltzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Meltzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/676fb3e1-533a-5fb2-98c1-0060bef5c94c', 'word_count': 1228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/676fb3e1-533a-5fb2-98c1-0060bef5c94c'}, {'abstract': 'A block in East Harlem, where a new luxury high-rise stands near a food pantry and its patrons’ apartments, illustrates the class divide Mayor-elect Bill de Blasio wants to address.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/nyregion/de-blasio-could-help-the-rich-see-the-poor-living-next-door.html', 'snippet': 'A block in East Harlem, where a new luxury high-rise stands near a food pantry and its patrons’ apartments, illustrates the class divide Mayor-elect Bill de Blasio wants to address.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you lived in Apartment 17A at 1280 Fifth Avenue, a Robert A. M. Stern-designed building, which goes by the baptismal name One Museum Mile, you would have acquired 1,863 square feet for $2.8 million. After a while, perhaps following the birth of a second child or during a bout of the kind of enervating status anxiety that afflicts so many in Manhattan, you would find yourself coveting the combined unit upstairs — the five-bedroom place priced at $8.7 million. You don’t have the money, but maybe if you changed careers, or husbands, or gained a windfall from a dubious lawsuit, you would. You indulge these fantasies, even as you look out your window toward the gloomy, austere towers of Schomburg Plaza, a former Mitchell-Lama complex, or walk four blocks east and south to the sprawl of projects on Madison Avenue.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1299, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/nyregion/10BIG/10BIG-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Neighbors, Yet Worlds Apart', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Neighbors, Yet Worlds Apart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T21:35:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ginia Bellafante', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ginia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bellafan