xpensive hotel in Mogadishu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/09/world/africa/blast-hits-hotel-in-somalia.html', 'snippet': 'Witnesses and officials said at least four people were killed and scores wounded in a bombing outside an expensive hotel in Mogadishu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOGADISHU, Somalia — A car loaded with explosives blew up outside one of Mogadishu’s most expensive hotels Friday evening, leaving what witnesses and officials described as a scene of devastation, burning vehicles and mangled victims. News services said that four to 11 people were killed and scores wounded in the blast, which appeared to be carried out by the Shabab, the militant Islamist insurgent group battling Somalia’s government.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deadly Blast Hits Hotel in Somalia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Somalia: Blast Strikes the Capital', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ibrahim, Mohammed', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mogadishu (Somalia)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shabab', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Somalia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T22:45:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mohamed Ibrahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mohamed', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ibrahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8bb9229-b529-5602-b324-a408a84115fe', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8bb9229-b529-5602-b324-a408a84115fe'}, {'abstract': 'Newburgh, N.Y., with its