c. But for the actress who had that honor in “Sharknado,” Cassie Scerbo, the latest Syfy creature feature, “Beast of the Bering Sea,” must have seemed especially disappointing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Striking a Rich Vein, of Sorts', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Striking a Rich Vein, of Sorts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Syfy Channel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T22:49:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/109ab7b7-8316-51ca-9ccd-31f2d0cf0b44', 'word_count': 260, 'uri': 'nyt://article/109ab7b7-8316-51ca-9ccd-31f2d0cf0b44'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Morris’s masterwork, which celebrates its 25th anniversary this month, returns to New York as part of the White Light Festival at Lincoln Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Morris’s masterwork, which celebrates its 25th anniversary this month, returns to New York as part of the White Light Festival at Lincoln Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Morris’s masterwork, which celebrates its 25th anniversary this month, returns to New York as part of the White Light Festival at Lincoln Center.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1353, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/arts/dance/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ/20131110-ALLEGRO-slide-U0KQ-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘L’Allegro’ at 25', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T22:50:54+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Arts', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/5712d86d-2351-5877-9232-aae7c71526b7', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/5712d86d-2351-5877-9232-aae7c71526b7'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Morris’s 25-year-old masterwork “Allegro, il Penseroso ed il Moderato,” to be performed Nov. 21 to 23 at Lincoln Center, still fascinates audiences.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/arts/dance/lallegro-mark-morriss-renowned-masterwork-returns.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Morris’s 25-year-old masterwork “Allegro, il Penseroso ed il Moderato,” to be performed Nov. 21 to 23 at Lincoln Center, still fascinates audiences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some artistic creations cause immediate sensations, and some create a sense of wonder. With only a very few, however, does that sense of wonder address the entire culture that has produced the work of art. One such piece is Mark Morris’s “Allegro, il Penseroso ed il Moderato,” a full-evening dance work that has almost invariably had a sensational effect on audiences and celebrates its 25th anniversary this month. When it was young, its virtues of innocence, exuberance and abundance amazed many viewers. (“Our era can produce this?”) In the last two years, I have met other people who have felt the same way after seeing it for the first time. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Still Tingling Spines, After 25 Years', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Still Tingling Spines, After 25 Years', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, Mark', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'White Light Festival (Lincoln Center, NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-08T22:52:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alastair Macaulay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alastair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macaulay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60b109fc-7842-5d42-b9b8-984528ba40fb', 'word_count': 1495, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60b109fc-7842-5d42-b9b8-984528ba40fb'}, {'abstract': 'The inventor of a food-replacement drink, Soylent, has a longstanding love for airplanes and flight.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/fashion/Robert-Rhinehart-Soylent-Inventor-Loves-to-Fly-.html', 'snippet': 'The inventor of a food-replacement drink, Soylent, has a longstanding love for airplanes and flight.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Progress can be slippery to define. After all, one person’s progress is another one’s transgress. Case in point: Soylent, the food-replacement drink that Robert Rhinehart concocted and has been living on for more than 10 months. The project has sparked enough controversy and raised enough money on\xa0Crowdhoster for him to start manufacturing it. (The first shipments are expected to go out next month.)', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10POSSESSED2_SPAN/10POSSESSED2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10POSSESSED2_SPAN/10POSSESSED2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10POSSESSED2_SPAN/10POSSESSED2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/fashion/10POSSESSED2_SPAN/10