a174-0d0d66e13449'}, {'abstract': 'Since Tim Duncan joined San Antonio as a rookie for the 1997-98 season, the team has been a model of success and stability.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/sports/spurs-and-knicks-proud-era-vs-loud-errors.html', 'snippet': 'Since Tim Duncan joined San Antonio as a rookie for the 1997-98 season, the team has been a model of success and stability.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since Tim Duncan joined San Antonio as a rookie for the 1997-98 season, the team has been a model of success and stability. During that period, the Knicks have often been a dysfunctional mess. The teams did meet in the 1999 N.B.A. finals, with the Spurs winning in five games, but for the most part the two clubs have gone distinctly separate ways.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/sports/DOG-jp-araton2/DOG-jp-araton2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/sports/DOG-jp-araton2/DOG-jp-araton2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 896}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/sports/DOG-jp-araton2/DOG-jp-araton2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/sports/DOG-jp-araton2/DOG-jp-araton2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1999, 'width': 1339, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/sports/DOG-jp-araton2/DOG-jp-araton2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard