/10/us/take-it-from-one-who-knows-race-cars-are-loud.html', 'snippet': 'Bun B, the Houston rapper and racing aficionado, gives his advice on getting the most out of the Formula One U.S. Grand Prix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Knowing something about automobiles is part of Bun B’s job description. “Houston’s hip-hop culture is largely defined by the car culture,” he said. But while Houston’s car scene is based on heavily customized automobiles called slabs (originally an acronym for “slow, loud and bangin’”), his latest passion focuses on a different, faster sort of car. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/us/10ttCulture/10ttCulture-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 447, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/10/us/10ttCulture/10ttCulture-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 447}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/us/10ttCulture/10ttCulture-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 763, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/us/10ttCulture/10ttCulture-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/10/us/10ttCulture/10ttCulture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/10/us/10ttCulture/10ttCulture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/1