ile inside her car, outside her father’s house. She fled in her car onto the campus of the small university, where the crime was reported.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/11/nyregion/new-jersey-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'The police said that the woman was shot in the arm while inside her car, outside her father’s house. She fled in her car onto the campus of the small university, where the crime was reported.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A gunman shot a 27-year-old woman in the arm near Kean University’s campus in Union Township, N.J. on Sunday night, before fleeing into the surrounding streets. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Woman Shot Near Campus in New Jersey', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Woman Shot Near Campus in New Jersey ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kean University', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Union Township (NJ)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-10T06:46:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dce67bd7-785a-5423-83b5-ddabea7ad6a0', 'word_count': 130, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dce67bd7-785a-5423-83b5-ddabea7ad6a0'}, {'abstract': 'Typhoon Haiyan delivered a crippling blow to the country’s midsection and appeared to have brought a heavy loss of life to cities, towns and villages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/11/world/asia/philippines-typhoon.html', 'snippet': 'Typhoon Haiyan delivered a crippling blow to the country’s midsection and appeared to have brought a heavy loss of life to cities, towns and villages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CEBU, Philippines — Three days after one of the most powerful storms ever to buffet the Philip