 Verrazano-Narrows Bridge, as tankers cruised through Lower New York Bay.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Casting a Lifeline to Disabled Veterans', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Sport', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Breezy Point (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-10T16:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Helen Coster', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Helen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Coster', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3a33ee1-6032-53d7-87a9-769f90d09e8e', 'word_count': 863, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3a33ee1-6032-53d7-87a9-769f90d09e8e'}, {'abstract': 'From The International Herald Tribune', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/10/in-our-pages-november-11/', 'snippet': 'From The International Herald Tribune', 'lead_paragraph': '1938 Kemal Ataturk Dies in Istanbul of Liver Ailment', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Our Pages: November 11', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ataturk, Kemal', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Lyndon Baines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Netherlands', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value'