mming it all into one day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Voting should be easy, convenient and efficient — no lines, and no panic about choosing between voting or being late to work.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Low-Stress Voting', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Low-Stress Voting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brennan Center for Justice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Northeastern States (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-11T02:17:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/52eb5082-dfcf-5bcc-9b23-2f5c1b935733', 'word_count': 317, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52eb5082-dfcf-5bcc-9b23-2f5c1b935733'}, {'abstract': 'Lottery numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/11/nyregion/winning-powerball-and-lottery-numbers-for-nov-10-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Lottery numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nov. 10, 2013', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Winning Powerball and Lottery Numbers for Nov. 10, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lot