7bc1e0c8-e040-562d-b156-dd8542dcdd5a'}, {'abstract': 'The T Fellowship, administered by Columbia, aims to support emerging theatrical producers through a stipend and mentoring.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/11/aaron-glick-awarded-t-fellowship-for-theater-producers/', 'snippet': 'The T Fellowship, administered by Columbia, aims to support emerging theatrical producers through a stipend and mentoring.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aaron Glick, a theater producer whose productions have included the PigPen Theater Company’s Off Broadway staging of “The Old Man and the Old Moon,” has been awarded a T Fellowship, a one-year program meant to support the development of emerging producers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aaron Glick Awarded T Fellowship for Theater Producers', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-11T19:03:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/23a6c730-b05d-50cd-a791-a47ee62496e1', 'word_count': 116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/23a6c730-b05d-50cd-a791-a47ee62496e1'}, {'abstract': 'Carnival Cruise Lines has a promotion-focused partnership with the New Orleans Saints, and Anheuser-Busch will take over a Norwegian Cruise Line ship for the Super Bowl.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/11/cruise-lines-are-ready-for-some-football/', 'snippet': 'Carnival Cruise Lines has a promotion-focused partnership with the New Orleans Saints, and Anheuser-Busch will take over a Norwegian Cruise Line ship for the Super Bowl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the last few years, it seems as if major cruise lines have been harnessing the star power of every kind of celebrity to sell more voyages. Some feature food from Top Chefs, entertainment from American Idols or even a chance to sail the Caribbean with the members of the band Kiss.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1134, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/11/travel/11cruise/11cruise-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cruise Lines Are Ready for Some Football', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub':