'}, {'abstract': 'Gennady Perepada, who prefers the term international real estate consultant, makes it his job not just to find his clients apartments but also to bend New York to their will.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/12/nyregion/giving-foreign-clients-a-piece-of-new-yorks-luxury-real-estate.html', 'snippet': 'Gennady Perepada, who prefers the term international real estate consultant, makes it his job not just to find his clients apartments but also to bend New York to their will.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It takes a certain kind of person to regard luxury real estate in New York as cheap, maybe even embarrassingly cheap when compared with other global capitals. If such people hail from the former Soviet Union, and want to add a Manhattan address to a portfolio that might already include homes in London or Dubai or St. Tropez, they might seek out a real estate agent who appreciates their unusual perspective. They might seek out Gennady Perepada.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/12/nyregion/APPRAISAL-span/APPRAISAL-span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/12/nyregion/APPRAISAL-span/APPRAISAL-span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/12/nyregion/APPRAISAL-span/APPRAISAL-span-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/12/nyregion/APPRAISAL-span/APPRAISAL-span-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1385, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype