 that all but eliminated collective bargaining for most public employees.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wisconsin Supreme Court Hears Arguments on Collective Bargaining Law', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wisconsin Supreme Court Hears Arguments on Collective Bargaining Law', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collective Bargaining', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yaccino, Steven', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Employees', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Van Hollen, J B', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-12T03:33:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Yaccino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yaccino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1272a624-e305-57b3-89b3-1c91c7438b2c', 'word_count': 656, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1272a624-e305-57b3-89b3-1c91c7438b2c'}, {'abstract': 'Before a coming three-game trip, the Nets held an open practice at Fort Hamilton in Brooklyn, and learned some history about the borough they now call home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/12/sports/basketball/on-holiday-a-local-lesson-for-the-nets.html', 'snippet': 'Before a coming three-game trip, the Nets held an open practice at Fort Hamilton in Brooklyn, and learned some history about the borough they now call home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Nets are beginning their second year as Brooklyn tenants, and their effort to blend in took them to a far