-faults-kerry-for-breakdown-in-talks.html', 'snippet': 'In posts on Twitter, Iran’s foreign minister challenged Secretary of State John Kerry and French officials over the failure of nuclear talks in Geneva.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The Iranian foreign minister turned to a Twitter account late Monday to challenge Secretary of State John Kerry over the failure of weekend talks in Geneva to produce agreement on Tehran’s nuclear program.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 847}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 726, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1469, 'width': 1041, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/BRIEFS/BRIEFS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Iranian O