escribed for a quarter of Americans over 40.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/health/new-guidelines-redefine-use-of-statins.html', 'snippet': 'The guidelines from the nation’s leading heart organizations will fundamentally reshape the use of cholesterol-lowering statin medicines now prescribed for a quarter of Americans over 40.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The nation’s leading heart organizations released new guidelines on Tuesday that will fundamentally reshape the use of cholesterol-lowering statin medicines, which are now prescribed for a quarter of Americans over 40. Patients on statins will no longer need to lower their cholesterol levels to specific numerical targets monitored by regular blood tests, as has been recommended for decades. Simply taking the right dose of a statin will be sufficient, the guidelines say.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1093, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1093}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 563, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1164, 'width': 639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/JP-HEART/JP-HEART-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Experts Reshape Treatment Guide for Cholesterol', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Experts Reshape Treatment Guide For Cholesterol', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heart', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kolata, Gina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cholesterol', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statins (Cholesterol-Lowering Drugs)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-12T21:09:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gina Kolata', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kolata', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5607620e-31ad-54c3-ab72-a1e9fa2192c6', 'word_count': 1237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5607620e-31ad-54c3-ab72-a1e9fa2192c6'}, {'abstract': 'Doctors often “self-disclose” to patients in an attempt to empathize. But contrary to what might be expected, such self-disclosures often turned out not to be helpful in addressing patients’ concerns or building rapport.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/12/when-doctors-share-with-their-patients/', 'snippet': 'Doctors often “self-disclose” to patients in an attempt to empathize. But contrary to what might be expected, such self-disclosures often turned out not to be helpful in addressing patients’ concerns or building rapport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At our very first visit, I was overwhelmed by all of the issues my new patient faced. She was nearly 300 pounds and her diabetes was raging out of control. She had asthma, but smoked to ease her anxiety. Her obesity severely limited her mobility, but the constant stress in her life led her to overeat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 446, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 446, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Doctors Share With Their Patients', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-12T21:13:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danielle Ofri, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danielle', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ofri', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b656047-c142-51df-a618-2ea17db841c1', 'word_count': 899, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b656047-c142-51df-a618-2ea17db841c1'}, {'abstract': 'The commission agreed to defer the prosecution of the administrator of a small hedge fund accused of fraud, employing a new tool that encourages individuals to cooperate in investigations.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/12/s-e-c-tries-new-tack-in-hedge-fund-fraud-case/', 'snippet': 'The commission agreed to defer the prosecution of the administrator of a small hedge fund accused of fraud, employing a new tool that encourages individuals to cooperate in investigations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has for the first time employed a new tool to encourage individuals involved in fraud investigations to cooperate by deferring their prosecution.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/business/dbpix-sec/dbpix-sec-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/business/dbpix-sec/dbpix-sec-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/business/dbpix-sec/dbpix-sec-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/business/dbpix-sec/dbpix-sec-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt