ey', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0c739ed-5d17-5d83-9f1b-16915e7c281e', 'word_count': 776, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0c739ed-5d17-5d83-9f1b-16915e7c281e'}, {'abstract': 'Warrantless searches of “the center of the private lives of our people” should be strictly limited by the Supreme Court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/opinion/when-the-police-enter-a-home.html', 'snippet': 'Warrantless searches of “the center of the private lives of our people” should be strictly limited by the Supreme Court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The home is “at the very core” of the Fourth Amendment’s protection against unreasonable government intrusion, as the Supreme Court has said repeatedly. It is where a person’s expectation of privacy is greatest. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When the Police Enter a Home', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When the Police Enter a Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fourth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T01:42:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f17559f-4c4a-5f4f-9365-0270c9033cca', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f17559f-4c4a-5f4f-9365-0270c9033cca'}, {'abstract': 'The Force Intervention Brigade routed rebels in the Democratic Republic of Congo, a departure from peacekeepers’ usually passive approach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/world/africa/new-un-brigades-aggressive-stance-in-africa-brings-success-and-risks.html', 'snippet': 'The Force Intervention Brigade routed rebels in the Democratic Republic of Congo, a departure from peacekeepers’ usually passive approach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIWANJA, Democratic Republic of Congo — When Martin Kobler, the newly appointed United Nations representative, arrived this summer for his first visit to this small but strategic town, armed members of the M23 rebel group lined the airstrip, silently watching him land and disembark. Their presence sent an unmistakable message: the rebels, not Congolese officials, controlled Kiwanja.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/world/PEACEKEEPERS/PEACEKEEPERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New U.N. Brigade’s Aggressive Stance in Africa Brings Success, and Risks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New U.N. Brigade’s Aggressive Stance in Africa Brings Success, and Risks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kulish, Nicholas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Congo, Democratic Republic of (Congo-Kinshasa)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Department of Peacekeeping Operations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malawi', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Africa', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tanzania', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ban Ki-moon', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'March 23 Movement', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T01:42:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kulish and Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kulish', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68c74f6a-63f6-56a7-a2c8-29a88e1fd7ec', 'word_count': 1296, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68c74f6a-63f6-56a7-a2c8-29a88e1fd7ec'}, {'abstract': 'The N.B.A. has put new emphasis on a longstanding rule that prohibits players from holding the ball or redirecting it after a successful field goal. It is known as the delay-of-game penalty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/sports/basketball/hands-off-the-ball-or-face-a-technical-foul.html', 'snippet': 'The N.B.A. has put new emphasis on a longstanding rule that prohibits players from holding the ball or redirecting it after a successful field goal. It is known as the delay-of-game penalty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Professional basketball players can contort their bodies like acrobats and power through defenses like bulldozers, but many of these athletes have found themselves completely flummoxed this season by a rule so fundamental that it sounds as if it were designed for third graders: Leave the ball alone.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/sports/NBAillo/NBAillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/sports/NBAillo/NBAillo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/sports/NBAillo/NBAillo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/201