ut-his-positions-on-the-military-very-carefully.html', 'snippet': 'Senator Rand Paul spoke Tuesday at the Citadel in Charleston, S.C., sharing his opinions on military intervention, the Pentagon and cutting waste in the armed forces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLESTON, S.C. — A few months after the Sept. 11 terrorist attacks, President George W. Bush came to the Citadel, the military college here, to lay out his plans to reconfigure the armed forces for his interventionist posture known as the Bush Doctrine.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/us/SUB-RANDPAUL/SUB-RANDPAUL-thumbLarge.jpg'