re Chinese leaders met this week, has a colorful history hosting some of the most important gatherings in modern Chinese history.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/12/colorful-history-of-a-power-hotel-in-beijing/', 'snippet': 'The Jingxi Hotel, where Chinese leaders met this week, has a colorful history hosting some of the most important gatherings in modern Chinese history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the untrained eye, the Jingxi Hotel, with its box-like, Soviet-style architecture dating to the late 1950s, is just like any number of buildings that line Beijing’s central east-west boulevard. But beneath its deceptively gray and drab exterior, the Jingxi may be the most concentrated unofficial seat of power in China: For the last four days, it was the site of the Third Plenum of the Communist Party’s Central Committee, where Chinese leaders tried to hammer out a reform agenda for the coming decade and beyond.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Colorful History of a Power Hotel in Beijing', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deng Xiaoping', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Li Keqiang', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mao Zedong', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ye Jianying', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "People's Liberation Army (China)", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T04:56:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'sub