 said it was targeting a syndicate based in Laos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/world/asia/us-to-offer-reward-in-wildlife-trafficking-fight.html', 'snippet': 'In what officials said was the first time such a reward had been offered, the State Department said it was targeting a syndicate based in Laos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — Taking a page from the battle against international drug cartels, the United States announced on Wednesday a $1 million reward for information to help dismantle one of Asia’s largest wildlife-trafficking syndicates.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Offers Reward in Wildlife-Trade Fight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Offers Reward in Wildlife-Trade Fight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fuller, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Laos', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Far East, South and Southeast Asia and Pacific Areas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vixay Keosavang', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rhinoceroses', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ivory', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poaching (Wildlife)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T12:07:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'b