ecome his chief of staff in December, the administration said Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/former-lobbyist-becomes-biden-chief-of-staff/', 'snippet': 'Steve Ricchetti, a senior aide to Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr., will become his chief of staff in December, the administration said Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Steve Ricchetti, a former lobbyist and Clinton administration veteran, will replace Bruce Reed as Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr.’s chief of staff next month, the White House announced Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Lobbyist Becomes Biden Chief of Staff', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T15:37:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fb47155-dd43-5986-be94-d04d70a1fe97', 'word_count': 239, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fb47155-dd43-5986-be94-d04d70a1fe97'}, {'abstract': 'After leaving “The Walking Dead” following a dispute with the show’s network, Frank Darabont is returning to television with “Mob City,” which includes the “Walking Dead” co-star Jon Bernthal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/arts/television/frank-darabont-prepares-mob-city-for-tnt.html', 'snippet': 'After leaving “The Walking Dead” following a dispute with the show’s network, Frank Darabont is returning to television with “Mob City,” which includes the “Walking Dead” co-star Jon Bernthal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In preparing for “Mob City,” a fictional look at the seedy underbelly of 1940s-era