 'uri': 'nyt://article/8edcd568-e165-5a62-b9c7-bdcfa4b6a149'}, {'abstract': 'Lemuy Island, in the Chiloé Archipelago, is 37 square miles of hills, farms, dirt roads and ocean views.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/travel/off-the-coast-of-chile-an-island-getaway.html', 'snippet': 'Lemuy Island, in the Chiloé Archipelago, is 37 square miles of hills, farms, dirt roads and ocean views.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With only the vaguest of plans, I pulled my rental car onto the ferry to Lemuy Island, 37 square miles of hills and farms and dirt roads and ocean views. As I headed out from the main island of the Chiloé Archipelago, off the Chilean coast, I had a simple agenda for that afternoon: drive around, visit one of the old wooden churches the islands are famous for, see what else happens.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17frugal1/17frugal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17frugal1/17frugal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17frugal1/17frugal1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17frugal1/17frugal1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1067, 'width': 1599, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17frugal1/17frugal1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/