of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8875ef79-7665-572e-9284-87976009cc76', 'word_count': 942, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8875ef79-7665-572e-9284-87976009cc76'}, {'abstract': 'The $142 million sale of Francis Bacon’s triptych of Lucian Freud has a matching, perhaps a bit tenuous, trio of lessons for the broader world of finance, the author writes.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/finance-lessons-from-the-world-of-art-auctions/', 'snippet': 'The $142 million sale of Francis Bacon’s triptych of Lucian Freud has a matching, perhaps a bit tenuous, trio of lessons for the broader world of finance, the author writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The record-busting $142 million sale on Tuesday by Christie’s of Francis Bacon’s triptych of Lucian Freud – not to mention the unprecedented New York auction total of almost $700 million – shows a contemporary art market in heady territory. It’s possible, if a bit tenuous, to extract a matching trio of lessons for the broader world of finance.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Finance Lessons, From the World of Art Auctions', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bacon, Francis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T20:11:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Beales', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beales', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f123ab6-7034-5b0a-a007-22fe662ee3a4', 'word_count': 410, 'uri': 'ny