', 'word_count': 1895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05a1e91c-e7c0-5f09-9a26-db41cbf46235'}, {'abstract': 'Whether classic or contemporary, the bar cart is a good way to keep the cocktails rolling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/garden/bar-carts-wheels-with-a-buzz.html', 'snippet': 'Whether classic or contemporary, the bar cart is a good way to keep the cocktails rolling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When a guest orders a martini at Dukes Bar in London, the 105-year-old establishment once frequented by Ian Fleming where the “shaken not stirred” line is said to have originated, a barman will prepare the drink tableside using provisions from a cart. If the guest is especially lucky, the barman will be Alessandro Palazzi, who has been the bar manager for seven years.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/garden/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/07/garden/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/garden/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/garden/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2043, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/07/garden/20131107-SHOP-slide-0348/20131107-SHOP-sli