n struck, the authorities were reaching remote areas of the central Philippines that were hard hit by the storm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated 1:35 p.m., Nov. 14 The effects of Typhoon Haiyan’s destructive path on remote areas of the central Philippines are being pieced together as the authorities, journalists and relief workers are finally reaching hard-hit small towns and island fishing villages in eastern Samar Province. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Destruction and Dazed Survivors Found in Remote Philippine Areas', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoon Haiyan (2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philippines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T23:40:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6164bd39-c2b8-5e15-96dc-7ac915a5659d', 'word_count': 627, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6164bd39-c2b8-5e15-96dc-7ac915a5659d'}, {'abstract': 'Tax avoidance mechanisms are mostly legal and take advantage of rules written in the days when assets were tangible and difficult to move.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/tax-wizardry-accomplished-with-an-offbeat-merger/', 'snippet': 'Tax avoidance mechanisms are mostly legal and take advantage of rules written in the days when assets were tangible and difficult to move.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It used to be easier to avoid paying corporate taxes. Back in the 1990s, many corporations used tax shelters that had little economic substance other than to dodge tax liability. Aggressive enforcement actions by the Internal Revenue Service, coupled with changes in accounting and reporting requirements, have combined to make these shelters unattractive to most companies.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/business/Tax/Tax-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tax Wizardry Accomplished With an Offbeat Merger', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tax Wizardry Accomplished With an Offbeat Merger', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-13T23:41:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By VICTOR FLEISCHER', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Victor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'FLEISCHER', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1964b15e-608d-5ec7-ae85-c8341515ee21', 'word_count': 1314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1964b15e-608d-5ec7-ae85-c8341515ee21'}, {'abstract': 'The fashion stylist has no use for cookbooks, an approach that also applies to her work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/fashion/carlyn-cerf-de-dudzeele-a-legend-whos-unafraid-to-say-so.html', 'snippet': 'The fashion stylist has no use for cookbooks, an approach that also applies to her work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TRENDS? PFFT. They mean nothing to Carlyne Cerf de Dudzeele. She prefers the staying power of a Chanel jacket, an Hermès Birkin bag and jeans. Like Manolo Blahnik pumps, navy turtlenecks or little black dresses by Azzedine Alaïa, “these things are never démodé,” she said in her Gallic gargle, “never, never, neverrh!” ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/fashion/14ROW5/14zROW5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/14/fashion/14ROW5/14zROW5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/fashion/14ROW5/14zROW5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/14/fashion/14ROW5/14zROW5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name