e/ca8d3737-1f3b-58b4-8f11-3ddd7ef28645'}, {'abstract': 'Commonwealth leaders must address human rights violations and denial of press freedoms that is undermining democracy in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/opinion/sri-lankas-climate-of-fear.html', 'snippet': 'Commonwealth leaders must address human rights violations and denial of press freedoms that is undermining democracy in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since the end of Sri Lanka’s civil war in 2009, the government of President Mahinda Rajapaksa has had a record of serious human rights violations and failed to provide accountability for wartime abuses. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sri Lanka’s Climate of Fear', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sri Lanka’s Climate of Fear', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sri Lanka', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajapaksa, Mahinda', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Censorship', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tamils (Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T02:15:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/901e28ee-fcbc-5a2c-bced-5d3da03a79c5', 'word_count': 427, 'uri': 'nyt://article/901e28ee-fcbc-5a2c-bced-5d3da03a79c5'}, {'abstract': 'The Justice Department’s approval of the American Airlines-US Airways deal may hurt consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/opinion/an-unwise-airline-merger.html', 'snippet': 'The Justice Department’s approval of the American Airlines-US Airways deal may hurt consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In August, the Justice Department’s antitrust division filed a lawsuit to block the merger of American Airlines and US Airways, which would create the world’s largest airline and concentrate 80 percent of the domestic air-travel business in the hands of four companies. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Unwise Airline Merger', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Unwise Airline Merger', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN AIRLINES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'US Airways Group Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antitrust Laws and Competition Issues', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T02:15:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0b8e1a3-06e6-5b78-971b-bb7d8bef7ea9', 'word_count': 462, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0b8e1a3-06e6-5b78-971b-bb7d8bef7ea9'}, {'abstract': 'Inspired by impatience with Congress and the Canadian Parliament, states and provinces are taking it upon themselves to do something.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/opinion/a-new-alliance-on-climate-change.html', 'snippet': 'Inspired by impatience with Congress and the Canadian Parliament, states and provinces are taking it upon themselves to do something.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an effort to compensate for the failure of central governments to address the dangers of climate change with comprehensive national policies, cities, states and regions have developed their own strategies to rein in emissions of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases. California’s ambitious plan aims to reduce emissions 80 percent by 2050 by requiring cleaner cars, more energy-efficient buildings and renewable fuels. Nine northeastern states have joined in a regional trading program aimed at reducing power-plant emissions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Alliance on Climate Change', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Alliance on Climate Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'British Columbia (Canada)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (State)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T02:15:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe9921d4-7e9a-53a7-abfb-d7b363479dd1', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe9921d4-7e9a-53a7-abfb-d7b363479dd1'}, {'abstract': 'States are flouting federal law by refusing to process benefits of same-sex spouses in the National Guard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/opinion/resistance-to-marriage-equality.html', 'snippet': 'States are flouting federal law by refusing to process benefits of same-sex spouses in the National Guard.', 'lead_paragraph': '“This is wrong.” That was Defense Secretary Chuck Hagel’s blunt response late last month to states defying his order in August that same-sex spouses of military personnel be given full spousal and family benefits, including health care coverage and housing allowances, on an equal, nondiscriminatory basis. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Resistance to Marriage Equality', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Resistance to Marriage Equality', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Guard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense of Marriage Act (1996)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T02:15:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_materi