imes.com/2013/11/13/does-my-virginity-have-a-shelf-life/', 'snippet': 'At 35, I’ve been holding out for so long, how can I change now? And yet I have doubts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was 20, one of my close friends was killed in a car crash. At the funeral, as I watched her coffin carried down the aisle, another friend leaned over to whisper: “At least she wasn’t a virgin.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Does My Virginity Have a Shelf Life?', 'kicker': 'Private Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Does My Virginity Have a Shelf Life?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Abstinence (Sexual)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T02:30:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amanda McCracken', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amanda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McCracken', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6ac6deba-17c9-5bbb-b311-8e84c45171f6', 'word_count': 956, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6ac6deba-17c9-5bbb-b311-8e84c45171f6'}, {'abstract': 'Bernie Ecclestone, accused of fraud in the 2006 sale of Formula One’s commercial rights, is at the center of a London case that has overshadowed the sport’s 19-race championship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/sports/autoracing/for-bernie-ecclestone-the-formula-one-chief-twists-and-turbulence-in-court.html', 'snippet': 'Bernie Ecclestone, accused of fraud in the 2006 sale of Formula One’s commercial rights, is at the center of a London case that has overs