rsue his goal of explaining monetary policy to the general public', 'lead_paragraph': 'Janet Yellen will take the stage Thursday morning in what is effectively her debut as the Federal Reserve’s new leader. But the job still belongs to Ben S. Bernanke, who on Wednesday night held a low-key question-and-answer session with teachers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bernanke the Teacher, Talking to Teachers', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teachers and School Employees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T02:46:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54489c6f-6b16-5547-9b43-b6c5a2438d44', 'word_count': 503, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54489c6f-6b16-5547-9b43-b6c5a2438d44'}, {'abstract': 'Filipinos are losing patience with Benigno S. Aquino III after he apparently was caught off guard by the scope of the calamity wrought by a typhoon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/world/asia/philippines-president-faces-growing-anger.html', 'snippet': 'Filipinos are losing patience with Benigno S. Aquino III after he apparently was caught off guard by the scope of the calamity wrought by a typhoon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANILA — Five days after a devastating typhoon swept through the midsection of this impoverished island nation, Filipinos are losing patience with the slow relief ef