ident Obama’s security detail after being accused of leaving a bullet in a woman’s hotel room, officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/us/politics/secret-service-officer-is-demoted-from-presidential-detail.html', 'snippet': 'Ignacio Zamora Jr., a supervisor, was removed from President Obama’s security detail after being accused of leaving a bullet in a woman’s hotel room, officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A Secret Service supervisor has been removed from President Obama’s security detail and demoted after being accused of leaving a bullet in a woman’s room at a luxury hotel near the White House this year, senior federal law enforcement officials said Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Secret Service Officer Is Demoted From Presidential Detail', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Secret Service Officer Demoted', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Michael S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Secret Service', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zamora, Ignacio Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T03:45:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael S. Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/622e0750-759b-5e0c-905b-07fd6c5e36f6', 'word_count': 299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/622e0750-759b-5e0c-905b-07fd6c5e36f6'}, {'abstract': 'The online real estate brokerage has raised $50 million in a new round of mezzanine capital, led by Tiger Global Management and T. Rowe Price.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/13/redfin-raises-50-million-in-latest-financing-round/', 'snippet': 'The online real estate brokerage has raised $50 million in a new round of mezzanine capital, led by Tiger Global Management and T. Rowe Price.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While the online home information space may be crowded, investors seem to believe that Redfin has a good chance of standing out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 748, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1495, 'width': 2047, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-redfin/dbpix-redfin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'th