ppearance before the Senate Banking Committee on Thursday morning is mostly a chance for senators to probe what kind of leader she will be.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Watch For at the Yellen Hearing', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quantitative Easing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yellen, Janet L', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on Banking', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T12:25:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb7ff87d-9ff0-5cd7-b154-2c9a862e89df', 'word_count': 685, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb7ff87d-9ff0-5cd7-b154-2c9a862e89df'}, {'abstract': 'The rising social media platform, popular with teenagers, rejected a buyout offer worth billions of dollars because its founders believe making a deal now would leave billions more on the table.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/daily-report-snapchat-waits-for-a-better-offer-than-facebooks/', 'snippet': 'The rising social media platform, popular with teenagers, rejected a buyout offer worth billions of dollars because its founders believe making a deal now would leave billions more on the table.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wh