t a scorecard.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Robert Plant Produces a Documentary Series About Malian Music', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Plant, Robert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mali', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T16:32:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e0eb3a9-be9e-53f1-a800-dde3ca42513e', 'word_count': 263, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e0eb3a9-be9e-53f1-a800-dde3ca42513e'}, {'abstract': 'Take the scenic route in timeless, relaxed silhouettes smartened up with sporty belts and tailored jackets — perfect for a grand tour or a weekend jaunt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/11/17/t-magazine/far-and-away-fashion.html', 'snippet': 'Take the scenic route in timeless, relaxed silhouettes smartened up with sporty belts and tailored jackets — perfect for a grand tour or a weekend jaunt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Take the scenic route in timeless, relaxed silhouettes smartened up with sporty belts and tailored jackets — perfect for a grand tour or a weekend jaunt.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'T WINTER TRAVEL', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T16:36:56+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'sectio