 of intensive care and palliative care, I am struck by how many of my colleagues are surprised, even disturbed, by this pairing.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/they-call-me-dr-kevorkian/', 'snippet': 'As one of the only doctors I know who straddles the worlds of intensive care and palliative care, I am struck by how many of my colleagues are surprised, even disturbed, by this pairing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The patient had a severe pneumonia of advanced AIDS. He’d been lying in our intensive care unit for three weeks, a breathing tube thrust into his raw airway, his face a mixture of pain and resignation. His weakened lung tissue had popped in several areas, requiring chest tubes to drain the pockets of pressurized air. He looked like a sea creature with multiple tentacles. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 676}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 650, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/health/15well_doctor/15well_doctor-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'They Call Me ‘Dr. Kevorkian’', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospice Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-14T18:37:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jessica Nutik Zitter, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jessica', 'middlename': 'Nutik', 'lastname': 'Zitter', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2d1dea7-b86b-5479-a8ff-7c259c9e31b7', 'word_count': 921, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2d1dea7-b86b-5479-a8ff-7c259c9e31b7'}, {'abstract': 'Janet L. Yellen, at her confirmation hearing before Congress to become the Federal Reserve’s first chairwoman, defended the Fed’s steps to spur economic growth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000002552103/yellens-opening-remarks.html', 'snippet': 'Janet L. Yellen, at her confirmation hearing before Congress to become the Federal Reserve’s first chairwoman, defended the Fed’s steps to spur economic growth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Janet L. Yellen, at her confirmation hearing before Congress to become the Federal Reserve’s first chairwoman, defended the Fed’s steps to spur economic growth.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype':