e710a15-fa4c-51ce-8dd9-50b9c8d25e21'}, {'abstract': 'Sony’s PlayStation 4, due out on Friday, and Microsoft’s Xbox One, coming in one week, accelerate the game console’s shift to multipurpose machine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/15/arts/video-games/sizing-up-the-playstation-4-and-xbox-one.html', 'snippet': 'Sony’s PlayStation 4, due out on Friday, and Microsoft’s Xbox One, coming in one week, accelerate the game console’s shift to multipurpose machine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE video game console is dead, and the body has been cold for a long time. Sure, Sony and Microsoft are releasing what everyone describes as new game consoles, but the term is a misnomer. The Sony PlayStation 4, released on Friday, and Microsoft’s Xbox One, due next Friday, are game consoles in the same way that the iPhone is a telephone. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15CONSOLE_SPAN/15CONSOLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 281, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15CONSOLE_SPAN/15CONSOLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 281}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15CONSOLE_SPAN/15CONSOLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15CONSOLE_SPAN/15CONSOLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15CONSOLE_SPAN/15CONSOLE_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':