83'}, {'abstract': 'A guide to a range of cultural events in New York, including discussions, film screenings and exhibitions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/15/arts/spare-times-for-nov-15-21.html', 'snippet': 'A guide to a range of cultural events in New York, including discussions, film screenings and exhibitions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Iranian New Wave 1960s-1970s Film Series (through next Friday) When his documentaries about life in Iran under the pro-Western shah, Mohammad Reza Pahlavi, focused too much on the poverty he saw, Kamran Shirdel — originally commissioned by the government to make these films — was expelled, and forced to leave some work behind. Four of his short films — several completed after the Islamic Revolution of 1979 — will be screened on Wednesday, starting at 6:30 p.m., at Asia Society, 725 Park Avenue, at 70th Street.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare Times for Nov. 15-21', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spare Times', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-15T00:11:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Mancuso', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mancuso', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5e264bb-0fc2-5322-92c0-b3ffa46089f2', 'word_count': 2862, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5e264bb-0fc2-5322-92c0-b3ffa46089f2'}, {'abstract': 'Post 154’s menu of tasty entrees and small plates, many with Latin accents, light up a renovated space in Westport, Conn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/nyregion/a-review-of-post-154-in-westport.html', 'snippet': 'Post 154’s menu of tasty entrees and small plates, many with Latin accents, light up a renovated space in Westport, Conn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you have not been to Westport recently, you might be surprised to find that its old limestone-and-brick post office, which opened in 1935 on the town’s main thoroughfare, is now a snappy new restaurant, called Post 154, that fairly rocks in prime time. ', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Instead of Mail, Delivering Tasty Morsels', 'kicker': 'Dining Westport', 'conte