, a former TV repairman, has subsisted on disability benefits since a motorcycle accident left him in a wheelchair. Their home is a shabby motel somewhere in west central Florida. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/arts/15SUNLIGHT_SPAN/SUNLIGHT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'High Price of Barely Getting By', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'High Price Of Barely Getting By', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Collyer, Laurie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Watts, Naomi', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dillon, Matt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Sunlight Jr. (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-15T00:58:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5a7bd7d-3def-56b4-a98b-3dc6a931d146', 'word_count': 476, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5a7bd7d-3def-56b4-a98b-3dc6a931d146'}, {'abstract': 'The bank’s stock is up 59 percent this year, reflecting its growing skill at avoiding the sort of squalls that battered it in recent years.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/14/chiefs-vision-for-morgan-stanley-is-showing-some-success/', 'snippet': 'The bank’s stock is up 59 percent this year, reflecting its growing skill at avoiding the sort of squalls that battered it in recent years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thunderclouds were gathering in April when James P. Gorman, Morgan Stanley’s chief executive, went for a run on the beach on Amelia Island in Florida after attending a closed-door meeting of the bank’s top stockbrokers. After just a few miles, the storm began to pick up speed, prompting Mr. Gorman to turn around and head for safety.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/15/business/dbpix-morgan/dbpix-morgan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xl