ry grievance against the Miami Dolphins challenging his suspension for conduct detrimental to the team.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/15/sports/football/incognito-files-grievance-over-suspension-by-dolphins.html', 'snippet': 'Richie Incognito, accused of bullying teammate Jonathan Martin, has filed a noninjury grievance against the Miami Dolphins challenging his suspension for conduct detrimental to the team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — Richie Incognito, accused of bullying Jonathan Martin, his teammate on the Dolphins’ offensive line, has filed a noninjury grievance against the Miami Dolphins challenging his suspension for conduct detrimental to the team. Under the N.F.L.’s collective bargaining agreement, an independent arbitrator hears all noninjury grievances, and Incognito has asked that his be heard as soon as possible. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Incognito Files Grievance Over Suspension by Dolphins', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Incognito Files Grievance Over Suspension by Dolphins', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Incognito, Richie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Dolphins', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League Players Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bullies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Jonathan (1989- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-15T01:59:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', '