/photography-fair-arrives-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'The 17th edition of Paris Photo, which runs through Sunday under the dome of the Grand Palais, includes 136 international galleries from 24 countries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — If light is the key ingredient of photography, there was no lack of it at the Paris Photo preview earlier this week. The 17th edition of the annual photography fair, which runs through Sunday under the dome of the Grand Palais, includes 136 international galleries from 24 countries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photography Fair Arrives in Paris', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-15T17:28:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jake Cigainero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jake', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cigainero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08f3fc6b-8cab-5e2f-b686-e92c496df353', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08f3fc6b-8cab-5e2f-b686-e92c496df353'}, {'abstract': 'The Clinton Group has been agitating for change at the top for more than two weeks and has called for an overhaul of the board.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/15/valuevision-rejects-demands-from-activist-investor/', 'snippet': 'The Clinton Group has been agitating for change at the top for more than two weeks and has called for an overhaul of the board.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ValueVision, the Internet and television shopping network, has rebuffed demands from the activist investor Clinton Group to overhaul its board, saying that the investor has no legal basis to make those demands. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't