64b0'}, {'abstract': 'The Petite Ceinture, an abandoned track circling the city, offers intrepid hikers a rare perspective.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/travel/above-below-and-around-paris-on-foot.html', 'snippet': 'The Petite Ceinture, an abandoned track circling the city, offers intrepid hikers a rare perspective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We drew a deep breath before entering the tunnel. The garbage strewn around the entrance was about as inviting as the prospect of walking nearly a mile under one of Paris’s most famous parks not knowing what, or whom, to expect. We were in the heart of the city, but completely removed from it.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17EXPLORER4_SPAN/17EXPLORER4_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17EXPLORER4_SPAN/17EXPLORER4_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17EXPLORER4_SPAN/17EXPLORER4_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17EXPLORER4_SPAN/17EXPLORER4_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17EXPLORER4_SPAN/17EXPLORER4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/17EXPLORER4_SPAN/17EXPLORER4-thumbSt