ract': 'Allie Brosh, the Hyperbole and a Half blogger, talks about her art on the occasion of her first book being published.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/15/video-hyperbole-comedy-and-angst/', 'snippet': 'Allie Brosh, the Hyperbole and a Half blogger, talks about her art on the occasion of her first book being published.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Allie Brosh’s blog, Hyperbole and a Half, has a devoted following, attracting as many as five million readers a month. Her first post, in July 2009, had no pictures at all, but her drawings have become increasingly prominent. Although they’re somewhat crude, they reflect raw emotion and seamlessly blend comedy and pain. Ms. Brosh tells stories about her childhood, her life in Oregon with her husband and two dogs, and her struggles with depression, which caused a 19-month hiatus from her blog that ended in May. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: ‘Hyperbole,’ Comedy and Angst', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic Books and Strips', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brosh, Allie', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-15T18:30:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gabe Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gabe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63a8c17c-0824-5f62-9dc3-fcc06d1b915f', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63a8c17c-0824-5f62-9dc3-fcc06d1b915f'}, {'abstract': 'The media company, which includes Forbes magazine and a growing digital presence, said it had hired Deutsche Bank to seek offers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/16/business/media/forbes-says-it-is-for-sale.html', 'snippet': 'The media company, which includes Forbes magazine and a growing digital presence, said it had hired Deutsche Bank to seek offers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Forbes Media, which publishes Forbes magazine and has been making an extensive push into digital media and native advertising, is up for sale, the company confirmed in an email to the staff Friday morning.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/business/FORBES/FORBES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/16/business/FORBES/FORBES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 714}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/business/FORBES/FORBES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 861, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/business/FORBES/FORBES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1721, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/business/FORBES/FORBES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/16/business/FORBES/FORBES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ