r,  it would cost $125,000.  But this is a Chevy with a starting price of $51,995.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/automobiles/autoreviews/stingray-returns-with-styling-a-la-mode.html', 'snippet': 'The new Corvette Stingray’s ambitions are loftier than the previous Corvette, a point underscored by the return of the Stingray name. If Porsche made this car,  it would cost $125,000.  But this is a Chevy with a starting price of $51,995.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Imagine, if you will, that an unnamed manufacturer just released an all-new sports car. It rockets from 0 to 60 miles per hour in 3.8 seconds, pulls more than one lateral g on the skid pad and has a carbon-fiber hood and roof. The interior includes dual high-resolution screens, top-quality materials and the option of racing seats. The manual transmission, with 7 forward speeds, will execute rev-matched downshifts, and it’s mounted at the rear of the car for optimal weight distribution. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17STING1/17STING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 312, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17STING1/17STING1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 312}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17STING1/17STING1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 533, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17STING1/17STING1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1048, 'width': 2013, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 