 have been taken by militants who are lashing out at France for financial and ideological reasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ABUJA, Nigeria — The kidnappers of a French priest seized in northern Cameroon shouted for joy and fired celebratory shots in the air, one of his church superiors there said Friday, but only after crossing the border into Nigeria, in a region rife with members of the Islamist sect Boko Haram.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'French Say Kidnapped Priest Was Moved to Nigeria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boko Haram', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cameroon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vandenbeusch, Georges', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-15T21:47:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nossiter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2180829c-3a51-5822-9acd-1af262c94acb', 'word_count': 469, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2180829c-3a51-5822-9acd-1af262c94acb'}, {'abstract': 'An auction on Thursday is being billed as the first high-end car auction in New York City in more than a decade and aims to raise the aesthetic regard for automotive design.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/automobiles/collectibles/at-auction-masterpieces-of-the-drivable-kind.html', 'snippet': 'An auction on Thursday is being billed as the first high-end car auction in New York City in more than a decade and aims to raise the aesthetic regard for automotive design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With paintings and sculptures selling for record prices in recent weeks, it makes sense for auction houses to market cars as artworks, too. That would seem to be at least part of the logic behind\xa0a coming sale by Sotheby’s and RM Auctions ambitiously titled “Art of the Automobile.” \xa0 ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 366}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1248, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/automobiles/17AUCTION1/17AUCTION1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wid