ng the Seminoles’ quarterback, Jameis Winston, who is a Heisman Trophy contender.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/16/sports/ncaafootball/prosecutor-digs-into-complaint-leveled-at-fsu-quarterback.html', 'snippet': 'A Florida state attorney only learned this week about a 2012 report of sexual battery involving the Seminoles’ quarterback, Jameis Winston, who is a Heisman Trophy contender.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TALLAHASSEE, Fla. — William N. Meggs, a state attorney for Florida’s Second Judicial Circuit, said he was not certain how a sexual assault complaint from almost a year ago involving Florida State quarterback Jameis Winston had just crossed his desk, but he promised he would “get to the bottom of it.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prosecutor Plans to Interview F.S.U. Quarterback’s Accuser', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prosecutor Plans to Interview F.S.U. Quarterback’s Accuser', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glier, Ray', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Florida State University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winston, Jameis', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-16T02:14:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ray Glier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ray', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7150d2db-ff3b-5f71-a8f7-9d4d73076ac3', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7150d2db-ff3b-5f71-a8f7-9d4d73076ac3'}, {'abstract': 'The Open Space Institute has bought numerous parcels surrounding park borders and then sold them to the State of New York, at cost or below.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/16/nyregion/conservation-group-keeps-buying-land-helping-state-parks-grow.html', 'snippet': 'The Open Space Institute has bought numerous parcels surrounding park borders and then sold them to the State of New York, at cost or below.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEWASKA STATE PARK, N.Y. — Over the last 25 years, this park in upstate Ulster County has doubled in size. Farther south, in Putnam County, Fahnestock State Park has grown even more, and in Orange County, Sterling Forest State Park has gained almost 15,000 acres.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/nyregion/parks-1/parks-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/16/nyregion/parks-1/parks-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/nyregion/parks-1/parks-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/nyregion/parks-1/parks-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/16/nyregion/parks-1/parks-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013