'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/5820dbe7-3cb8-51fa-a14a-0c6d09b884c9'}, {'abstract': 'Indiana began its season on a 9-0 streak, but of the 13 teams that have started at 10-0 or better, only three have won the N.B.A. finals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/sports/basketball/the-pacers-perfect-beginning-will-not-guarantee-them-a-happy-ending.html', 'snippet': 'Indiana began its season on a 9-0 streak, but of the 13 teams that have started at 10-0 or better, only three have won the N.B.A. finals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When an N.B.A. team starts the season on an unbeaten run, curiosity always kicks in. What is the longest streak without a loss to start the season? What does a soaring start say about a team’s chances when the playoffs arrive six months down the road?', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 896}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 686, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1372, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/sports/DOG-dribble/DOG-dribble-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Pacers’ Perfect Beginning Will Not Guarantee Them a Happy Ending', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the Pacers, a Perfect Beginning Does Not Guarantee a Championship', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indiana Pacers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hibbert, Roy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stephenson, Lance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'George, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-16T19:09:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c31a361-a3c2-530f-a54d-c512322dbedc', 'word_count': 693, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c31a361-a3c2-530f-a54d-c512322dbedc'}, {'abstract': 'The surprising story behind the most famous portrait of Gettysburg.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/16/painting-picketts-charge/', 'snippet': 'The surprising story behind the most famous portrait of Gettysburg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like other Northern states, Pennsylvania had much business to attend to in the weeks and months that followed the end of the Civil War: there were regiments to be dissolved, soldiers to be mustered out, and wounded, widowed and orphaned to be provided for. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Painting Pickett’s Charge', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gettysburg (Pa)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Harrisburg (Pa)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-16T19:15:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Curt Miner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Curt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Miner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26ee449a-10ad-531e-a3e5-9180fc06fa0f', 'word_count': 1595, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26ee449a-10ad-531e-a3e5-9180fc06fa0f'}, {'abstract': 'High hopes for buprenorphine, an effective treatment for opioid addiction, have been tempered by a messy reality: health complications and deaths, unscrupulous doctors and a reputation as a street drug.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/health/in-demand-in-clinics-and-on-the-street-bupe-can-be-savior-or-menace.html', 'snippet': 'High hopes for buprenorphine, an effective treatment for opioid addiction, have been tempered by a messy reality: health complications and deaths, unscrupulous doctors and a reputation as a street drug.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Shawn Schneider, a carpenter and rock musician, the descent into addiction began one Wisconsin winter with a fall from a rooftop construction site onto the frozen ground below. As the potent pain pills prescribed for his injuries became his obsessive focus, he lost everything: his band, his job, his wife, his will to live.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 341}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 583, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1154, 'width': 2028, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/health/addiction-2/addiction-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Addiction Treatment With a Dark Side', 'kicker': 'The Double-Edged Drug', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Addiction Treatment With a Dark Side', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'va