 to solve the crossword over a cup of tea, you might have a hint to one of today’s clues right under your nose. That’s because a lot of popular breakfast blends include tea grown in ASSAM, a state in northeastern India known for its heavy rainfall and, as a result, prodigious tea output. English breakfast tea, a blend, includes Assam’s offerings. The region comes up today at 42 Down, one of several clues about Indian geography.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vowel Play', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-16T23:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Gaffney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gaffney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7612fdad-565f-57fd-ae65-a016c00b24e6', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7612fdad-565f-57fd-ae65-a016c00b24e6'}, {'abstract': 'With the Atlanta Braves moving to the suburbs, a civic conversation is examining whether the change is a blow to the city or a signal of a new era for the region.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/17/us/with-braves-set-to-move-a-broader-look-at-atlanta.html', 'snippet': 'With the Atlanta Braves moving to the suburbs, a civic conversation is examining whether the change is a blow to the city or a signal of a new era for the region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — A collective gasp rose here last week when the Atlanta Braves announced that they were moving to the suburbs. The franchise, after all, has been not only a sports team, but also a mirror of Atlanta’s aspirations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source'