 a delectable teen queen in ‘Clueless,’ a candy-colored, brightly satirical showcase for her decidedly visual talents.” Ms. Heckerling “finds herself on friendly territory with the worst Californian academic talent this side of Ridgemont High,” Ms. Maslin wrote. “Surfer burnouts held center stage in that earlier comedy of Ms. Heckerling’s, but this time she has gone hilariously upscale.” ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Sunday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Sunday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-17T17:12:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/cafb9efc-f68f-5791-80cb-f651fe287797', 'word_count': 696, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cafb9efc-f68f-5791-80cb-f651fe287797'}, {'abstract': 'In the parts of the nation where local governments’ capacity to respond to the devastation was greatly diminished, religious and community groups have vastly expanded their roles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/world/asia/philippine-community-groups-fill-vacuum-to-provide-aid-in-typhoons-aftermath.html', 'snippet': 'In the parts of the nation where local governments’ capacity to respond to the devastation was greatly diminished, religious and community groups have vastly expanded their roles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TACLOBAN, the Philippines — Ofelia Casio could be called the mayor of the Tacloban City Convention Center. She was not elected to the position, but there is not much competition for the job.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 