3e18bc75ad14', 'word_count': 1270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/186d5e4d-7cbf-566e-adfa-3e18bc75ad14'}, {'abstract': 'Often victims of sexual assault have to convince the V.A. that they are disabled and entitled to compensation for post-traumatic stress disorder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/opinion/for-assaulted-veterans-a-second-battle.html', 'snippet': 'Often victims of sexual assault have to convince the V.A. that they are disabled and entitled to compensation for post-traumatic stress disorder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For military veterans, the trauma of rape, sexual assault or sexual harassment can be as devastating as combat wounds. But these injuries, while real, are often invisible, and the circumstances behind them shrouded in secrecy and denial. The men and women who endure such crimes often have to fight a second battle, to convince the Department of Veterans Affairs that they are disabled and entitled to compensation for post-traumatic stress disorder, depression, anxiety and other afflictions resulting from service-connected sexual violence.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Assaulted Veterans, a Second Battle', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Assaulted Veterans, a Second Battle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-18T02:20:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/70873a59-08ab-518b-aa40-3d9f64a0ac16', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70873a59-08ab-518b-aa40-3d9f64a0ac16'}, {'abstract': 'Nicholas Mevoli was competing at Vertical Blue, a championship event in the sport of free diving, where he was attempting to achieve his second American record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/sports/deep-water-diver-from-brooklyn-dies-after-trying-for-a-record.html', 'snippet': 'Nicholas Mevoli was competing at Vertical Blue, a championship event in the sport of free diving, where he was attempting to achieve his second American record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONG ISLAND, Bahamas — As Nicholas Mevoli lay on his back, floating in the azure sea, attempting to relax, his exhales were audible. The countdown had begun, and he prepared to dive into Dean’s Blue Hole, hoping to reach 72 meters on a single inhalation, with no fins or supplemental oxygen. He began sipping the air, attempting to pack as much oxygen in his lungs as possible.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/sports/diving1/diving-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/18/sports/diving1/diving-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 880}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/sports/diving1/diving-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 607, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/sports/diving1/diving-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 890, 'w