son', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef7a6594-7294-584c-bf9b-d93c020def58', 'word_count': 1422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef7a6594-7294-584c-bf9b-d93c020def58'}, {'abstract': 'Survivors of sexual trauma are far less likely than other veterans to have their disability benefits approved.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/the-v-a-and-sexual-trauma/', 'snippet': 'Survivors of sexual trauma are far less likely than other veterans to have their disability benefits approved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An editorial in today’s Times cites disheartening discrepancies in how the Veterans Affairs Department handles disability claims involving post-traumatic stress disorder. According to a report released this month by advocates for women and men who were sexually harassed and attacked while serving in uniform, survivors of sexual trauma are far less likely than other veterans to have their disability benefits approved.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The V.A. and Sexual Trauma', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-18T17:59:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lawrence Downes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lawrence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8062eae6-0584-5491-a272-f7b3c71dc984', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8062eae6-0584-5491-a272-f7b3c71dc984'}, {'abstract': 'Investigators in Paris said that surveillance camera video of a man who menaced the editor of a television news channel in the French capital last week might show the same man who shot a newspaper journalist on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/surveillance-video-of-suspected-paris-gunman/', 'snippet': 'Investigators in Paris said that surveillance camera video of a man who menaced the editor of a television news channel in the French capital last week might show the same man who shot a newspaper journalist on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague Scott Sayare reports, French police are scouring Paris for a gunman who shot a journalist at the headquarters of the newspaper Libération on Monday morning. The same man is suspected of shooting at a bank in another part of the French capital 90 minutes later, and of having menaced an editor at a television news channel late last week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/world/europe/18lede_paris/18lede_paris-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Surveillance Video of Suspected Paris Gunman', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-18T18:01:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c908a94-f8d6-5285-a3d7-96bb082df82f', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c908a94-f8d6-5285-a3d7-96bb082df82f'}, {'abstract': 'We’re soliciting questions on holiday travel.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/confused-about-holiday-travel-submit-your-questions-here/', 'snippet': 'We’re soliciting questions on holiday travel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Wednesday before Thanksgiving is one of the busiest travel days of the year, according to the Department of Transportation. And no matter how you’re getting to grandmother’s house – by air, rail or road – you probably have a few nagging questions that could get answered in the form of a rude awakening on the road. In order to reduce the number of known unknowns, we’d like to answer your questions about holiday travel before you set off.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Confused About Holiday Travel? Submit Your Questions Here', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-18T18:01:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a5bb4cdb-ac1d-5608-bba9-9be18099d756', 'word_count': 96, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5bb4cdb-ac1d-5608-bba9-9be18099d756'}, {'abstract': 'Inspired by a “Charlotte’s Web” read-aloud, my daughter became a vegetarian at age 4. Three years later, I’m wondering if I let her make a choice she wasn’t ready for.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/vegetarian-too-young/', 'snippet': 'Inspired by a “Charlotte’s Web” read-aloud, my daughter became a vegetarian at age 4. Three years later, I’m wondering if I let her make a choice she wasn’t ready for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When my daughter chose to become a vegetarian at age 4 after I read her “Charlotte’s Web,” I thought it was a passing phase, much like needing to receive a confidential sprinkle of fairy dust on her way to school. Her pediatrician approved her nutritional plan without hesitation, and we have Hindu friends whose children have been vegetarian from birth, so the idea hardly seemed radical in our household, where we consumed a modest amount of meat to begin with. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1632, 'width': 1224, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/style/motherlode-vegetarian/motherlode-vegetarian-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vegetarian Too Young', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetarianism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-18T18:07:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Debra Liese', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Debra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liese', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16489203-bc6c-5512-b264-e0dbee53f04e', 'word_count': 766, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16489203-bc6c-5512-b264-e0dbee53f04e'}, {'abstract': 'United States and European regulators want to standardize derivatives contracts to help cross-border banks fail smoothly. It’s a reminder of how much work still needs to be done to end “too big to fail,” the author says.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/a-hurdle-to-winding-down-a-failing-global-bank/', 'snippet': 'United States and European regulators want to standardize derivatives contracts to help cross-border banks fail smoothly. It’s a reminder of how much work still needs to be done to end “too big to fail,” the author says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A seemingly small derivatives detail could sink global bank wind-down plans. American and European regulators want to standardize contracts to help cross-border lenders fail smoothly. If the problem isn’t fixed, investors could undermine financial stability by calling in swaps. It’s a reminder of how much work still needs to be done to end “too big to fail.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Hurdle to Winding Down a Failing Global Bank', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Derivatives (Financial Instruments)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Swaps and Derivatives Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'p