44b7d77f5760'}, {'abstract': 'The cast of David Byrne’s musical about Ferdinand and Imelda Marcos will reunite for one night in New York, with proceeds to aid relief efforts in the Philippines.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/18/here-lies-love-cast-to-reunite-for-benefit-performance/', 'snippet': 'The cast of David Byrne’s musical about Ferdinand and Imelda Marcos will reunite for one night in New York, with proceeds to aid relief efforts in the Philippines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Byrne is reconvening the cast of “Here Lies Love,” his immersive musical about Ferdinand and Imelda Marcos, for a single performance on Nov. 25 at Terminal 5 to raise money for relief efforts in the Philippines in the aftermath of Typhoon Haiyan, which struck on Nov. 8. All proceeds from the performance will be donated to Doctors Without Borders, the Paris-based physicians group.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 709, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1418, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/18/arts/18artsbeat-love/18artsbeat-love-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Here Lies Love’ Cast to Reunite for Benefit Performance', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoon Haiyan (2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Byrne, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-18T18:19:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5585e580-53db-5255-974a-24065857bb89', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5585e580-53db-5255-974a-24065857bb89'}, {'abstract': 'With or without Kepler, several satellites, intended to identify nearby exoplanets, are in the works in the coming years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/science/space/more-explorations-in-space.html', 'snippet': 'With or without Kepler, several satellites, intended to identify nearby exoplanets, are in the works in the coming years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With or without Kepler, the quest for habitable real estate in the galaxy will go on.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'head