ividing Line” has its premiere at Gould Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some dancers execute movement; others breathe it. In Gina Gibney’s “Dividing Line,” which had its premiere run from Thursday through Saturday at Gould Hall, Amy Miller fell into the second category. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1126, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/arts/20131118GIBNEY/20131118GIBNEY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vibrating Along With Live Music', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vibrating Along With