ice facility for only a weight-lifting session, but players decided to remain to prepare for the Dallas Cowboys.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday morning, the Giants were obliged to go to the team’s practice complex for only a weight-lifting session. Then the players were free to do as they wanted. Since Tuesday is their customary day off, the Giants were staring at what amounted to almost a two-day break from practice, meetings or film study.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 506}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 863, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1727, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLar