[{'firstname': 'Philip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f95e2dd6-68e0-59bc-a0db-1437a774f394', 'word_count': 1187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f95e2dd6-68e0-59bc-a0db-1437a774f394'}, {'abstract': 'The actor performs a scene from the Tennessee Williams play, now on Broadway at the Booth Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/in-performance-zachary-quinto-of-the-glass-menagerie/', 'snippet': 'The actor performs a scene from the Tennessee Williams play, now on Broadway at the Booth Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the Broadway revival of Tennessee Williams’s memory play “The Glass Menagerie,” Zachary Quinto plays Tom Wingfield, an aspiring writer and warehouse worker — and the play’s narrator — who lives in a cramped St. Louis apartment with his mother, Amanda, and his sister, Laura. In this scene, Tom talks about watching couples at a dance hall across from their home. The show, directed by John Tiffany, continues through Feb. 23 at the Booth Theater.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Zachary Quinto of ‘The Glass Menagerie’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Glass Menagerie (Play)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinto, Zachary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Tennessee', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T13:00:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'report