 office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/20/nyregion/progressive-caucus-seeks-to-control-race-for-new-york-council-speaker.html', 'snippet': 'Brad Lander, a Democrat from Brooklyn, is a leader of the group, which has committed to voting as a bloc and is trying to limit the power of the speaker’s office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The populist groundswell that swept Bill de Blasio to victory in New York’s mayoral election is reshaping the City Council as well, with a cadre of fiercely liberal council members demanding a voice in choosing that body’s next speaker.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/nyregion/COUNCIL2-1384909102623/COUNCIL-1384909102623-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/20/nyregion/COUNCIL2-1384909102623/COUNCIL-1384909102623-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/nyregion/COUNCIL2-1384909102623/COUNCIL-1384909102623-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/nyregion/COUNCIL2-1384909102623/COUNCIL-1384909102623-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/nyregion/COUNCIL2-1384909102623/COUNCIL-1384909102623-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/20/nyregion/COUNCIL2-1384909102623/COUNCIL-1384909102623-thumbSta