 an attack in Beledweyne, near the Ethiopian border.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOGADISHU, Somalia — Attackers from the Shabab militant group assaulted a police station in a Somali town north of Mogadishu on Tuesday, leaving at least 28 people dead and scores more wounded.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Police Station Is Attacked by the Shabab in Somalia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Police Station Is Attacked By the Shabab in Somalia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Shabab', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ibrahim, Mohammed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Somalia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kulish, Nicholas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attacks on Police', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T19:01:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mohamed Ibrahim and Nicholas Kulish', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mohamed', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ibrahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kulish', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/321dfb57-5fc0-52c7-9ff1-d7ba793cc7a3', 'word_count': 580, 'uri': 'nyt://article/321dfb57-5fc0-52c7-9ff1-d7ba793cc7a3'}, {'abstract': 'Columbia, Mr. Dylan’s record label, has released an interactive web video for his 1965 hit “Like a Rolling Stone.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/a-bob-dylan-video-47-years-in-the-making/', 'snippet': 'Columbia, Mr. Dylan’s record label, has released an interactive web video for his 1965 hit “Like a Rolling Stone.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Promotional video clips were hardly unknown when Bob Dylan released “Like a Rolling Stone” as a single in 1965, but Mr. Dylan never made one for the song. Now Columbia, his record label, is making up for that oversight with a newly produced web video for the song, mainly to promote “The Complete Album Collection, Volume 1,” a 47-CD set that includes all of Mr. Dylan’s studio albums, six live sets and a two-disc rarities compilation. But in the process, the company is redefining the way promotional clips are viewed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/arts/19artsbeat-dylan/19artsbeat-dylan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/19/arts/19artsbeat-dylan/19artsbeat-dylan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 915}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/arts/19artsbeat-dylan/19artsbeat-dylan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 672, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/arts/19artsbeat-dylan/19artsbeat-dylan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1344, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/arts/19artsbeat-dylan/19artsbeat-dylan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/19/arts/19arts