ment on the clever “Blank on Blank” web series features Grace Kelly reminiscing about John F. Kennedy not long after the president was assassinated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In keeping with the (rightfully) bottomless wellspring of Kennedy retrospectives this month, the web series “Blank on Blank” made its own contribution today with an excerpted interview with Grace Kelly recorded not long after the president’s assassination. Set to video and accompanied by the animation of Patrick Smith, Princess Grace speaks of Kennedy’s fashion sense and youthful optimism, and she strains to find meaning in the tragedy that had just played out in front of the world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/magazine/19-grace-kelly/19-grace-kelly-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 142, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/magazine/19-grace-kelly/19-grace-kelly-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 142, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/19/magazine/19-grace-kelly/19-grace-kelly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/19/magazine/19-grace-kelly/19-grace-kelly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Grace Kelly on J.F.K.: An Animated Interview', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T19:12:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Vecsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vecsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3edec61-3fbb-5b5f-95ce-9d12fbbe9c7d', 'word_count': 455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3edec61-3fbb-5b5f-95ce-9d12fbbe9c7d'}, {'abstract': 'For the third time in as many weeks, Senate Republicans have blocked a judicial nominee to the D.C. Circuit.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/what-is-harry-reid-waiting-for/', 'snippet': 'For the third time in as many weeks, Senate Republicans have blocked a judicial nominee to the D.C. Circuit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the third time in as many weeks, Senate Republicans have blocked a judicial nominee to the second most powerful court in the country, and for the third time it is not because they doubt his qualifications — how could they? He’s a sitting district court judge who was unanimously confirmed by the Senate just three years ago. Nor is it because they fear he harbors an extreme ideology.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Is Harry Reid Waiting For?', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Filibusters and Debate Curbs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grassley, Charles E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reid, Harry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T19:15:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse Wegman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wegman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/944976dd-1cf5-58b2-95c3-96d00742ebbc', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/944976dd-1cf5-58b2-95c3-96d00742ebbc'}, {'abstract': 'While millions of Americans struggle with the federal insurance exchange, members of Congress and their aides have all sorts of assistance to help them parse their options and enroll.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/20/us/politics/for-lawmakers-a-gold-plated-insurance-exchange.html', 'snippet': 'While millions of Americans struggle with the federal insurance exchange, members of Congress and their aides have all sorts of assistance to help them parse their options and enroll.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Members of Congress like to boast that they will have the same health care enrollment experience as constituents struggling with the balky federal website, because the law they wrote forced lawmakers to get coverage from the new insurance exchanges.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/jp-BENEFITS/jp-BENEFITS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/20/us/jp-BENEFITS/jp-BENEFITS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/jp-BENEFITS/jp-BENEFITS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/jp-BENEFITS/jp-BENEFITS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/jp-BENEFITS/jp-BENEFITS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail