cans are back to pursuing their goal of doing nothing.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/no-budget-because-healthcare-gov/', 'snippet': 'Republicans are back to pursuing their goal of doing nothing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After they were blamed for causing a disastrous shutdown, many Republicans seemed to want to get the year’s budget fights behind them. As of a few weeks ago, some of them seemed open to relieving the sequester, which is widely hated by lawmakers in both parties, and Congressional appropriators thought they had a chance to enact real spending bills instead of running the government with yet another continuing resolution.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Budget, Because HealthCare.gov', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HealthCare.gov', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T21:01:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/97acb2d5-abaa-5715-9b24-ff9c097690e1', 'word_count': 407, 'uri': 'nyt://article/97acb2d5-abaa-5715-9b24-ff9c097690e1'}, {'abstract': 'HTH Worldwide’s mPassport application has been updated to include more translations of drug names and medical terms.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/update-for-a-global-medical-app/', 'snippet':