_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b8eb70b-8c4c-533a-84ce-33cd8864ab44', 'word_count': 567, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b8eb70b-8c4c-533a-84ce-33cd8864ab44'}, {'abstract': 'The new excavations and restorations of the catacombs of Priscilla in Rome can also be viewed online.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/19/vatican-unveils-revamped-catacombs-museum/', 'snippet': 'The new excavations and restorations of the catacombs of Priscilla in Rome can also be viewed online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Celebrating the meeting of ancient and modern worlds, the Vatican on Tuesday presented a revamped museum of antique funerary remains in Rome, while inviting the rest of the world to peek inside that space by computer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vatican Unveils Revamped Catacombs Museum', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Maps', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T21:49:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizati