ional Journal for taking on the first issue in a way that lets me talk, at length, about the second. Here’s Fournier, attacking Republicans for remaining “the party of zilch” amid the Obama administration’s recent flailings:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mike Lee and the Republican Opportunity', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fournier, Ron', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Michael S', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-19T22:11:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d4f2769-130f-5d7d-a550-b7d4bea2e90a', 'word_count': 801, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d4f2769-130f-5d7d-a550-b7d4bea2e90a'}, {'abstract': 'France’s soccer team, dismissed as down and nearly out, overcame a two-goal playoff deficit to Ukraine to clinch a spot in the World Cup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/20/sports/soccer/france-overturns-2-0-deficit-to-reach-world-cup-finals.html', 'snippet': 'France’s soccer team, dismissed as down and nearly out, overcame a two-goal playoff deficit to Ukraine to clinch a spot in the World Cup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Defying the bitt