': 330, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e659af2-1673-5e6b-b296-16493dacf453'}, {'abstract': 'Fed up with Senate Republicans’ refusal to confirm many of President Obama’s nominees, Harry Reid, the Senate majority leader, has been gauging if there is any support among fellow Democrats to change filibuster rules.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/20/us/politics/senate-democrats-consider-move-to-curb-filibusters.html', 'snippet': 'Fed up with Senate Republicans’ refusal to confirm many of President Obama’s nominees, Harry Reid, the Senate majority leader, has been gauging if there is any support among fellow Democrats to change filibuster rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Senator Harry Reid, the majority leader, is prepared to move forward with a vote that could severely limit the minority party’s ability to filibuster presidential nominees, possibly as early as this week, Democrats said Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/JUDGES/JUDGES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/20/us/JUDGES/JUDGES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/JUDGES/JUDGES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/JUDGES/JUDGES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1317, 'width': 948, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/us/JUDGES/JUDGES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy