 commissioners met with President Obama and said insurers and states would have to decide to extend noncompliant health plans for one more year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/business/some-state-insurance-officials-decline-to-meet-with-obama.html', 'snippet': 'State insurance commissioners met with President Obama and said insurers and states would have to decide to extend noncompliant health plans for one more year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A group of state insurance commissioners emerged from a meeting with President Obama and other federal officials on Wednesday saying that state regulators would continue to decide on their own whether to go along with his recent proposal to let consumers keep older insurance plans for an extra year, even if the plans did not comply with regulations under the new health care law.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'States Are Left to Decide on Health Plan Change', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'States Are Left to Decide On Health Plan Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abelson, Reed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Assn of Insurance Commissioners', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-20T16:46:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Reed Abelson and Susanne Craig', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Reed', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'repor