od-pushes-its-boundaries.html', 'snippet': 'Temple Bar, south of the Liffey River, is stretching beyond its tourist-destination status, adding attractions like a secret cocktail bar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cobbled quarter of Temple Bar has long maintained its tourist-destination status with overpriced pints of Guinness and a reputation for wild bachelor parties. While these traits endure, entrepreneurs have begun to reclaim the historic streets flanking the south side of the Liffey River. Now, locals are being lured back into the compact neighborhood. The common theme is pushing boundaries, from a secret cocktail bar to restaurants showcasing flavors beyond the typical Irish canon. With fallen prices and available real estate from the economic downturn, the heart of city center Dublin is experiencing a creative revival.  ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/24SURFACING3/24SURFACING3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 502, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/24SURFACING3/24SURFACING3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 502}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/24SURFACING3/24SURFACING3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 856, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/24SURFACING3/24SURFACING3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1712, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/17/travel/24SURFACING3/17SURFACING3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'widt