reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b51c90c2-e72a-5772-a85d-065a4f014651', 'word_count': 962, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b51c90c2-e72a-5772-a85d-065a4f014651'}, {'abstract': 'The director Michel Gondry narrates a sequence from his animated documentary interview with Noam Chomsky.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/20/anatomy-of-a-scene-video-of-is-the-man-who-is-tall-happy/', 'snippet': 'The director Michel Gondry narrates a sequence from his animated documentary interview with Noam Chomsky.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For his new documentary, the director Michel Gondry interviewed the linguist and philosopher Noam Chomsky. The interview blends live-action footage and animated sequences — many of them drawn by Mr. Gondry. In this video, Mr. Gondry narrates an early sequence in which he asks Mr. Chomsky about his first memory.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anatomy of a Scene: Video of ‘Is the Man Who Is Tall Happy?’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chomsky, Noam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gondry, Michel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-20T19:33:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2152204-1bb2-5c46-ad1f-3c7af957dfd7', 'word_count': 50, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2152204-1bb2-5c46-ad1f-3c7af957dfd7'}, {'abstract': 'While criminal fines and civil penalties make for big headlines, the Justice Department also negotiated some relief for homeowners who suffered from JPMorgan’s mortgage practices.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/11/20/the-true-accountability-in-the-jpmorgan-settlement/', 'snippet': 'While criminal fines and civil penalties make for big headlines, the Justice Department also negotiated some relief for homeowners who suffered from JPMorgan’s mortgage practices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The watchword in the Justice Department’s $13 billion settlement with JPMorgan Chase over the sale of questionable mortgage-backed securities is “accountability.” References to accountability appear 11 times in the news release detailing the resolution of federal and state cases against the bank over how it packaged faulty mortgages and sold them to investors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/business/dealbook/dbpix-jpm/dbpix-jpm-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/20/business/dealbook/dbpix-jpm/dbpix-jpm-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/business/dealbook/dbpix-jpm/dbpix-jpm-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/business/dealbook/dbpix-jpm/dbpix-jpm-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/business/dealbook/dbpix-jpm/dbpix-jpm-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height':