and over my belly, and our beautiful baby appeared on screen. His body flickered of his own volition, and I squeezed my husband’s shoulder in relief. The doctor measured the circumference of our baby’s head, drew digital white lines down each limb, and examined the kidneys, stomach and spine. He confirmed the gender of our boy and sent his heartbeat to travel across the bottom of the screen at 142 beats per minute.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '23 Weeks Pregnant, With ‘No Good Choices’', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-20T21:02:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Massoni Pardini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': 'Massoni', 'lastname': 'Pardini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0e7f064-80ac-5d4a-b08b-a57949d84756', 'word_count': 985, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0e7f064-80ac-5d4a-b08b-a57949d84756'}, {'abstract': 'The House Republicans’ response to the Affordable Care Act is increasingly organized and orchestrated, including collections of stories about people who say they were harmed by the health care law.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/11/21/us/politics/21republican-talking-points.html', 'snippet': 'The House Republicans’ response to the Affordable Care Act is increasingly organized and orchestrated, including collections of stories about people who say they were harmed by the h