00. What about a new Mac computer? I know where you can pick one up for about $60,000. Need some new headphones? I have a deal on those, too. A pair of solid rose gold iPod earbuds for about $25,000.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/technology/20bits-Leica/20bits-Leica-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 339, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/technology/20bits-Leica/20bits-Leica-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 339, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/technology/20bits-Leica/20bits-Leica-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/20/technology/20bits-Leica/20bits-Leica-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/20/technology/20bits-Leica/20bits-Leica-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Sale: Digital Camera. Estimated Price: $500,000 to $750,000.', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cameras', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ive, Jonathan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Newson, Marc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Leica Camera AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Product Red', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-20T22:32:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e05f953e-27bd-5a91-8580-977d4de19a91', 'word_count': 340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e05f953e-27bd-5a91-8580-977d4de19a91'}, {'abstract': 'The JACK Quartet performed Georg Friedrich Haas’s String Quartet No. 3 at the Clark Studio Theater in a show not for those afraid of the dark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/arts/music/jack-quartet-performs-georg-friedrich-haas-in-the-dark.html', 'snippet': 'The JACK Quartet performed Georg Friedrich Haas’s String Quartet No. 3 at the Clark Studio Theater in a show not for those afraid of the dark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Darkness enveloped me as I listened to the Austrian composer Georg Friedrich Haas’s String Quartet No. 3 on Tuesday night at Lincoln Center’s Clark Studio Theater. This is the way the composer intended for the piece to be performed. As much as I was engrossed by the music, the performance by the JACK Quartet and the rare experience of hearing music with others in darkness, I could not help feeling that some uncomfortable assumptions were being made for this event, called “In the Dark,” part of the center’s White Light Festival. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Improvising in Total Darkness', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Improvising In Total Darkness', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tommasini, Anthony', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'White Light Festival (Lincoln Center, NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JACK Quartet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-20T22:35:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/3881c0de-c6db-51a5-8c6d-4f058d52331f', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3881c0de-c6db-51a5-8c6d-4f058d52331f'}, {'abstract': 'Complexions Contemporary Ballet highlighted two works, “Flight” and “Recur,” at its opening-night performance at the Joyce Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/arts/dance/complexions-contemporary-ballet-at-joyce-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Complexions Contemporary Ballet highlighted two works, “Flight” and “Recur,” at its opening-night performance at the Joyce Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Complexions Contemporary Ballet, dancers kick their legs to make a show of it. They swivel their hips with insouciance. Their swaying bodies might look as if they’re about to tip over, until a breath — irritatingly visible in a heaving chest — forces them upright. They are skilled technicians. The issue with Complexions, led by the founding artistic directors Dwight Rhoden and Desmond Richardson, is how far the repertory is from actually being contemporary. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No