rio brought her granddaughter to the United States to get specialized medical help for the girl, but the family, with scant income, is living in a city homeless shelter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/nyregion/in-a-shelter-and-striving-to-help-a-child.html', 'snippet': 'Juana Rosario brought her granddaughter to the United States to get specialized medical help for the girl, but the family, with scant income, is living in a city homeless shelter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last few years have been traumatic ones for Juana Rosario, who has been living in the New York City shelter system since 2010, alongside her husband and her disabled granddaughter, Amy Germosen Rosario. But as nightmarish as the experience has been, she prefers it to going back home to the Dominican Republic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/nyregion/neediest/neediest-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/21/nyregion/neediest/neediest-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/nyregion/neediest/neediest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/nyregion/neediest/neediest-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/nyregion/neediest/neediest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'