: 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea4833a9-ea38-5f82-a391-88aea15ec04b', 'word_count': 605, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea4833a9-ea38-5f82-a391-88aea15ec04b'}, {'abstract': 'A report commissioned by Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s foundation found that the administration had attracted $1.4 billion in noncity financing for public programs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/nyregion/mayor-bloomberg-lured-donors-for-city-programs.html', 'snippet': 'A report commissioned by Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s foundation found that the administration had attracted $1.4 billion in noncity financing for public programs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg is well known for tapping his own fortune to fill in gaps in the city’s resources, whether spending millions of dollars to renovate Gracie Mansion or keeping the kitchen in the City Hall bullpen stocked with healthy snacks for his staff.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/nyregion/BLOOMBERG/BLOOMBERG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/13/nyregion/BLOOMBERG/BLOOMBERG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 767}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/nyregion/BLOOMBERG/BLOOMBERG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 802, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/nyregion/BLOOMBERG/BLOOMBERG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 1025, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/13/nyregion/BLOOMBERG/BLOOMBERG-th