pecial vote for a congressional seat from Louisiana. “Wow, wow,” he marveled upon gazing at a chandelier in the Old House Chamber.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Vance McAllister, a 39-year-old college dropout and Army veteran, managed to vanquish a formidable Republican opponent backed by the party’s establishment, win a special election in Louisiana’s Fifth District in a 20-point landslide, and score an endorsement from the star of “Duck Dynasty.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mr. McAllister Goes to Washington, and He Is Wowed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. McAllister Goes to Washington, and He Is Wowed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Louisiana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAllister, Vance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, House of Representatives', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-21T03:09:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d856d2a-b30a-5087-817f-5922e73986f0', 'word_count': 1067, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d856d2a-b30a-5087-817f-5922e73986f0'}, {'abstract': 'The move reflects frustration with monthly commutes between Brussels and Strasbourg, France, that many see as a waste of money.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/world/europe/european-parliament-votes-to-choose-single-meeting-site.html', 'snippet': 'The move reflects frustration with monthly commutes between Brussels and Strasbourg, France, that many see as a waste of money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — The European Parliament voted on Wednesday to choose a single meeting place, showing its frustration with monthly commutes between Brussels and Strasbourg, France, that are seen by many lawmakers and citizens as a colossal waste of money and an embarrassment at a time of painful austerity across the European Union.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'European Parliament Votes to Choose Single Meeting Site', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Parliament', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Strasbourg (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brussels (Belgium)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-21T03:18:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Kanter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kanter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0afe8393-7f5f-5f08-a360-56b77f3697cf', 'word_count': 953, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0afe8393-7f5f-5f08-a360-56b77f3697cf'}, {'abstract': 'Representative Vance McAllister, the newest member of the House, arrived in the nation’s capital for the first time on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/11/20/us/20131121_NEWBIE.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Vance McAllister, the ne