s.com/2013/11/21/sports/basketball/in-the-end-its-the-same-old-knicks.html', 'snippet': 'Carmelo Anthony had 30 points but shot just 10 of 28 from the field for the Knicks, while the Pacers’ Paul George scored 21 of his game-high 35 points in the fourth quarter and overtime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Coach Mike Woodson met with his players\xa0Wednesday\xa0morning, he reminded them that nobody was running away with the Atlantic Division. The Philadelphia 76ers were planted atop the standings with a losing record. Everybody else was clustered beneath them with similarly dismal marks.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/21/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1535, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/21/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/21/sports/CITY-KNICKS/CITY-KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non