30, a Robotic Window Cleaner', 'kicker': 'Toolkit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robots and Robotics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Windows', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-21T04:54:09+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Technology', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/1689547c-6ab4-5c22-b65e-da6d1f994fc2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/1689547c-6ab4-5c22-b65e-da6d1f994fc2'}, {'abstract': 'The shade is a staple of men’s cold-weather wardrobes — especially when it comes in flannel — but it’s increasingly well suited for women as well.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/21/t-magazine/gray-gets-a-feminine-makeover.html', 'snippet': 'The shade is a staple of men’s cold-weather wardrobes — especially when it comes in flannel — but it’s increasingly well suited for women as well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gray flannel, a fabric usually reserved for men — in a banker’s suit or a hunter’s henley — has been reimagined for the everyday woman. When combined with leather, it can transform an ordinary baseball cap into a chic topper for any outfit, a basic tablet case into a handsome clutch or a simple duffel into a prim carryall. A basic flannel skirt gets dressed up when paired with punklike jewelry in gray tones. Other gray materials can offer similar impact to flannel as well. Pony hair, as seen on these elegant Chanel loafers, is a feminine alternative that is well suited for ladies who lunch. The ombré effect on this neoprene knit sweater from Proenza Schouler offers a contemporary riff on the idea of gray flannel that looks as at home on the streets as it does surf-side.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'c