-mario-testino-returns-to-his-roots/', 'snippet': 'The famed fashion photographer spent five years documenting colorful Peruvian fashion in the city of Cusco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The famed fashion photographer Mario Testino has captured the most popular cultural icons, like the British royal family and Lady Gaga, and shot ad campaigns for the biggest names in fashion, like Gucci and Valentino. But for the photographic exhibition “Alta Moda” (“high fashion” in Spanish), on view through March 29 at the Queen Sofia Spanish Institute in New York, Testino turned his lens away from haute couture and toward a less recognized facet of fashion history.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mario Testino Returns to His Roots', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Testino, Mario', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-21T20:50:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erica Bellman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bellman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69efcb1b-842a-5e6d-bade-5a925fd0790b', 'word_count': 259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69efcb1b-842a-5e6d-bade-5a925fd0790b'}, {'abstract': 'The 19-year-old Jake Bugg, whose new album is titled “Shangri La,” talks about working with Rick Rubin and opening for the Rolling Stones.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/arts/music/jake-bugg-on-rick-rubin-and-opening-for-the-rolling-stones.html', 'snippet': 'The 19-year-old Jake Bugg, whose new album is titled “Shangri La,” talks about working with Rick Rubin and opening for the Rolling Stones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For an old soul like Jake Bugg, recording at Sun Studio in Memphis was an ideal fit. “It’s got the old asbestos walls and pictures of Johnny Cash up,” Mr. Bugg, the 19-year-old British singer-songwriter, said excitedly of the space that helped give birth to rock ’n’ roll in the 1950s. “It’s just crazy to think that I was playing my guitar and singing a song in the same spot that all those guys would have been as well, all those years ago. I felt very inspired.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT_SPAN/24SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT_SPAN/24SNAPSHOT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT_SPAN/24SNAPSHOT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT_SPAN/24SNAPSHOT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2016, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT_SPAN/24SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/24/arts/24SNAPSHOT_SPAN/24SNAPSHOT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/