 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6aef847-f036-5c6c-9b81-5e1e5e129fb8'}, {'abstract': 'A goal was set to acquire 100 artifacts and works of art to celebrate the centennial of the purchase of an estate by William Robertson Coe, bringing the total to around 500.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/nyregion/refurnishing-a-65-room-house-piece-by-piece.html', 'snippet': 'A goal was set to acquire 100 artifacts and works of art to celebrate the centennial of the purchase of an estate by William Robertson Coe, bringing the total to around 500.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An upscale tag sale appears to be underway in the cavernous limestone rooms of Coe Hall mansion, run by the Planting Fields Foundation in Oyster Bay. But no prices are listed.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSLI_SPAN/24ARTSLI_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSLI_SPAN/24ARTSLI_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 500}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSLI_SPAN/24ARTSLI_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 853, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSLI_SPAN/24ARTSLI_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1707, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSLI_SPAN/24ARTSLI_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':