': '“You. Are not. Special.” So Stan, a 50-ish office drone, informs his young co-worker in a scene from “middlemen” at the New Jersey Repertory Company in Long Branch. “You are not important. I know, your parents told you differently, but they were lying. If you were never born, if you had never existed at all,” things would have turned out the same way, he says, acknowledging that the same holds true for him.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1_SPAN/24ARTSNJ1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cro