r him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/movies/philomena-starring-judi-dench-and-steve-coogan.html', 'snippet': 'Stephen Frears’s “Philomena” follows a Irishwoman forced to give up her son for adoption in the 1950s and the freelance reporter who helps her search for him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Philomena,” Judi Dench’s portrayal of a stubborn, kindhearted Irish Catholic trying to discover what became of the toddler she was forced to give up as a teenager is so quietly moving that it feels lit from within. A major theme of this film from Stephen Frears is forgiveness. Ms. Dench’s Philomena Lee glows with the radiance of someone serene in her faith despite inhumane treatment by the church. That she makes you believe her character has the capacity to forgive provides the movie with a solid moral center. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nasty Nuns Can’t Shake a Faith', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nasty Nuns Can’t Shake a Faith', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dench, Judi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coogan, Steve', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frears, Stephen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Philomena (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-21T22:01:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/d04bc3cd-3704-55ad-81b9-b982ac640f0d', 'word_count': 744, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d04bc3cd-3704-55ad-81b9-b982ac640f0d'}, {'abstract': 'A Malaysian woman, 69, an Irish woman, 57, and a British woman, 30, were freed from a house in the Lambeth district in South London in October.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/world/europe/3-women-said-to-be-held-30-years-rescued-from-london-home.html', 'snippet': 'A Malaysian woman, 69, an Irish woman, 57, and a British woman, 30, were freed from a house in the Lambeth district in South London in October.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The London police announced Thursday that three women had been rescued from a city home where they claim to have been held against their will for about 30 years, and that a married couple who lived there had been arrested.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/captives/captives-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/22/world/captives/captives-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/captives/captives-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/captives/captives-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/captives/captives-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/22/world/captives/captives-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbna