t was part of a deal by 21st Century Fox, where Mr. Murdoch is an executive, to buy a 5 percent stake in Vice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James Murdoch, a 21st Century Fox executive and the son of the media mogul Rupert Murdoch, has joined Vice Media as a director, two people with knowledge of the appointment said on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'James Murdoch Joins Board of Media Company Vice', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '21st Century Fox', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vice Media Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murdoch, James R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T00:23:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9f8535e-ffb9-5866-99e9-7763178914c0', 'word_count': 182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9f8535e-ffb9-5866-99e9-7763178914c0'}, {'abstract': 'Open morning to night, three spots in Westchester and Rockland Counties take coffee seriously yet have strong appeal for foodies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/nyregion/cafes-powered-by-coffee-and-good-cheer.html', 'snippet': 'Open morning to night, three spots in Westchester and Rockland Counties take coffee seriously yet have strong appeal for foodies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard to imagine a time when a foodie’s working vocabulary did not include “zeppole,” “macaron,” “pour over” and “panini.” Halfhearted interpretations of the