” (“The Scar”) is an aerially photographed documentary about the Berlin Wall’s legacy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/movies/die-narbe-the-scar-about-the-berlin-wall.html', 'snippet': '“Die Narbe” (“The Scar”) is an aerially photographed documentary about the Berlin Wall’s legacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Burkhard von Harder’s “Die Narbe” (“The Scar”) bears witness to the legacy of the Berlin Wall in rather literal-minded fashion by filming the wall’s perimeter from a helicopter. Far from tapping Germany’s especially rich and haunted interplay between architecture and memory, the movie suggests, most immediately, that not all aerial photography is equal.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN/22RDP_SCAR_SPAN-thumbStand