imes.com/2013/11/22/movies/weekend-of-a-champion-follows-jackie-stewart-at-monaco.html', 'snippet': 'Frank Simon has restored and updated Roman Polanski’s 1971 documentary about the race driver Jackie Stewart at the Monaco Grand Prix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The combination of fast cars, gorgeous men and Monte Carlo sounds a lot like heaven, but Frank Simon’s “Weekend of a Champion” will appeal mostly to motor-racing enthusiasts and movie archaeologists. Covering four days in May 1971, when the director Roman Polanski accompanied the Formula One champion Jackie Stewart to the 29th Monaco Grand Prix, this newly restored and updated documentary offers a minor sidebar to two major careers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_WEEKENDCHAMPION_SPAN/WEEKENDCHAMPION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_WEEKENDCHAMPION_SPAN/WEEKENDCHAMPION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_WEEKENDCHAMPION_SPAN/WEEKENDCHAMPION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_WEEKENDCHAMPION_SPAN/WEEKENDCHAMPION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1182, 'width': 1772, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/arts/22RDP_WEEKENDCHAMPION_SPAN/WEEKENDCHAMPION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai