or, whose death may have been a suicide, had forsaken the Hasidic Jewish world in which she was raised and married, leading to the estrangement of her young children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/nyregion/outcast-mothers-death-and-questions-about-jewish-sects-sway-over-children.html', 'snippet': 'Deb Tambor, whose death may have been a suicide, had forsaken the Hasidic Jewish world in which she was raised and married, leading to the estrangement of her young children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRIDGETON, N.J. — Abe Weiss came home on the last Friday in September to find the lifeless body of his girlfriend, Deb Tambor, on the bedroom floor of their ranch house here.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/nyregion/hasid-2/hasid-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 309, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/nyregion/hasid-2/hasid-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 309, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/nyregion/hasid-2/hasid-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/22/nyregion/hasid-2/hasid-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/nyregion/hasid-2/hasid-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Outcast Mother’s Death, and Questions About Jewish Sect’s Sway Over Children', 'kicker': No