entists’ warnings about climate change has done tremendous damage to an island that is one of the world’s biggest success stories of renewable energy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/world/asia/font-of-natural-energy-crippled-by-storms-natural-energy.html', 'snippet': 'A superstorm consistent with some scientists’ warnings about climate change has done tremendous damage to an island that is one of the world’s biggest success stories of renewable energy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORMOC, the Philippines — Clouds of steam surge from fissures in the earth along the beds of mountain streams here that splash down slopes carpeted with coconut palm forests, hints of the enormous source of renewable energy that lies underground.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Font of Natural Energy in the Philippines, Crippled by Nature', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Font of Natural Energy in the Philippines, Crippled by Nature', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tanauan (Leyte, Philippines)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradsher, Keith', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Geothermal Power', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Typhoon Haiyan (2013)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philippines', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T03:30:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Keith Bradsher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Keith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bradsher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27831c2b-1e86-563a-9054-0e7afa485fc7', 'word_count': 1297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27831c2b-1e86-563a-9054-0e7afa485fc7'}, {'abstract': 'The Pacquiao-Rios fight has presented a complex tangle of logistical problems for HBO as it prepares for the event, its first pay-per-view broadcast originating outside the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/sports/new-territory-and-new-challenges-for-hbo-in-macau-prizefight.html', 'snippet': 'The Pacquiao-Rios fight has presented a complex tangle of logistical problems for HBO as it prepares for the event, its first pay-per-view broadcast originating outside the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MACAU — The boxing match between Manny Pacquiao and Brandon Rios will start at the usual time in the United States (Saturday, around midnight Eastern), will be broadcast on HBO pay-per-view and will look, if all goes well, identical to any other major prizefight.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Territory, and New Challenges, for HBO in Macau Prizefight', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Relearning the Ropes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boxing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pacquiao, Manny', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Macau', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rios, Brandon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jacobs, Brad', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Top Rank Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date'