ployer-based health coverage and Medicaid, relying on a private market with subsidies, a plan that seems politically and structurally unrealistic, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/a-conservative-alternative-to-obamacare/', 'snippet': 'Some conservatives propose to abolish both employer-based health coverage and Medicaid, relying on a private market with subsidies, a plan that seems politically and structurally unrealistic, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Uwe E. Reinhardt is an economics professor at Princeton. He has some financial interests in the health care field.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conservative Alternative to Obamacare', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Enterprise Institute for Public Policy Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wall Street Journal', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T05:01:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Uwe E. Reinhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Uwe', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Reinhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb3db982-4db9-5b01-b4ef-eb9d85050ad5', 'word_count': 1278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb3db982-4db9-5b01-b4ef-eb9d85050ad5'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Rees, an innovative New York practitioner, helped found the Flying Doctors Service of East Africa, which helps provide medical care and save lives in the African bush.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/world/africa/thomas-rees-plastic-surgeon-and-humanitarian-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Rees, an innovative New York practitioner, helped found the Flying Doctors Service of East Africa, which helps provide medical care and save lives in the African bush.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Thomas D. Rees, an innovative New York plastic surgeon who helped found the Flying Doctors Service of East Africa, a charity that employs a fleet of small planes to provide medical care and save lives deep in the African bush, died on Nov. 14 at his home in Santa Fe, N.M. He was 86.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/REES-1-obit-web/REES-1-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/22/world/REES-1-obit-web/REES-1-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 767}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/REES-1-obit-web/REES-1-obit-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 801, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/REES-1-obit-web/REES-1-obit-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1422, 'width': 1112, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/22/world/REES-1-obit-web/REES-1-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/22/world/REES-1-obit-web/REES-1-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbna