/books/review/inside-the-list.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Tyson, whose memoir “Undisputed Truth” is at No. 14 on the hardcover nonfiction list, once mused in an interview with Larry King: “Love is like a game, love is competition.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Boxer: In recent years, the former heavyweight champion Mike Tyson has shown up in the Book Review mostly as a metaphor rather than a subject in his own right. We’ve had references to a Mike Tyson of capitalism (Friedrich von Hayek), a “kind of intellectual Mike Tyson” (angry feminists) and a couple of Mike Tysons of women’s tennis (the Williams sisters) — even, impressively but mysteriously, “the Mike Tyson of Korean grandmothers.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/books/review/24tyson/24tyson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 451, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/books/review/24tyson/24tyson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 451, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/books/review/24tyson/24tyson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/24/books/review/24tyson/24tyson-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/books/review/24tyson/24tyson-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside the List', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head