tures. Also, the streaming music service Pandora reported an increase in revenue for the quarter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Spotify, the subscription music service, has completed a $250 million financing round that values the company at more than $4 billion, according to a person with knowledge of the deal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spotify Raises $250 Million, Valuing It at $4 Billion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Spotify', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pandora Media Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Technology Crossover Ventures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T19:35:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c9ebc6b-57ab-50bb-b9e6-a6b274c860cc', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c9ebc6b-57ab-50bb-b9e6-a6b274c860cc'}, {'abstract': 'A top climate strategist for the Chinese government explains the country’s stance on global warming.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/a-closer-look-at-chinas-you-first-stance-in-climate-treaty-talks/', 'snippet': 'A top climate strategist for the Chinese government explains the country’s stance on global warming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While I was in Beijng last month to talk about online communication and climate change at a conference organized by Yale and R