ede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khamenei, Ali', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rouhani, Hassan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T20:29:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c29795bc-ee50-53c9-8c9c-35d53048889b', 'word_count': 514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c29795bc-ee50-53c9-8c9c-35d53048889b'}, {'abstract': 'Negotiators may be near an accord that would impose a temporary freeze on the country’s nuclear program, but disagreements remain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/23/world/middleeast/iran-nuclear-talks.html', 'snippet': 'Negotiators may be near an accord that would impose a temporary freeze on the country’s nuclear program, but disagreements remain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — Secretary of State John Kerry planned to fly to Geneva on Friday to join the talks on imposing a temporary freeze on Iran’s nuclear program, a sign that the negotiations are edging close to an agreement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kerry to Join Iran Nuclear Talks, in Sign of Progress', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T20:33:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael R. Gordon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Gordon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b186990c-9db8-536e-8fc1-49b27699b673', 'word_count': 614, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b186990c-9db8-536e-8fc1-49b27699b673'}, {'abstract': 'Streamlined leather goods by Vianel, previously only available online, are in stock at select Barneys New York locations by Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/in-store-handsome-wallets-for-the-minimalist-at-heart/', 'snippet': 'Streamlined leather goods by Vianel, previously only available online, are in stock at select Barneys New York locations by Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': "In September, Vianel introduced a line of simple, streamlined wallets that were only available on its website (including same-day delivery service in New York City, where the brand is based). By Monday, and just in time for holiday shopping, fans of the handsome but affordable leather goods can stop into one of the 11 Barneys New York locations nationwide that will now carry them. In addition to offering Vianel’s signature cardholders, Barneys will also introduce the company’s newest styles: bifold and zip wallets, a zip pouch and folding card holders. “Our design revolves around the phrase ‘luxury is simplicity,'” says Andrew Brooks, C.E.O. of Vianel. “Why carry more than you need?” Each of the unisex, minimalist designs are branded simply with a tiny gold logo, and trimmed with an extra pop of color — cobalt blue, dove gray, oxblood — on the sides. $195 to $710; select Barneys locations and barneys.com next week.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Store | Handsome Wallets for the Minimalist at Heart', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barneys New York', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T20:37:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3ec5a0e-f302-5596-b4a8-54691a5efed9', 'word_count': 153, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3ec5a0e-f302-5596-b4a8-54691a5efed9'}, {'abstract': 'Kate Baldwin’s other stage is the house she shares with her husband and young son in Park Slope, Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/11/24/realestate/20131124-LOVE.html', 'snippet': 'Kate Baldwin’s other stage is the house she shares with her husband and young son in Park Slope, Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kate Baldwin’s other stage is the house she shares with her husband and young son in Park Slope, Brooklyn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/realestate/20131124-LOVE-slide-K2CA/20131124-LOVE-slide-K2CA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/realestate/2