 his masterwork “L’Allegro, il Penseroso ed il Moderato,” choreographed 25 years ago, on Thursday at the David H. Koch Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/23/arts/dance/mark-morris-dance-group-presents-lallegro.html', 'snippet': 'The Mark Morris Dance Group performed his masterwork “L’Allegro, il Penseroso ed il Moderato,” choreographed 25 years ago, on Thursday at the David H. Koch Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1988, Mark Morris was given the break most choreographers only dream of: a three-year residency at the Théâtre Royal de la Monnaie in Brussels, where money and resources flowed like water. He could choreograph his heart out, and he did, creating one of those rare, euphoric dances that make life worth living.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kaleidoscope of Introspection, Joy and Pastoral Tranquility', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kaleidoscope of Introspection, Joy and Pastoral Tranquility', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Morris, Mark, Dance Group', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'White Light Festival (Lincoln Center, NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Koch, David H, Theater', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-22T23:18:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/94688a20-472b-5bd5-9326-3aac6b3c697d', 'word_count':