 Ted Williams have been making bookshelves sag.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/fashion/Biographies-of-Barbara-Stanwyck-Norman-Mailer-and-Ted-Williams-are-plus-sized.html', 'snippet': 'Forget all that talk about shrinking attention spans. Lengthy biographies like those of Barbara Stanwyck, Norman Mailer and Ted Williams have been making bookshelves sag.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The book industry faces many challenges these days, but a rising cost of paper does not appear to be one of them. That, at least, is the conclusion to be drawn from the recent spate of plus-size biographies — tree-killer volumes pushing 1,000 pages — that have been making bookshelves sag. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/fashion/24BOOK1_SPAN/24BOOK1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 219, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/fashion/24BOOK1_SPAN/24BOOK1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 219}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/fashion/24BOOK1_SPAN/24BOOK1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/fashion/24BOOK1_SPAN/24BOOK1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/fashion/24BOOK1_SPAN/24BOOK1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/24/fashion/24BOOK1_SPAN/24BOOK1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.j