i': 'nyt://article/4f71415d-98d4-5247-89fa-94440b5966d4'}, {'abstract': 'France’s intervention in Mexico caught the attention of the American president in 1863.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/22/lincoln-looks-south-of-the-border/', 'snippet': 'France’s intervention in Mexico caught the attention of the American president in 1863.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In July 1863, just weeks after the twin Union victories at Gettysburg and Vicksburg, Abraham Lincoln turned his attention to the Rio Grande borderlands of Confederate Texas. On July 31, the president wrote Francis P. Blair Sr., one of his most powerful supporters, “Yesterday I commenced trying to get up an expedition for Texas. I shall do the best I can.” By November, 6,000 Union troops had landed in South Texas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lincoln Looks South of the Border', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lincoln, Abraham', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-23T01:50:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick J. Kelly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Kelly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/776716c3-3c71-5f45-ad28-3ea821615dfa', 'word_count': 1224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/776716c3-3c71-5f45-ad28-3ea821615dfa'}, {'abstract': 'The players-only meeting, a staple of losing teams everywhere, has remained an enduring tradition in professional sports, much to the disappointment of countless coaches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/23/sports/basketball/players-only-gatherings-rarely-mean-all-is-well.html', 'snippet': 'The players-only meeting, a staple of losing teams everywhere, has remained an enduring tradition in professional sports, much to the disappointment of countless coaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Chuck Daly was coaching the Orlando Magic in the late 1990s and his team was mired in a rough patch, he learned that a couple of his players were itching for a players-only meeting. Eric Musselman, one of his young assistants, recalled how Daly recruited him to relay a message to Horace Grant: permission denied.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/23/sports/CITY-LOCKER/CITY-LOCKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/23/sports/CITY-LOCKER/CITY-LOCKER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/23/sports/CITY-LOCKER/CITY-LOCKER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/23/sports/CITY-LOCKER/CITY-LOCKER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/23/sports/CITY-LOCKER/CITY-LOCKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,