y Gearon’s ‘Alphabet Book’', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gearon, Tierney', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-23T16:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jamie Bradley Sims', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jamie', 'middlename': 'Bradley', 'lastname': 'Sims', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e41935f0-215d-54ab-980c-88e5257b78a7', 'word_count': 128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e41935f0-215d-54ab-980c-88e5257b78a7'}, {'abstract': 'Nicole Bouchotte, a 61-year-old school bus matron, began making $210 less per month after she and her co-workers went on strike this year and her hours were later scaled back.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/nyregion/after-two-decades-a-shrinking-salary-at-a-job-she-loved.html', 'snippet': 'Nicole Bouchotte, a 61-year-old school bus matron, began making $210 less per month after she and her co-workers went on strike this year and her hours were later scaled back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Police cars were blocking the entrance to the bus yard in Brooklyn when Nicole Bouchotte, 61, arrived at work one day last January. It was at that moment, so early on a cold weekday morning that the sun had yet to rise, that she learned that her union, Local 1181 of the Amalgamated Transit Union, was on strike.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/nyregion/neediest--bouchotte/neediest--bouchotte-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'w