would limit filibusters, and nuclear talks between Iran and top international diplomats.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/23/sunday-breakfast-menu-nov-24/', 'snippet': 'Two stories are vying for the top slot on the Sunday shows this week – the so-called “nuclear option” in the Senate that would limit filibusters, and nuclear talks between Iran and top international diplomats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two stories are vying for the top slot on the Sunday news shows this week – one about the so-called “nuclear option” in the Senate that would limit filibusters, and the other the nuclear talks between Iran and Western nations. The potential fallout for both issues is equally dominating on the political panels this week, with in-depth discussion from experts on which sides may come out on top.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sunday Breakfast Menu, Nov. 24', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-23T21:25:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jada F. Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jada', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d6eb78a-ab95-5419-8dda-1c5009d55fc7', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d6eb78a-ab95-5419-8dda-1c5009d55fc7'}, {'abstract': 'An alpaca farmer on Martha’s Vineyard says: “My heart belongs to this island and these animals. They are home to me.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/jobs/finding-greener-pastures-for-a-career.html', 'snippet': 'An alpaca farmer on Martha’s Vineyard says: “My heart belongs to this island and these animals. They are home to me.”', 'lead_paragraph': '  ', 'print_section': 'BU'