eld void, the Yankees are said to be close to signing catcher Brian McCann to a five-year deal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/sports/baseball/yankees-are-said-to-be-near-85-million-deal-for-braves-mccann.html', 'snippet': 'Moving to close an infield void, the Yankees are said to be close to signing catcher Brian McCann to a five-year deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With uncertainty about all their infielders, the Yankees acted Saturday to solidify their catching position, agreeing in principle with Brian McCann on a five-year deal worth more than $82.5 million.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees Are Said to Be Near $85 Million Deal for Braves’ McCann', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees Are Said to Be Near $85 Million Deal for Braves’ McCann', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCann, Brian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Braves', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-24T01:44:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83359c16-9e2a-5972-8f46-7b507f6a841a', 'word_count': 599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83359c16-9e2a-5972-8f46-7b507f6a841a'}, {'abstract': 'Wisconsin’s defense forced a season-high three turnovers and limited Minnesota to 185 yards, helping the Badgers win Paul Bunyan’s Axe for the 10th straight year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/sports/ncaafootball/behind-a-defensive-wall-wisconsin-shuts-down-minnesota-for-a-10th-straight-season.html', 'snippet': 'Wisconsin’s defense forced a season-high three turnovers and limited Minnesota to 185 yards, helping the Badgers win Paul Bunyan’s Axe for the 10th straight year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — All week, Minnesota Coach Jerry Kill had warned his players about Wisconsin’s new-look defense. The 3-4 base installed by the defensive coordinator Dave Aranda, whom the first-year head coach Gary Andersen had brought with him from Utah State, made the Badgers unique in the Big Ten and even more formidable than usual, Kill said.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/wisconsin/wisconsin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/wisconsin/wisconsin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1000}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/wisconsin/wisconsin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 615, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/wisconsin/wisconsin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1229, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/wisconsin/wisconsin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbS