his client had never heard of the game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An attack on a Jewish man in Brooklyn on Friday morning was not connected to the so-called Knockout Game, where assailants try to knock someone out with one punch, a lawyer for the man charged in the case said on Saturday. But prosecutors said the victim heard the suspect, Amrit Marajh, 28, of Brooklyn, and his friends talking about the game. During the altercation, prosecutors said, Mr. Marajh said to the victim, “I’ll knock you out.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suspect Charged in Attack on Jewish Man in Brooklyn', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Faces Charges In Attack In Brooklyn', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fitzsimmons, Emma G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Borough Park (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hate Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-24T02:08:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons and Julie Turkewitz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turkewitz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53bcf76f-34e8-5db4-9ed1-e258f7217b7f', 'word_count': 375, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53bcf76f-34e8-5db4-9ed1-e258f7217b7f'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks’ struggles continued and this time, they could not contain Washington’s high-octane point guard, John Wall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/24/sports/basketball/wall-helps-wizards-hold-off-knicks-at-every-turn.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks’ struggles continued and this time, they could not contain Washington’s high-octane point guard, John Wall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Coach Mike Woodson spoke with Carmelo Anthony for a few minutes after Friday’s practice. There was no great significance to the meeting, according to Woodson, who always looks for opportunities to chat with his players. But with Anthony, who has endured more downs than ups this season, Woodson said he felt it was important “just to see where his head was.”', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/knicks/knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/knicks/knicks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/knicks/knicks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/knicks/knicks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/24/sports/knicks/knicks-thumbStandard.jpg', '