lack-box/', 'snippet': 'Why is understanding the way the world works valuable in itself, above and beyond the engineering know-how that it brings?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is something that might be worth selling your soul for: a magic black box that answers accurately any question you have about things to come. Who will be president in four years’ time? At what prices will the stock market close next Friday? What will be the precise position of the planets at midnight on that same day? When will I die?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking Into the Black Box', 'kicker': 'The Stone', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philosophy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statistics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-25T01:00:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Strevens', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strevens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d2e1fda-2ef0-5fac-8426-bb7e3421183f', 'word_count': 1513, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d2e1fda-2ef0-5fac-8426-bb7e3421183f'}, {'abstract': 'For almost three months, Monterey, Calif., and nearby coastal areas have played host to a mammoth convocation of sea life that local scientists say is unprecedented in their memories.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/25/us/with-extra-anchovies-deluxe-whale-watching.html', 'snippet': 'For almost three months, Monterey, Calif., and nearby coastal areas have played host to a mammoth convocation of sea life that local scientists say is unprecedented in their memories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONTEREY, Calif. — It began with the anchovies, miles and miles of them, their silvery blue bodies thick in the waters of Monterey Bay.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/us/ANCHOVIES-1/ANCHOVIES-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Extra Anchovies, Deluxe Whale Watching', 'kicker': 'Monterey Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Extra Anchovies, Deluxe Whale Watching', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monterey (Calif)', 'rank