'nyt://article/35ad150f-62e2-5717-a378-f7eb6e496db1'}, {'abstract': 'As the women’s game becomes more global, with six countries represented in the world top-10 rankings, the competition is becoming deeper and fiercer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/25/sports/golf/global-reach-on-display-as-lpga-ends-year.html', 'snippet': 'As the women’s game becomes more global, with six countries represented in the world top-10 rankings, the competition is becoming deeper and fiercer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAPLES, Fla. — The winner of the Titleholders on Sunday got to fire a cannon, but before Shanshan Feng of China did the honors, women’s golf sent a loud shot reverberating through the sports landscape.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Global Reach on Display as L.P.G.A. Ends Year', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Global Reach on Display As L.P.G.A. Ends Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feng, Shanshan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, Stacy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Park, Inbee', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-25T01:18:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c65632a-981a-50af-977a-f54382b6d4a2', 'word_count': 816, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c65632a-981a-50af-977a-f54382b6d4a2'}, {'abstract': 'Remotely controlled aircraft have provided valuable images of events that are difficult to reach, including the recent typhoon i