kashmirs-unrest-live-in-the-dark/', 'snippet': 'Numerous young men in Kashmir have lost one or both of their eyes after being fired at by the Indian troops and police with pellet guns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SRINAGAR — On an October afternoon I drove to Bemina, a middle-class area in Srinagar, the summer capital of Indian-administered-Kashmir. An acquaintance led me to a spacious double-storied house to meet Hayat Ashraf Dar, 21, who is one of the numerous young men in Kashmir who have lost their eyesight after being fired at by the Indian troops and police with pellet guns. Most of the injured have lost one eye. Mr. Dar had lost both.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Casualties of Kashmir’s Unrest Live in the Dark', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blindness', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Depression (Mental)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eyes and Eyesight', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Firearms', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Men and Boys', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ramadan', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delhi (India)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {