aurants and supply some of Paris’s top chefs, are at the forefront of the city’s new “haute boucherie.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'From couture to cuisine, Parisians have a passion for top-of-the-line everything, which now includes “haute boucherie.” Its two stars are Hugo Desnoyer and Yves-Marie Le Bourdonnec, who are duking it out for billing as the city’s best butcher. Desnoyer’s newest shop — his first to include an on-site table d’hôte with fabulous steaks and an extensive wine list — is housed in the same 16th Arrondissement building where he began his career 25 years ago, and he supplies some of the area’s most exalted chefs: Pascal Barbot and Pierre Gagnaire, whose restaurants both have three Michelin stars.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '60', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Food Matters | In Paris, Two Bourgeois Butchers Duke It Out for Steakhouse Supremacy', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Food Matters: France’s Bourgeois Butchers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Les Halles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-25T15:50:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Lobrano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lobrano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0226cee5-bce4-5390-902d-1f064cd4b0de', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0226cee5-bce4-5390-902d-1f064cd4b0de'}, {'abstract': 'The troubled smartphone maker said its chief operating officer and chief marketing officer were gone from the company. The chief financial officer has been replaced.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/business/international/blackberry-chief-removes-some-top-executives.html', 'snippet': 'The troubled smartphone maker said its chief operating officer and chief marketing officer were gone from the company. The chief financial officer has been replaced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — In his first move since becoming acting chief executive of BlackBerry, John S. Chen has removed several senior executives at the troubled smartphone maker, the company said Monday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/business/international/26blackberry/26blackberry-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/26/business/international/26blackberry/26blackberry-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/business/international/26blackberry/26blackberry-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/business/international/26blackberry/26blackberry-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1479, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/business/international/26blackberry/26blackberry-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/26/business/international/26blackberry/26blackberry-thumbSta