'word_count': 1149, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45276584-9c04-5aa2-a430-bfd7d7ba179e'}, {'abstract': 'Was the Union victory at Chattanooga the beginning of the end for the South?', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/25/the-battles-of-chattanooga/', 'snippet': 'Was the Union victory at Chattanooga the beginning of the end for the South?', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the North, the autumn of 1863 was a season of shattered hopes. The fall of Vicksburg and victory at Gettysburg in July had raised expectations of an end to the war before the New Year. But the Army of the Potomac had not followed up on its success, and Maj. Gen. Ulysses S. Grant saw his army carved up to support peripheral operations. Then in September, Gen. Braxton Bragg’s Army of Tennessee defeated the Army of the Cumberland at Chickamauga, 12 miles southeast of Chattanooga, Tenn., stopping the North’s progress toward Atlanta. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Battles of Chattanooga', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grant, Ulysses S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sheridan, Philip Henry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chattanooga (Tenn)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-25T17:21:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Cozzens', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cozzens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75c2bd41-0d42-57ba-852c-ab6bf9c9b070', 'word_count': 2074, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75c2bd41-0d42-57ba-852c-ab6bf9c9b070'}, {'abstract': 'Senator John Cornyn said the deal with Iran was an attempt to distract attention from the Affordable Care Act.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/25/the-health-care-distraction-conspiracy/', 'snippet': 'Senator John Cornyn said the deal with Iran was an attempt to distract attention from the Affordable Care Act.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two things happened last week that had nothing to do with the Affordable Care Act. This, Republicans say, is proof of a devious Democratic conspiracy to distract the American people from the Affordable Care Act.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Health Care ‘Distraction’ Conspiracy', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-11-25T17:25:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Juliet Lapidos', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Juliet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lapidos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f49cdaff-44ec-5990-adac-cd800d071b78', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f49cdaff-44ec-5990-adac-cd800d071b78'}, {'abstract': 'Tickets to the first Monty Python reunion performance next year in London sold out quickly, and the troupe added four more dates.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/25/monty-python-reunion-adds-four-more-shows/', 'snippet': 'Tickets to the first Monty Python reunion performance next year in London sold out quickly, and the troupe added four more dates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 20,000 tickets to Monty Python’s reunion show at the O2 Arena in London, scheduled for July 1, were snapped up in just under 45 seconds — faster than an exasperating debate at the comedy troupe’s argument clinic — the show’s organizers told the BBC on Monday. They also announced that the run would be extended.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/25/arts/25artsbeat-python/25artsbeat-python-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Monty Python Reunion Adds Four More Shows', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monty Python', 'rank': 2,