ys fit for the job.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/25/the-workout-a-woman-in-nascar/', 'snippet': 'Christmas Abbott, one of the first women to become a full-time member of a Nascar pit crew, talks about how she stays fit for the job.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you don’t think auto racing is a physically demanding sport, just ask a member of a team’s pit crew. This high-stakes job requires strength, speed and precision, as workers change 90-pound tires in a matter of seconds. We asked Christmas Abbott, 32 and one of the first women to become a full-time member of a Nascar crew, to take us through the pit crew workout. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Workout: A Woman in Nascar', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-25T21:49:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': "By Anahad O'Connor", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anahad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connor", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48319be7-f207-5d9f-a768-40d7b0421e0e', 'word_count': 1241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48319be7-f207-5d9f-a768-40d7b0421e0e'}, {'abstract': 'Jonathan Ive and Marc Newson teamed up for a design auction at Sotheby’s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/11/28/fashion/28SCENE-RED.html', 'snippet': 'Jonathan Ive and Marc Newson teamed up for a design auction at Sotheby’s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jonathan Ive and Marc Newson teamed up for a design auction at Sotheby’s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit':