ars in prison after having pleaded guilty to armed robbery. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cage Fighter Who Faked Death Is Sentenced in Armed Robbery', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fighter Who Faked Death Is Sent to Prison for Robbery', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rowan, Charles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pilon, Mary', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Michigan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Martial Arts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mixed Martial Arts', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T01:34:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1e3c9ef-362a-535b-87b6-ca7c6f5b7475', 'word_count': 388, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1e3c9ef-362a-535b-87b6-ca7c6f5b7475'}, {'abstract': 'A cadre of New York City’s transit minds are fine-tuning a pricing model to reduce congestion that might be more palatable to residents outside Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/nyregion/group-to-promote-revised-plan-for-tolls-on-east-river-bridges.html', 'snippet': 'A cadre of New York City’s transit minds are fine-tuning a pricing model to reduce congestion that might be more palatable to residents outside Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First, the name had to go.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source