d it should have first released a draft report to allow for comments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/health/heart-and-stroke-study-hit-by-a-wave-of-criticism.html', 'snippet': 'Some doctors said a panel issuing guidelines for avoiding cholesterol risks had ignored part of the available data, and they asserted it should have first released a draft report to allow for comments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was supposed to be a moment of triumph. An august committee had for the first time relied only on the most rigorous scientific evidence to formulate guidelines to prevent heart attacks and strokes, which kill one out of every three Americans. The group had worked for five years, unpaid, to develop them. Then, at the annual meeting of the American Heart Association, it all went horribly awry.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/us/CHOLESTEROL-1/CHOLESTEROL-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bumps in the Road to New Cholesterol Guidelines', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bumps in the Road to New Cholesterol Guidelines', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cholesterol', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kolata, Gina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heart', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stroke', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Statins (Cholesterol-Lowering Drugs)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN HEART ASSN', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stone, Neil J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwartz, J Sanford', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krauss, Ronald M', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T01:43:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gina Kolata', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kolata', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89cee463-8cf8-5b40-a227-1d0c154b6ab8', 'word_count': 1010, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89cee463-8cf8-5b40-a227-1d0c154b6ab8'}, {'abstract': 'New York City’s mayoral race saw a spasm of unregulated campaign money, most of it unleashed by wealthy Democrats and unions, which are now under investigation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/nyregion/spending-on-election-unleashed.html', 'snippet': 'New York City’s mayoral race saw a spasm of unregulated campaign money, most of it unleashed by wealthy Democrats and unions, which are now under investigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Well, thank God. We stumbled out of the mayoral election without watching the conservative Koch brothers grab our little liberal darlings out of their beds, paint them red and register them as Republicans.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Campaign, Cash Flowed Circuitously', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Campaign, Cash Flowed Circuitously', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Powell, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Campaign Finance Board (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Koch, David H', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ADVANCE GROUP', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Levenson, Scott', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T01:46:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Powell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Powell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63