ons', 'value': 'Reid, Alec (1931-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dalby, Douglas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Northern Ireland', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Irish Republican Army', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Priests', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T03:06:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Dalby', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dalby', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2286c57-5d06-5277-8893-1e70d5b7018a', 'word_count': 687, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2286c57-5d06-5277-8893-1e70d5b7018a'}, {'abstract': 'With a new law in effect that expands the types of suits that can be filed over profiling, the New York Police Department gave officers guidelines for stop and frisk.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/nyregion/officers-are-told-race-can-be-a-factor-in-street-stops-but-not-the-only-one.html', 'snippet': 'With a new law in effect that expands the types of suits that can be filed over profiling, the New York Police Department gave officers guidelines for stop and frisk.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The warnings had been dire: A law broadening the types of lawsuits that can be filed over accusations of police profiling would make New York City less safe. It would cut into terrorism investigations and anti-gang initiatives and make police officers wary of stopping suspects on the street.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [],