act': 'Hakeem Nicks spent last week insisting he was going to play against the Cowboys, but on game day, the Giants did not even let him warm up to see if he could play.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/sports/football/nickss-absence-against-the-cowboys-adds-to-his-perplexing-season.html', 'snippet': 'Hakeem Nicks spent last week insisting he was going to play against the Cowboys, but on game day, the Giants did not even let him warm up to see if he could play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Hakeem Nicks, struggling through a middling, enigmatic season, spent all of last week insisting he was going to play against the Dallas Cowboys on Sunday. On game day, the Giants not only kept him out of uniform, they did not even let him warm up in the hours before kickoff to see if he could play.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/26/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1407, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nicks’s Absence Against the Cowboys Adds to His Perplexing Season', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nicks’s Absence Against the Cowboys Adds to His Perplexing Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicks, Hakeem', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dallas Cowboys', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coughlin, Tom', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T03:49:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50a1b16b-c86e-579d-b4ab-d6c0c5966b7b', 'word_count': 803, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50a1b16b-c86e-579d-b4ab-d6c0c5966b7b'}, {'abstract': 'Facing an uproar from homeowners in a county that has one of the worst homeless problems in the nation, two members of the City Council have called for the city to ban the feeding of homeless people in public spaces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/us/as-homeless-line-up-for-food-los-angeles-weighs-restrictions.html', 'snippet': 'Facing an uproar from homeowners in a county that has one of the worst homeless problems in the nation, two members of the City Council have called for the city to ban the feeding of homeless people in public spaces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — They began showing up at dusk last week, wandering the streets, slumped in wheelchairs and sitting on sidewalks, paper plates perched on their knees. By 6:30 p.m., more than 100 homeless people had lined up at a barren corner in Hollywood, drawn by free meals handed out from the back of a truck every night by volunteers.', '