iddle East', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T04:02:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert F. Worth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Worth', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4348a97-1cc9-5582-8ac0-5979d943db0d', 'word_count': 1342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4348a97-1cc9-5582-8ac0-5979d943db0d'}, {'abstract': 'Government eavesdropping on a woman in India has been traced to Narendra Modi, Gujarat State’s chief minister, and it has spurred a discussion of the state’s use of surveillance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/world/asia/dispute-erupts-in-india-over-surveillance-by-candidate.html', 'snippet': 'Government eavesdropping on a woman in India has been traced to Narendra Modi, Gujarat State’s chief minister, and it has spurred a discussion of the state’s use of surveillance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — In a set of telephone transcripts and recordings that were published by an Indian website this month, high-ranking intelligence and security officers from the western state of Gujarat can be heard reporting back on an unusual assignment: covertly tracing every movement of a young woman, meticulously documenting her contacts with men. Their findings were passed to another high-ranking official they referred to as “Saheb.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1320, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/world/INDIA-1/INDIA-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dispute Erupts in India Over Surveillance by Candidate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dispute Erupts in India Over Surveillance by Candidate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kumar, Hari', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gujarat State (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T04:14:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_n