ations with Mr. Binder for the last few months, and he has also lined up one of the few Broadway theaters still available for the spring season. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Franco and O’Dowd Confirmed for ‘Of Mice and Men’ on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franco, James', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Dowd, Chris", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Longacre Theater (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T05:01:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8fb0fef3-cd05-5e28-8b99-b7a01d2ac63a', 'word_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8fb0fef3-cd05-5e28-8b99-b7a01d2ac63a'}, {'abstract': 'Tax reform is needed to end the practice of many American corporations of stashing cash abroad, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/effective-corporate-tax-rates/', 'snippet': 'Tax reform is needed to end the practice of many American corporations of stashing cash abroad, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bruce Bartlett held senior policy roles in the Reagan and George H.W. Bush administrations and served on the staffs of Representatives Jack Kemp and Ron Paul. He is the author of “The Benefit and the Burden: Tax Reform — Why We Need It and What It Will Take.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Effective Corporate Tax Rates', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker