 'word_count': 1096, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1301ae0e-11a1-554a-9c53-ecb4666fa626'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, who faces re-election next year, is viewed favorably by 62 percent of state voters, according to Quinnipiac University.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/27/nyregion/most-new-york-voters-happy-with-cuomo-poll-finds.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, who faces re-election next year, is viewed favorably by 62 percent of state voters, according to Quinnipiac University.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With no declared Republican candidate, Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo is approaching his re-election year with an enviable approval rating and a comfortable advantage against one potential opponent, according to a poll released on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Most New York Voters Happy With Cuomo, Poll Finds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Quinnipiac University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T17:21:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse McKinley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c2ce750-9394-531a-a444-0c8c8684fb4a', 'word_count': 289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c2ce750-9394-531a-a444-0c8c8684fb4a'}, {'abstract': 'Soup, sandwiches and a sofa are just three parts of a budget-friendly stay in the Chilean capital.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/travel/a-100-weekend-in-santiago-chile.html', 'snippet': 'Soup, sandwiches and a sofa are just three parts of a budget-friendly stay in the Chilean capital.', 'lead_paragraph': '“My sofa is very comfortable,” boasted Marcos, the pony-tailed, Iron Maiden-loving Chilean who had met me at the centrally located Parque O’Higgins metro stop in the Chilean capital of Santiago and was walking me to his place. “I sometimes sleep on it myself.” When you have just $100 to spend all weekend, any place will do — but his worn-in black leather sofa, paired with a thick comforter for warmth and a snow-white cat named Ixi (named for Itchy, the “Simpsons” cartoon mouse) for company, turned out to be a dream.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/travel/01-frugal-span-sf/01-frugal-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/01/travel/01-frugal-span-sf/01-frugal-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/travel/01-frugal-span-sf/01-frugal-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/travel/01-frugal-span-sf/01-frugal-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/travel/01-frugal-span-sf/01-frugal-span-sf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/01/trav