1148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4576f1d-52c2-58e4-8dab-543b07ae05f6'}, {'abstract': 'Discovery of one great Instagram photographer leads to the discovery of another one, then another . . .', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/down-the-instagram-rabbit-hole/', 'snippet': 'Discovery of one great Instagram photographer leads to the discovery of another one, then another . . .', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stacey Baker, magazine photo editor and Instagram dynamo, has been getting so much attention for her portraits of women’s legs that she gets approached by\xa0fans offline. One time a tourist spotted her taking a “legs” shot and asked, “Are you @stace_a_lace?” The woman had worn special tights that day on her visit to New York hoping to be photographed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Down the Instagram Rabbit Hole', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Instagram Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T17:45:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Maya Lau', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Maya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lau', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d49d236-d286-5f36-bd9e-5d221c30963b', 'word_count': 324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d49d236-d286-5f36-bd9e-5d221c30963b'}, {'abstract': 'Proceeds from “Songs for the Philippines,” a 39-track compilation, will go toward relief efforts in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/from-the-beatles-to-lorde-musicians-offer-songs-for-philippine-relief-album/', 'snippet': 'Proceeds from “Songs for the Philippines,” a 39-track compilation, will go toward relief efforts in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than three dozen musicians representing a broad range of pop styles — from the Beatles, Bob Dylan, U2 and Earth, Wind and Fire, at the classic end, to Lorde, Beyoncé, Justin Bieber and Katy Perry, among more recent hit makers — have contributed recordings to “Songs for the Philippines,” a 39-track compilation assembled to raise money for relief efforts in the country, which was devastated by Typhoon Haiyan on Nov. 8. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26typhoon/26typhoon-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'l