all/for-knicks-and-nets-a-good-time-to-be-bad.html', 'snippet': 'Anyone writing them off has not been paying attention to the Eastern Conference, where nine teams with losing records have made the playoffs during the past 10 seasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.B.A. season is still in its infancy, but it feels like ages ago when the Nets were celebrated for adding two potential Hall of Famers and the Knicks received at least a few pats on the back for acquiring a sweet-shooting 7-footer who was once a No. 1 overall pick.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1459, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/27score1/27score1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Good May Come on Heels of Bad and Ugly for Knicks and Nets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Good May Come on Heels of Bad and Ugly for Knicks and Nets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brooklyn Nets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spoelstra, Erik', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bargnani, Andrea', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garnett, Kevin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pierce, Paul (1977- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-26T21:06:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/80658a19-11de-53b0-8d71-fc4b8d439db7', 'word_count': 811, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80658a19-11de-53b0-8d71-fc4b8d439db7'}, {'abstract': 'How do you choose who you think is the greatest soccer player in the world? Read on.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/messi-or-ronaldo.html', 'snippet': 'How do you choose who you think is the greatest soccer player in the world? Read on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After Cristiano Ronaldo’s third goal against Sweden in the World Cup qualifying playoffs in Stockholm, the camera panned the crowd. The Swedish fans had a look of despair. It wasn’t even anger or frustration, simply pure despair. It was what I imagine the ancient Greeks looked like in myths when tragedy struck at the hands of the gods — pained, but resigned to the fact that the destruction was not the work of an Earthly power.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 341}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 582, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/sports/soccer/27yael1/27yael1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Messi or Ronaldo?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ronaldo, Cristiano', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Messi, Lionel',