4a7b11', 'word_count': 610, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91b83561-0fac-506f-91d4-b987144a7b11'}, {'abstract': 'The artist Ryan McNamara received the Malcolm McLaren Award, given for the “most innovative and thought-provoking performance” during the performance art biennial.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/26/ryan-mcnamara-wins-performa-13-prize/', 'snippet': 'The artist Ryan McNamara received the Malcolm McLaren Award, given for the “most innovative and thought-provoking performance” during the performance art biennial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Performa 13, the fifth iteration of New York’s performance art biennial, concluded its three-week run on Sunday with a Grand Finale celebration during which the artist Ryan McNamara received the second Malcolm McLaren Award. Sponsored by the Vinyl Factory and accompanied by a $10,000 cash prize, the award was established in 2011 to honor the British artist, musician, clothing designer and impresario Malcolm McLaren, who died that year. According to a Performa statement, it is given “to an artist who demonstrates the most innovative and thought-provoking performance during the biennial.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26artsbeat-performa/26artsbeat-performa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 507, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26artsbeat-performa/26artsbeat-performa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 507}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26artsbeat-performa/26artsbeat-performa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 866, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/26/arts/26artsbeat-performa/26a