e': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5bdcd2ba-f17f-55e9-a7df-d0422275018f', 'word_count': 445, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5bdcd2ba-f17f-55e9-a7df-d0422275018f'}, {'abstract': 'Welch’s, the grape juice maker, is encouraging users of the Vine video-sharing app to participate in a promotion it has created to distribute the company’s products to impoverished American families.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/27/business/media/finding-holiday-good-will-in-glasses-of-juice.html', 'snippet': 'Welch’s, the grape juice maker, is encouraging users of the Vine video-sharing app to participate in a promotion it has created to distribute the company’s products to impoverished American families.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WELCH’S most essential ingredient comes from vines, so it’s fitting that for a new cause-marketing effort the grape products brand is turning to Vine, the mobile app for sharing six-second video clips. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/business/ADCO/ADCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 454, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/27/business/ADCO/ADCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 454}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/business/ADCO/ADCO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 775, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/27/business/ADCO/ADCO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1550, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None