'lead_paragraph': 'I have always found it reassuring to see New Jersey Transit’s striped Access Link vans motoring around my suburban town and to spot New York City’s Access-a-Ride vehicles criss-crossing Manhattan. Elderly and disabled people I know have used them, and while they have sometimes grumbled about having to wait too long for pick-ups, the vans have taken them where they needed to go.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paratransit: Stuck in the Slow Lane', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMERICANS WITH DISABILITIES ACT', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elder Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transit Systems', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-27T16:02:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paula Span', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Span', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/301f4c46-a675-5216-9332-c17342869a4a', 'word_count': 629, 'uri': 'nyt://article/301f4c46-a675-5216-9332-c17342869a4a'}, {'abstract': 'A rare collision of ill-timed rain, wild animals, and a growing love affair between China and the pecan has led to the worst supply in years, and grocery store prices are up by about 30 percent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/28/us/hold-the-pecans-on-the-thanksgiving-pie.html', 'snippet': 'A rare collision of ill-timed rain, wild animals, and a growing love affair between China and the pecan has led to the worst supply in years, and grocery store prices are up by about 30 percent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OCILLA, Ga. —