': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e00ba3b9-5119-5765-ad6c-82a342abed93', 'word_count': 369, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e00ba3b9-5119-5765-ad6c-82a342abed93'}, {'abstract': 'Silvio Berlusconi, Italy’s once-powerful former prime minister, was stripped of his seat on Wednesday, leaving him without elective office for the first time in about two decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/28/world/europe/berlusconi-expelled-from-senate-in-italy.html', 'snippet': 'Silvio Berlusconi, Italy’s once-powerful former prime minister, was stripped of his seat on Wednesday, leaving him without elective office for the first time in about two decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Having spent months manufacturing procedural delays and conjuring political melodrama in hopes of saving himself, Silvio Berlusconi could no longer stave off the inevitable: Italy’s Senate stripped him of his parliamentary seat on Wednesday, a dramatic and humiliating expulsion, even as other potential troubles await him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/world/28berlusconi2/28berlusconi2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/28/world/28berlusconi2/28berlusconi2-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/world/28berlusconi2/28berlusconi2-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/world/28berlusconi2/28berlusconi2-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 136