32e8609fcffc', 'word_count': 1067, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94d9d91f-8727-5400-96c6-32e8609fcffc'}, {'abstract': 'Serge Schmemann moderates a discussion about aging with Sarah Harper, Babatunde Osotimehin and Ruby Wax.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/28/opinion/do-i-dare-to-eat-a-peach.html', 'snippet': 'Serge Schmemann moderates a discussion about aging with Sarah Harper, Babatunde Osotimehin and Ruby Wax.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This discussion was held in London in partnership with the lecture curator 5x15. The moderator was Serge Schmemann, editor of the Magazine. The participants were Sarah Harper, a British gerontologist and founder of the Oxford Institute of Population Aging; Babatunde Osotimehin, a physician and former Nigerian minister of health who is executive director of UNFPA, the United Nations Populations Fund; and Ruby Wax, an American-born, London-based comedian, writer, TV personality and mental-health campaigner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/opinion/28tp-conversation/28tp-conversation-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/28/opinion/28tp-conversation/28tp-conversation-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/opinion/28tp-conversation/28tp-conversation-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/opinion/28tp-conversation/28tp-conversation-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 896, 'width': 1280, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '