s who appreciate the buttered baguettes they remember from West Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/nyregion/west-african-customers-get-a-taste-of-home-at-la-tropezienne.html', 'snippet': 'After more than 20 years, La Tropezienne continues to pack in customers, many of them immigrant cabbies who appreciate the buttered baguettes they remember from West Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The customers at La Tropezienne packed in tightly near the counter on a recent Sunday morning, bundled in coats and gently shouting over one another. Babacar Mbaye, 40, gave an assertive “Hello!” in order to be noticed. Originally from Gambia, he said he drove his cab to this little bakery and patisserie in East Harlem mainly for the coffee (but also for three croissants: two chocolate, one cinnamon).', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU/20131201JOINTss-slide-XRWU-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2