ying to flee the country after he came under investigation in a corruption case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Renmin University of China, in Beijing, one of the leading centers of higher learning in the country, conferred its first degrees this year in a new graduate program in combating corruption. Future classes now have a case study close to home to draw from.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corruption Scandal Hits One of China’s Top Universities', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Commission for Discipline Inspection (Communist Party of China)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chongqing (China)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shenzhen (China)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T09:56:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Austin Ramzy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Austin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ramzy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ba0d9cf-287f-5717-a9e7-fcc369446be6', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ba0d9cf-287f-5717-a9e7-fcc369446be6'}, {'abstract': 'Opportunity is the bright star of the immigrant story. Its black sun is displacement and loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/opinion/cohen-the-quest-to-belong.html', 'snippet': 'Opportunity is the bright star of the immigrant story. Its black sun is displacement and loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a grandchild about to be born in Atlanta, another on the way in Ho Chi Minh City, I have been thinking about the beginning of the family odyssey; of my great-grandfather, Isaac Michel, and his decision to leave the shtetl in northern Lithuania and head south from Russian pogroms toward the sun, the ostrich feathers, the gold and the promise of South Africa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '39', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/cohen-circular/cohen-circular-articleLarge-v2.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/cohen-circular/cohen-circular-articleLarge-v2.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/cohen-circular/cohen-circular-jumbo-v4.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/cohen-circular/cohen-circular-superJumbo-v4.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/cohen-circular/cohen-circular-thumbStandard-v4.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/cohen-circular/cohen-circular-thumbStandard-v4.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '