ichael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6720e31b-78d7-5cf1-b4d0-165b6820d093', 'word_count': 227, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6720e31b-78d7-5cf1-b4d0-165b6820d093'}, {'abstract': 'With saunas, a pool and a specialty food bar, the soon-to-open Akasha Holistic Wellbeing Centre at London’s Cafe Royal hotel is seriously in sync with the elements.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/28/on-beauty-a-london-spa-that-is-one-with-nature/', 'snippet': 'With saunas, a pool and a specialty food bar, the soon-to-open Akasha Holistic Wellbeing Centre at London’s Cafe Royal hotel is seriously in sync with the elements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Each of the four areas of the David Chipperfield-designed Akasha Holistic Wellbeing Centre, opening on Dec. 9 in London’s Café Royal hotel — a favorite among the likes of Miuccia Prada and L’Wren Scott — corresponds to a natural element: water (Watsu pool), fire (Canadian hemlock saunas), air (personalized yoga) and earth (a food bar that serves Champagne). ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Beauty | A London Spa That Is One With Nature', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T16:34:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c47c2184-a459-5574-a383-6b81a117f2d7', 'word_count': 59, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c47c2184-a459-5574-a383-6b81a117f2d7'}, {'abstract': '“The Year of the Rooster,” the critically lauded play, will come back to the Ensemble Studio Theater in January.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/28/fighting-rooster-returns-to-ensemble-studio-theater/', 'snippet': '“The Year of the Rooster,” the critically lauded play, will come back to the Ensemble Studio Theater in January.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Odysseus Rex the Rooster is back. “The Year of the Rooster,” the critically lauded play about cockfighting by the 25-year-old playwright Eric Dufault, featuring Bobby Moreno as the central gladiatorial bird, will return to the Ensemble Studio Theater for a four-week run, Jan. 9 through Feb. 2, after a run this fall that Neil Genzlinger writing in The Times called “astonishingly entertaining.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/arts/rooster/rooster-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/28/arts/rooster/rooster-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/arts/rooster/rooster-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/arts/rooster/rooster-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/arts/rooster/rooster-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'sub