lm set among Greenwich Village musicians in the early 1960s, is poised to generate a tidal wave of nostalgia — and stir interest among moviegoers who were unfamiliar with this milieu. It’s a safe bet that anyone who sees the film (opening next Friday) will want to know more about the folkie world that the Coens recreate so wittily and well. There are great ways to read, see and hear more about it. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 616, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 616}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 997, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1882, 'width': 1832, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/arts/29MASLINGIFTGUIDE/MASLINGIFTGUIDE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType