’s stately screen biography of Nelson Mandela, the British actor Idris Elba conveys the agony as well as the nobility of Mr. Mandela’s quest for South African racial equality. Much of that pain is suppressed rage at the cruelty and injustice of apartheid. As Mr. Mandela looks beyond the fury of the moment and calculates the cost of urging violence, you sense his frustration at having to make the only reasonable choice and taking the high road. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The High Road Through a Struggle Is Never Easy to Navigate', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'Mandela'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The High Road Through a Struggle Is Never Easy to Navigate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elba, Idris', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chadwick, Justin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicholson, William', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Naomie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mandela, Nelson', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T22:02:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/2aaa7e9a-0d89-5d88-9353-dea747761d7f', 'word_count': 765, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2aaa7e9a-0d89-5d88-9353-dea747761d7f'}, {'abstract': 'A listing of exhibitions, literary talks, cultural and holiday-related events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/arts/spare-times-for-nov-29-dec-5.html', 'snippet': 'A listing of exhibitions, literary talks, cultural and holiday-related events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Holiday Lighting Displays\xa0(Friday through Thursday) Switches will be flipped — or oil lamps lit — in the coming week for Hanukkah and Christmas displays. Since 1977, the Lubavitch Youth Organization has sponsored the lighting of a menorah at Grand Army Plaza, at Fifth Avenue and 59th Street. The menorah will be lit at various times daily through Thursday. An outdoor party accompanying Sunday’s lighting, at 5:30 p.m., will feature music, dancing and latkes. More information: (718) 953-1000.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '39', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare Times for Nov. 29-Dec. 5', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spare Times', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T22:05:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Mancuso', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mancuso', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/a50478fa-0544-56ac-a5e3-a5013af3c675', 'word_count': 2909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a50478fa-0544-56ac-a5e3-a5013af3c675'}, {'abstract': 'The charges against Anatoly E. Serdyukov reflect a rift in the coterie of officials surrounding President Vladimir V. Putin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/world/europe/russian-investigators-charge-former-putin-ally.html', 'snippet': 'The charges against Anatoly E. Serdyukov reflect a rift in the coterie of officials surrounding President Vladimir V. Putin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Russian investigators on Thursday charged a former minister of defense, Anatoly E. Serdyukov, with negligence for ordering the Russian military to build a road from a village to a private country residence in the south.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 772, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1544, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/29/world/europe/29serdyukov-img/29serdyukov-img-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Charges Ex-Defense Minister Over a Road Project', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia Charges Ex-Defense Minister Over a Road Project', 'name': None, 'seo': Non