he town of Hot Springs in the Black Hills of South Dakota. On the 28th, the bison were taken overland in their crates 11 more miles and released onto native grassland. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Bison Centennial', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Bison Centennial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bison', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANIMALS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conservation of Resources', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T22:51:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/52027d81-48bd-5b43-9861-2b8e57094fa2', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52027d81-48bd-5b43-9861-2b8e57094fa2'}, {'abstract': 'A provocative new study says the F.D.A. vastly underestimated the impact such warnings would have in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/opinion/the-power-of-cigarette-warning-labels.html', 'snippet': 'A provocative new study says the F.D.A. vastly underestimated the impact such warnings would have in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A provocative new study has suggested that the Food and Drug Administration greatly underestimated how much graphic warning labels on cigarette packs reduced the rate of smoking among Canadians. As a result, the study says, the F.D.A. vastly underestimated the impact such warnings would have in the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Power of Cigarette Warning Labels', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Power of Cigarette Warning Labels', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labeling and Labels', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Waterloo', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Illinois', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T22:51:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e39455bc-fcef-5f63-9185-623b72a13dcc', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e39455bc-fcef-5f63-9185-623b72a13dcc'}, {'abstract': 'Faced with Russia’s anger, President Yanukovich suspends trade talks with Europe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/opinion/ukraine-backs-down.html', 'snippet': 'Faced with Russia’s anger, President Yanukovich suspends trade talks with Europe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is difficult to sympathize in any way with Ukraine’s corrupt and cynical president, Viktor Yanukovich, but the choice before him was indeed nasty. To sign an association and free-trade agreement with the European Union was to invite brutal Russian economic punishment, which Ukraine’s badly suffering economy is in no shape to absorb. Europe could only offer medium- to long-term advantages. Not signing, however, inevitably meant protests in Ukraine, whose population has consistently expressed support for European integration. Sure enough, tens of thousands of Ukrainians took to the streets as soon as their government announced last week that it was suspending negotiations with the European Union. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ukraine Backs Down', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ukraine Backs Down', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yanukovich, Viktor F', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T22:51:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5c9d41e-a02a-5b95-8649-66d63d710336', 'word_count': 442, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5c9d41e-a02a-5b95-8649-66d63d710336'}, {'abstract': 'Can Republicans actually gum up the gears of Congress any more than they already have?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/opinion/government-in-slow-motion.html', 'snippet': 'Can Republicans actually gum up the gears of Congress any more than they already have?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, in a fit of fury after they lost the ability to filibuster President Obama’s nominees, several Congressional Republicans threatened to retaliate by slowing things down on Capitol Hill. Democrats “will have trouble in a lot of areas because there’s going to be a lot of anger,” said Senator John McCain, Republican of Arizona, specifically warning that a United Nations disability treaty was now in danger of being rejected for the second time.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Government in Slow Motion', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Government in Slow Motion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Filibusters and Debate Curbs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-28T22:51:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/835d33c5-b1fa-5fcb-821a-398340f62f04', 'word_count': 542, 'uri': 'nyt://article/835d33c5-b1fa-5fcb-821a-398340f62f04'}, {'abstract': '“Pad Yatra: A Green Odyssey” documents a trek through the Himalayas by a large group of people whose eco-friendly intentions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/movies/a-long-walk-for-glaciers.html', 'snippet': '“Pad Yatra: A Green Odyssey” documents a trek through the Himalayas by a large group of people whose eco-friendly intentions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Opens on Friday in Manhattan.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 