to Colin Russell, the last of the 30 people on a Greenpeace International ship seized in September after a protest in the Arctic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/world/europe/russia-court-grants-bail-to-last-detainee-in-greenpeace-case.html', 'snippet': 'A court in St. Petersburg granted bail on Thursday to Colin Russell, the last of the 30 people on a Greenpeace International ship seized in September after a protest in the Arctic.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The last of the 30 people on board the Greenpeace International ship seized in September after a protest against oil drilling in the Arctic was granted bail on Thursday. A court in St. Petersburg had initially ordered the crew member, Colin Russell of Australia, held for 90 more days, even as the others were released on bail of roughly $60,000 each. The foreign crew members, from 17 countries, are now required to remain in St. Petersburg as the investigation on charges of hooliganism continues. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia: Court Grants Bail to Last Detainee in Greenpeace Case', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia: Court Grants Bail to Free Last Detainee in Greenpeace Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'St Petersburg (Russia)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Greenpeace', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARCTIC REGIONS', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Offshore Drilling and Exploration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Russell, Colin', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_da