. Snowden describe surveillance during a summit meeting of world leaders in Canada in June 2010.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/world/americas/ire-in-canada-over-report-nsa-spied-from-ottawa.html', 'snippet': 'Documents leaked by Edward J. Snowden describe surveillance during a summit meeting of world leaders in Canada in June 2010.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OTTAWA — Canadian opposition politicians expressed shock and anger on Thursday over a report that the National Security Agency conducted widespread surveillance during a summit meeting of world leaders in Canada in June 2010.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ire in Canada Over Report N.S.A. Spied From Ottawa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ire in Canada Over Report N.S.A. Spied From Ottawa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Group of Eight', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Group of Twenty', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ottawa (Ontario)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Toronto (Ontario)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wiretapping and Other Eavesdropping Devices and Methods', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communications Security Establishment Canada', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Canadian Broadcasting Corp', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {