, 'snippet': 'President Viktor F. Yanukovich of Ukraine, who last week ditched plans to sign trade agreements with the European Union, found himself confronted by the Chancellor Angela Merkel of Germany.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VILNIUS, Lithuania — Undoubtedly, it was an uncomfortable moment. President Viktor F. Yanukovich of Ukraine, who last week ditched plans to sign far-reaching political and trade agreements with the European Union, found himself confronted Thursday night by the German chancellor, Angela Merkel, and by the host of a summit meeting here, President Dalia Grybauskaite of Lithuania.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/world/europe/Ukraine-refer/Ukraine-refer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/30/world/europe/Ukraine-refer/Ukraine-refer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/world/europe/Ukraine-refer/Ukraine-refer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/world/europe/Ukraine-refer/Ukraine-refer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1501, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/world/europe/Ukraine-refer/Ukraine-refer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/30/world/europe/Ukraine-refer/Ukraine-refer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'