th Asian restaurants in Britain says more about the country’s prejudices than its palate.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/the-threat-to-british-curry/', 'snippet': 'The travails of South Asian restaurants in Britain says more about the country’s prejudices than its palate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Upon first moving here from Pakistan two years ago, I was inundated with restaurant recommendations: Tayyabs and Lahore Kebab House, Daawat and Brilliant. I spent many weekends sampling curries and kebabs in the east and halwa in the south. In the end, I settled on a Drummond Street standby.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Threat to British Curry', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The British Threat To Curry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cameron, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-29T13:50:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Huma Yusuf', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Huma', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yusuf', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c5505441-3e29-516e-acdc-e1d878cc29a3', 'word_count': 480, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c5505441-3e29-516e-acdc-e1d878cc29a3'}, {'abstract': 'A report from the United Nations refugee agency warned of a generation “traumatized, isolated and suffering” as a result of the Syrian conflict.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/11/30/world/middleeast/united-nations-syrian-refugee-children.html',