ering an attack on the Bolshoi Ballet’s artistic director, be sentenced to nine years in a labor camp.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/at-bolshoi-trial-prosecutors-ask-for-sentence-in-labor-camp/', 'snippet': 'Russian prosecutors asked that Pavel Dmitrichenko, accused of ordering an attack on the Bolshoi Ballet’s artistic director, be sentenced to nine years in a labor camp.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW —Russian prosecutors on Friday requested a sentence of nine years in a labor camp for Pavel Dmitrichenko, once a star Bolshoi Ballet dancer, who is charged with ordering an acid attack that disfigured and nearly blinded the company’s artistic director, Sergei Filin.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Bolshoi Trial, Prosecutors Ask for Sentence in Labor Camp', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACIDS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dmitrichenko, Pavel V', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Filin, Sergei', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bolshoi Theater', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-29T14:42:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Reevell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reevell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d8b093e-14df-5cf6-8d13-d063ce93fb4c', 'word_count': 187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d8b093e-14df-5cf6-8d13-d063ce93fb4c'}, {'abstract': 'Entering its 38th year, the Spoleto Festival USA announced its 2014 schedule in Charleston, S.C., which will feature 152 performances of opera, music, theater and dance from May 23 through June 8.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/spoleto-festival-will-include-new-john-adams-opera/', 'snippet': 'Entering its 38th year, the Spoleto Festival USA announced its 2014 schedule in Charleston, S.C., which will feature 152 performances of opera, music, theater and dance from May 23 through June 8.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Entering its 38th year, the Spoleto Festival USA announced the schedule for its 2014 iteration in Charleston, S.C., which will feature 152 performances of opera, music, theater and dance from May 23 through June 8. The festival will include a new production of John Adams’ opera “El Niño.” Janacek’s “Kat’a Kabanova,” will be staged, directed by Garry Hynes, who in 1998 became the first woman to win a Tony, for her production of “The Beauty Queen of Leenane.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spoleto Festival Will Include New John Adams Opera', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spoleto Festival USA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Charleston (SC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Carolina', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-29T14:59:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organiza