 “Blithe Spirit” when she returns to the London stage for the first time in nearly 40 years.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/11/29/angela-lansbury-returning-to-london-stage-in-blithe-spirit/', 'snippet': 'Angela Lansbury will reprise her Tony-winning performance in “Blithe Spirit” when she returns to the London stage for the first time in nearly 40 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a four-decade absence from the London stage Angela Lansbury, best known for her portrayals of the detective Jessica Fletcher in the television series “Murder, She Wrote” and the murderous pie-maker in “Sweeney Todd,” plans to make her return in March in a new production of the  Noël Coward comedy “Blithe Spirit.” \xa0She will reprise her portrayal of Madame Arcati, the medium who communicates with Elvira, the deceased ex-wife of the novelist Charles Condomine. She won a Tony Award when she played the role on Broadway in 2009. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Angela Lansbury Returning to London Stage in ‘Blithe Spirit’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coward, Noel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lansbury, Angela', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-29T17:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00393917-1d6e-506e-a1ee-57489e99ef74', 'word_count': 248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00393917-1d6e-506e-a1ee-57489e99ef74'}, {'a