t,” Ms. Barr said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/fashion/roseanne-barr-and-mindy-kaling-funny-women-serious-talk.html', 'snippet': 'They sat at a table usually reserved for Nancy Reagan, which prompted a brief discussion about whether either wanted to be first lady. “I’d rather be president,” Ms. Barr said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ON A RECENT Saturday, the weather California-perfect, Roseanne Barr, the star and co-creator of the groundbreaking sitcom “Roseanne,” which ran on ABC from October 1988 to May 1997 (and now in heavy rotation on TVLand), and Mindy Kaling, the TV writer and actress (“The Office”), best-selling author (“Is Everybody Hanging Out Without Me?”) and now the creator and star of “The Mindy Project” on Fox, met for lunch at the Hotel Bel-Air in Los Angeles.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/fashion/01TABLE1_SPAN/01TABLE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/01/fashion/01TABLE1_SPAN/01TABLE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/fashion/01TABLE1_SPAN/01TABLE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/fashion/01TABLE1_SPAN/01TABLE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/fashion/01TABLE1_SPAN/01TABLE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar