kl would have none of it. “Sir, if this is so,” he cried, jumping out of his chair, “then what can be the meaning of life?” ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1257, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1257}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 489, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 978, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01GENYsub/01GENYsub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Millennial Searchers', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Millennial Searchers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Emily Esfahani', 'rank': 1, 