in compensation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Big-ticket weapons like aircraft carriers and the F-35 fighter jet have to be part of any conversation about cutting Pentagon spending to satisfy the mandatory budget reductions known as the sequester. But compensation for military personnel has to be on the table, too — even though no other defense issue is more politically volatile or emotionally fraught. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Putting Military Pay on the Table', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Putting Military Pay on the Table', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hagel, Chuck', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-30T20:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3aef94b9-2738-5654-96e2-de572eb7e642', 'word_count': 632, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3aef94b9-2738-5654-96e2-de572eb7e642'}, {'abstract': 'Plaintiffs challenging a Wisconsin law offer strong evidence of racially discriminatory effects.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/opinion/sunday/voter-id-gets-another-day-in-court.html', 'snippet': 'Plaintiffs challenging a Wisconsin law offer strong evidence of racially discriminatory effects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal trial in Milwaukee on Wisconsin’s 2011 voter ID law concluded recently, and the verdict, when it comes, will help define the future of the Voting Rights Act, which has been in question since the Supreme Court gutted a core provision, Section 5, in June. This case could also set an important precedent for lawsuits recently filed against similar laws in Texas and North Carolina. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Voter ID Gets Another Day in Court', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Voter ID Gets Another Day in Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting Rights Act (1965)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Wisconsin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-11-30T20:30:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c636752-423a-55d1-b6b5-5717cb18e1c9', 'word_count': 591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c636752-423a-55d1-b6b5-5717cb18e1c9'}, {'abstract': 'My family, like many others in the city, seeks ways to carry on.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/opinion/sunday/years-of-mourning-the-losses-in-mumbai.html', 'snippet': 'My family, like many others in the city, seeks ways to carry on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT’S hard to believe that five years have passed since terrorists attacked Mumbai on Nov. 26, 2008, the date everyone in India knows as 26/11. More than 160 people were killed. Two of the victims were my cousin Reshma Parekh and her husband, Sunil. They were gunned down as they waited for a table at Tiffin restaurant in the Oberoi Hotel. They died within hours of the attackers’ arrival in the city, but their deaths were not confirmed until the hotel was finally wrested from the gunmen’s control two days later.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/sunday-review/01editorial1/01editorial1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Years of Mourning the Losses in Mumbai', 'kicker': 'Editorial | Sunday Observer', 'co